window.TMD=window.TMD||{};TMD["S07"]=[{"z":"致老师","t":"To The Teachers","k":"text","p":[2,3],"b":[["h2","To The Teachers","致老师",0],["p","You're probably wondering whether or not you need to use this book. If you are going to be teaching S7, then the answer is \"Yes!\" If you are a new teacher, you should read the first portion of this book very carefully. If you have been teaching for a while, it 's a useful tool for you to brush up on your teaching practices, so a quick review will sharpen your skills. Note: We hope you will get your students into the habit of speaking English during class. Teach them by setting a good example. Avoid using Chinese to teach English. Use English to teach English.","你可能在想自己是否需要用这本书。如果你要教 S7，答案是“需要！”如果你是新老师，请非常仔细地阅读本书的前半部分。如果你已经教了一段时间，这本书是帮你温习教学方法的好工具，快速浏览一遍就能让你的技巧更纯熟。注意：希望你能让学生养成在课堂上说英语的习惯。以身作则来教他们，避免用中文教英语，用英语教英语。",0],["h2","How To Teach S7","如何教 S7",0],["h3","● Teaching Materials: Introduction","● 教材介绍",0],["p","There are two series, the S series (See It & Say It) and the EEC series (Easy English Conversation). They are designed to help students learn English with confidence. Here is a quick guide to the S Series:","我们有两个系列，S 系列（See It & Say It）和 EEC 系列（Easy English Conversation），目的是帮助学生有自信地学英语。以下是 S 系列的快速指南：",0],["h2","S Series","S 系列",0],["h3","● Student's Books","● 学生用书",0],["p","Classroom Readers 7 Classroom Activities 7A and 7B Homework Exercises 7A and 7B","Classroom Readers 7（课堂读本）　Classroom Activities 7A、7B（课堂活动）　Homework Exercises 7A、7B（家庭作业）",0],["h3","● Progress Report Book","● 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["p","Today's Lesson Evaluation Sheet","今日课程（Today's Lesson）、评估表（Evaluation Sheet）",0],["h3","● VCD/MP3",null,0],["p","S SeriesClassroom Readers, Classroom Activities, Homework Exercises,","S 系列 Classroom Readers、Classroom Activities、Homework Exercises",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheets","● 评估本",0],["p","Listening labs Quizzes Tests Activity Sheets The S series has twelve levels. It consists of five books:","听力练习、小测验、考试、活动单　S 系列共有十二级，每级包含五本书：",0],["p","Classroom Reader 7, Classroom Activities 7A and 7B, (used in the classroom), and Homework Exercises 7A and 7B (intended for home use). These materials have a three-month (24 session) time span in which to be completed. There are fifteen lessons, three Review Days, three Review Days and three Game/Activity days. This teacher's manual gives teachers a clear presentation for each lesson and informs teachers of the pace, grammar, communication, and phonetic objectives. Each lesson, time permitting, should include an activity(-ies) based on that day's lesson or as a review of previous lessons. It is important to read this section thoroughly before teaching Lesson 1.","Classroom Reader 7、Classroom Activities 7A 和 7B（课堂使用），以及 Homework Exercises 7A 和 7B（回家使用）。这套教材要在三个月（24 堂课）内完成，包含十五课、三次复习日、三次复习日和三次游戏／活动日。这本教师手册为每一课提供清楚的教学呈现，并告诉老师进度、语法、沟通与发音目标。时间许可的话，每一课都应包含根据当天课程或复习前几课所设计的活动。在教第 1 课之前，务必详读这一部分。",0],["h3","● Classroom Readers: CR","● Classroom Readers：CR",0],["p","This book includes short stories and vocabulary. In S7, the students are going to learn English from stories! The S7 Classroom Reader is designed in dialogue form to help students get used to reading and speaking. They will get to know \"The adventure story of Harry Perkins\" from each story. Then, they will learn more English in the Classroom Activities book; for example, sentence patterns. The teacher can see all of S7 on Jordan's Website, a good resource for teaching and a fun way of learning English. The students will be very interested in learning from digital teaching, because it is animated and the sound effects are cool!","这本书包含短篇故事和单词。在 S7，学生要从故事中学英语！S7 课堂读本以对话形式设计，帮助学生习惯阅读和口语。他们会从每个故事认识“Harry Perkins 的冒险故事”，然后在课堂活动书中学更多英语，例如句型。老师可以在乔登网站上看到 S7 的所有内容，那是很好的教学资源，也是学英语的有趣方式。学生会对数字教学很感兴趣，因为有动画，音效也很酷！",0],["h3","● Classroom Activities: CA","● Classroom Activities：CA",0],["p","There are two Classroom Activities Books: 7A and 7B. They provide a variety of activities to strengthen conversational and grammar skills. There is also a strong emphasis on phonics/IPA and pronunciation to help students develop good reading and speaking habits. With the exception of matching exercises, puzzles, or phonetic activities, this book should be used as an ORAL guide to stimulate English communication. It is NOT intended as a reader or a workbook. The blank portions are necessary for the activities so that the language is produced orally and not simply read by the students. The exercises are also intended as a guide for teachers to emphasize key Grammar/Sentence/Question Patterns.","课堂活动书有两本：7A 和 7B，提供各种活动来加强会话和语法能力，也非常重视自然拼读／国际音标和发音，帮助学生养成良好的阅读和口语习惯。除了配对练习、拼图或音标活动之外，这本书应作为“口语”引导来促进英语沟通，不是读本也不是作业本。空白部分是活动所需，让学生用口语说出来，而不只是照着念。这些练习也是老师强调重点语法／句型／问句的指引。",0],["h3","● Homework Exercises: HE","● Homework Exercises：HE",0],["p","The HE book is in two volumes: 7A and 7B. The students can use one of the books while the teacher is correcting the other one. The students have a great chance to practice what they have learned using these books. And the teacher can easily understand the students' progress.","家庭作业（HE）分两册：7A 和 7B。学生可以写其中一本，老师同时批改另一本。学生用这些作业本有很好的机会练习所学，老师也能轻松了解学生的进度。",0],["h2","Progress Report Book: PRB","学习进度手册：PRB",0],["h3","● Today's Lesson","● 今天的课程",0],["p","There is a total of twenty-four spaces for students and teachers to record the rate of progress for each class. The teacher is responsible for filling out a Daily Progress Report Form. These forms are located in the Class Progress Report Book that each student should have. Check the students' books after they finish filling out the form, and record their progress.","学生和老师共有二十四个栏记录每堂课的进度。老师负责填写每日进度表，这些表格都在每位学生的学习进度手册里。学生填写完表格后，请检查学生的手册，并记录他们的进度。",0],["h3","● Performance","● 学习表现",0],["p","Some specific items of learning contents are listed in this area for the teacher to check teaching points and for parents to know clearly what their kids have learned from the class. The teacher can note supplementary items used, or homework assigned, in the space marked \"Others.\" Put a tick in the squares for \"Excellent, \" \"Good\" or \"Try Harder,\" according to their performance. \"Excellent\" means students understand all the content and are able to use it; \"Good\" means students understand most of the material but aren't good at applying it. \"Try Harder\" means students need more help with the lesson, and have their parents pay more attention to their kids.","这一区列出一些具体的学习内容项目，方便老师检查教学重点，也让家长清楚知道孩子在课堂上学了什么。老师可在“Others”栏注记使用的补充教材或指派的作业。依学生表现在“Excellent”、“Good”或“Try Harder”的方格打钩。“Excellent”表示学生理解所有内容并能运用；“Good”表示学生理解大部分内容，但不太会应用；“Try Harder”表示学生需要更多协助，也请家长多关注孩子。",0],["h3","● Teacher's and Parent's Comments","● 老师与家长意见",0],["p","This section is for the teacher and parents to communicate with each other. The teacher may also use this space for recording the date, time, and content of make-up classes.","这一栏让老师和家长互相沟通。老师也可以在这里记录补课的日期、时间和内容。",0],["h3","● Quiz Grade","● 小测验成绩",0],["p","The teacher may do the spelling quiz for the students learned from last class and write quiz grades in this space.","老师可以为学生考上一堂课学过的拼写小测验，并把成绩写在这一栏。",0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheets","● 评估本",0],["p","There are three evaluation sheets. They are used in Class 9, Class 16, and Class 24 of the term. These evaluation sheets, which are for students to evaluate themselves, will help the parents to understand how much the students have learned from the English course and about their participation in class. Before they start, explain the sheet as clearly as possible. Then have the students check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performance.. Example: Good Fair Try Harder","共有三张评估表，在本学期第 9、16、24 堂课使用。这些评估表是让学生自我评估的，能帮助家长了解学生从英语课学到多少，以及他们的上课参与情况。开始前尽量清楚地说明评估表，然后让学生依自己对表现的感受在适当的栏打钩。范例：Good Fair Try Harder",0],["h2","VCD/MP3",null,0],["h3","Here are the contents of the S7 MP3","以下是 S7 MP3 的内容",0],["h3","Animation","动画",0],["li","● Classroom Readers 7","● Classroom Readers 7（课堂读本 7）",0],["li","● Classroom Activities 7A and 7B","● Classroom Activities 7A、7B（课堂活动 7A、7B）",0],["h3","Sounds","音档",0],["h3","S Series","S 系列",0],["li","● Classroom Readers 7","● Classroom Readers 7（课堂读本 7）",0],["li","● Classroom Activities 7A and 7B","● Classroom Activities 7A、7B（课堂活动 7A、7B）",0],["li","● Homework Exercises 7A and 7B","● Homework Exercises 7A、7B（家庭作业 7A、7B）",0],["li","● EEC Book 4 Lesson 1-Lesson 6 The teacher can preview or review lessons using the MP3. This will help the students to become familiar with different learning experiences.","● EEC 第 4 册 第 1 课－第 6 课　老师可以用 MP3 预习或复习课程，帮助学生熟悉不同的学习经验。",0],["h2","Evaluation Volume","评估本",0],["h3","The Evaluation Volume includes sheets for the following","评估册包含下列",0],["h3","activities","活动的评估表",0],["h3","● Quiz","● 小测验",0],["p","There are three quizzes in this term. They occur in Class 6, Class 14, and Class 22. The quizzes prepare the students for the coming test. The students can find their mistakes from their own learning and have a chance to improve. And as well, the teachers can realize the weakest learning area of each student and strengthen it.","本学期共有三次小测验，分别在第 6 课、第 14 课和第 22 课。小测验是为之后的测验做准备。学生可以从中找出自己的错误，有机会进步；老师也能了解每位学生最弱的学习部分，并加强它。",0],["h3","● Listening Lab","● 听力练习（Listening Lab）",0],["p","There are three listening lab tests in this term, which always come on the formal quiz days of Class 6, Class 14, and Class","本学期共有三次听力测验，都在正式小测验日，也就是第 6 课、第 14 课和第",0],["li","22. It's a great chance to improve the students' listening comprehension using the Listening Lab Tape. Please notice your students' reaction while taking this test. If they have difficulty understanding the questions, please play it again. Don't let your students feel frustrated and fail. Building their confidences is the most important mission.","22 课进行。这是运用听力练习录音带提升学生听力理解的好机会。测验时请留意学生的反应；如果他们听不懂题目，请再播放一次。不要让学生感到挫折或失败。建立他们的自信是最重要的任务。",0],["h3","● Test","● 测验",0],["p","There are three tests in the term. They are in Class 7, Class 15 and Class 23. The teacher can measure the students' achievement using the tests. This is one of the most important standards for students. It helps determine whether they can move on to the next level or not. Record the students' responses as you give the oral test, and encourage them to speak up. You may also record some words of encouragement for them.","本学期共有三次考试，在第 7、15、23 堂课。老师可以用考试衡量学生的学习成果，这是学生最重要的标准之一，用来决定他们能否升到下一级。进行口试时录下学生的回答，并鼓励他们大声说。你也可以录一些鼓励他们的话。",0],["h3","● Activity Sheet","● 活动单",0],["p","These are a good resource for teachers. Students can do games or activities using these sheets, and practice what they have learned from today's lesson as well. Furthermore, parents can easily know about the students' performances in class.","这些是老师很好的资源。学生可以用这些单张玩游戏或做活动，练习当天所学。此外，家长也能轻松了解学生的课堂表现。",0],["h2","Spelling Quiz:","拼写小测验：",0],["p","Give a spelling quiz covering the words taught in previous lessons during warm-ups. Have the students write the quiz","在热身时考前几课教过的拼写小测验。让学生把小测验的",0],["h3","words in their notebooks or Progress Report Books. Before","单词写在笔记本或进度报告本上。小测验",0],["p","the quiz, the teacher may review the vocabulary that the quiz will cover.","之前，老师可以先复习小测验范围的单词。",0],["h2","EEC Series","EEC 系列",0],["p","Book 4 Easy English Conversation Book 4 Lesson 1- 6 Compact Disk Basically, there are six books in the EEC series. The idea of using this series along with the S series is to enhance the students' speaking and listening abilities. Indeed, they are useful and worthy conversation books. Easy English Conversation (EEC) Book Four is focused on teaching children an intermediate level of English. For each lesson, there is a detailed explanation about how to teach dialogues, vocabulary, and activities. The daily dialogues are designed to teach mannerisms and speech in a western style.","第 4 册 Easy English Conversation 第 4 册 第 1–6 课 CD　EEC 系列基本上共有六本。搭配 S 系列使用，是为了加强学生的口语和听力能力，确实是实用又有价值的会话书。Easy English Conversation（EEC）第四册着重教孩子中级程度的英语。每一课都详细说明如何教对话、单词和活动。日常对话的设计是要教西方的礼仪和说话方式。",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"教学技巧","t":"Teaching Skills","k":"text","p":[4,5,6,7],"b":[["p","EEC Book Four contains three sections: Let's See and Say,","EEC 第四册包含三个部分：Let's See and Say、",0],["h3","Let's Check, and What Can I Do?","Let's Check 和 What Can I Do?",0],["p","Each section has specific learning objectives.","每个部分都有特定的学习目标。",0],["h3","● Let's See And Say",null,0],["p","This section contains a dialogue and a main picture. The picture presents the meaning of the situation. This should help the students to understand the characters and stories. There are simple and short sentences in each dialogue. The teacher should explain a situation by showing the main picture to help the students understand the situation.","这个部分包含一段对话和一张主图。图片呈现情境的意思，能帮助学生了解角色和故事。每段对话都是简单的短句。老师应展示主图说明情境，帮助学生了解这是什么样的情境。",0],["h3","● Let's Check",null,0],["p","This section contains listening and writing activities. They are designed to show what the students have learned from the unit. The listening comprehension exercises are for reviewing the dialogue and sequence of each unit. The writing exercises enhance the students' ability to learn vocabulary.","这个部分有听力理解和书写活动，目的是呈现学生在这个单元学到了什么。听力理解练习用来复习每个单元的对话和顺序；书写练习则加强学生学习单词的能力。",0],["h3","● What Can I Do?",null,0],["p","This section is the student's self-evaluation. Before the end of the class, the teacher should have the students open their books and complete this evaluation. First, the teacher should read each item and explain the meaning. After the explanation, the students should check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performances. Also they can explain the meaning of the list to their parents. Example: Good Fair Try Harder What Can I Do? (From Lesson 2) Try I CAN Good Fair Harder I can trust the dentist. I can obey dentist's commands. I can close my eyes. I can open my mouth. I can say \"Hmm\"when something is wrong.","这一部分是学生的自我评估。下课前，老师应让学生打开书完成这份评估。首先，老师逐项念出并解释意思。解释完后，学生依自己对表现的感受在适当的栏打钩。他们也可以向父母解释清单的意思。范例：Good Fair Try Harder What Can I Do?（取自第 2 课）Try I CAN Good Fair Harder I can trust the dentist. I can obey dentist's commands. I can close my eyes. I can open my mouth. I can say \"Hmm\" when something is wrong.",0],["h2","Teaching Skills","教学技巧",0],["h3","● IPA Symbols (Phonetic Symbols)","● 国际音标（音标符号）",0],["p","Tell the students that IPA symbols provide a way to learn to pronounce words correctly. Let the students know why they should learn IPA symbols. The teacher can follow these steps while teaching IPA symbols:","告诉学生，学习国际音标可以学会正确地念出单词，让学生知道为什么要学国际音标。教国际音标时，老师可以依照以下步骤：",0],["li","1. Tell the students the phonetic rule, ex.: i-e [aɪ]","1. 告诉学生发音规则，例如：i-e [aɪ]",0],["li","2. Give some examples, ex.: kite, rice, tiger, mice. It can be done by the teacher or students.","2. 举一些例子，例如：kite、rice、tiger、mice，可以由老师或学生举例。",0],["li","3. Do some group/individual practice of IPA symbols using the listening practice below:","3. 用下面的听力练习做国际音标的分组／个别练习：",0],["p","Listen and check: Listen to the word and decide if it has a sound corresponding to a certain IPA symbol. Listen and fill in the blanks: Give the students a word spelled in IPA, but with blanks. Pronounce the word. Have the students listen to the sound and fill in the blanks with the missing IPA symbols.","听一听并打钩：听单词，判断它是否有某个国际音标对应的音。听一听并填空：给学生一个用国际音标拼写但有空格的字，念出这个字，让学生听音并填入缺少的国际音标。",0],["h3","● Spelling","● 拼写",0],["p","Teaching the children how to spell in S7 is mandatory. There really isn't any way to learn spelling other than constant repetition and drilling. Ask the students to practice spelling the new words at home. Call on individual students to spell review words as you take attendance. A good method is to follow these procedures EACH time a new word is introduced:","教孩子拼写是必要的。学拼写真的没有别的方法，只能不断重复和操练。请学生在家练习拼新单词。点名时，请个别学生拼复习的单词。一个好方法是：“每次”介绍新单词时，都依照以下步骤进行：",0],["li","1. Say the word and spell it, with the students repeating. Do this several times.","1. 念出单词并拼出来，让学生跟着复诵。重复几次。",0],["li","2. Write the word on the board. Introduce it phonetically. Point to a student to say the first letter. Point to another student to say the next letter. Point to students randomly, not in seating order. Keep them on their toes. Spell out the word this way, then start over again. Keep going until everyone has said a letter. This should be done very fast almost as if you are spelling the word yourself. Point to the student rather than calling them by name. It is faster and you aren't interrupting the spelling.","2. 把单词写在黑板上，用自然拼读介绍它。指一位学生说出第一个字母，再指另一位学生说下一个字母。随机指学生，不要照座位顺序，让大家随时保持专注。用这种方式拼完整个字，再从头开始，直到每个人都说过一个字母。速度要非常快，就像您自己在拼写一样。用手指学生而不是叫名字，这样比较快，也不会打断拼写。",0],["h3","● Vocabulary","● 单词",0],["li","1. Say the word. Have the students repeat after you.","1. 念出单词，让学生跟着你念。",0],["li","2. Phonetic Spelling: See How To Teach Spelling.","2. 音标拼写：见“如何教拼写”。",0],["li","3. Explain the meaning to the students using V.A.C., the digital equipment, or situational stories. For example: When teaching \"believe:\" T.: (Point to S1) He says he is Spiderman. I don't believe it. Do you believe it?","3. 用 V.A.C.、数字设备或情境故事向学生解释意思。例如教 \"believe\" 时：T.：（指着 S1）他说他是蜘蛛人。I don't believe it. Do you believe it?",0],["li","4. Make sentences using the vocabulary.","4. 用单词造句。",0],["h3","● Storytelling","● 说故事",0],["p","Storytelling is a good way to get your students involved in learning. Especially when using the Classroom Readers, consider these suggestions:","说故事是让学生投入学习的好方法，特别是使用 Classroom Readers 时，可以参考以下建议：",0],["li","1. Introduce the story. Show the cover of the book and teach key words in the title of the story.","1. 介绍故事：展示书的封面，教故事标题中的关键字。",0],["li","2. Tell the story using mime and gesture. Since the students are mid- level learners, they will understand more of the story from your gestures.","2. 用动作和手势说故事。学生程度还不高，通过您的手势能理解更多故事内容。",0],["li","3. A picture is worth a thousand words. Let the pictures help you tell the story. After the story, do some practice to help the students learn the sentence patterns, colors, numbers, nouns, actions or animals from the story book.","3. 一张图胜过千言万语，让图片帮您说故事。说完故事后做一些练习，帮助学生学会故事书中的句型、颜色、数字、名词、动作或动物。",0],["li","4. When you read or tell the story, always refer to the written text in the book.","4. 念或说故事时，一定要对照书上的文字。",0],["li","5. Read the story more than once. If you read the story then the children will always hear exactly the same text and this will help them to predict what is to come.","5. 故事要念不只一次。照着念的话，孩子每次都会听到完全相同的文字，这能帮助他们预测接下来的内容。",0],["li","6. Storybooks can be about the contents that you want to teach in the semester. When students listen to the story, the material will also relate to the lessons of the textbook and it will help the students to understand.","6. 故事书可以是你这学期想教的内容。学生听故事时，内容也会和课本的课程相关，有助于学生理解。",0],["h3","● Eclectic Teaching For S7","● S7 的综合教学法",0],["li","1. T.P.R. (Total Physical Response) The teacher gives the commands and the students do the actions. The commands are all from Classroom Language on Page 8. For example: Stand up、Sit down、Go to...、 Raise your hand...etc. Or teach the students other TPRrelated vocabulary. For example: Point to the bathroom/ bedroom, etc.","1. T.P.R.（全身反应教学法）老师下指令，学生做动作。指令都来自第 8 页的课堂用语，例如：Stand up、Sit down、Go to...、Raise your hand... 等。或教学生其他和 TPR 相关的单词，例如：Point to the bathroom / bedroom 等。",0],["li","2. V.A.C. (Visual Aids Concept) A great way to help students understand English is to use pictures, flashcards, objects, gestures, and other tools. This will heighten the students' interest in learning English.","2. V.A.C.（视觉辅助概念）帮助学生理解英语的好方法，是使用图片、单词卡、实物、手势和其他工具，这能提高学生学英语的兴趣。",0],["h3","3. Repetition","3. 重复练习",0],["p","Repetition is very useful. Here's an example.","反复练习非常有用。以下是一个例子。",0],["d","Lucy.","T",0],["d","Lucy.","Ss",0],["d","Lucy will visit.","T",0],["d","Lucy willl visit.","Ss",0],["d","Lucy will visit friends.","T",0],["d","Lucy will visit friends","Ss",0],["d","Lucy will visit friends tomorrow.","T",0],["d","Lucy will visit friends tomorrow.","Ss",0],["h3","4. Chain Drill","4. 接龙练习",0],["p","Have the students form a verbal \"chain:\" Question-Answer, Question-Answer, Question-Answer, and so on. For example:","让学生组成口语“接龙”：问—答、问—答、问—答，依此类推。例如：",0],["d","When did you go?","S1",0],["d","I went last time. When did you go?","S2",0],["d","I went last Friday. When did you go?","S3",0],["d","I went last week. When did you go?","S4",0],["d","I went last month. When did you go?","S5",0],["d","I went last Spring.","S6",0],["p","(And so on, until all students have had a turn.)","（依此类推，直到所有学生都轮过。）",0],["h3","5. Ball Drill","5. 传球练习",0],["p","Here is one way to do a ball drill:","以下是传球练习的一种玩法：",0],["p","The teacher throws a ball to an unsuspecting student and asks a question. The student should answer the question right away and then throw the ball either back to the teacher or to one of his classmates.","老师把球丢给一位没有预期的学生并问一个问题，学生要马上回答，再把球丢回给老师或丢给其中一位同学。",0],["d","What did you do yesterday morning?","T",0],["p","(Throws the ball to S1)","（把球丢给 S1）",0],["d","I played baseball yesterday morning. What did you do yesterday afternoon? (S1 throws the ball to S2)","S1",0],["d","I studied English yesterday afternoon.","S2",0],["h3","6. Chart Drill","6. 图表练习",0],["p","There are many ways to use the Chart Drill. Here is one of them:","表格操练有很多用法，以下是其中一种：",0],["p","Place magnets in various squares, and have the students combine the phrases in the squares to form sentences.","在不同方格放上磁铁，让学生把方格中的短语组合成句子。",0],["d","I will visit friends tomorrow.","S1",0],["p","the day after tomorrow after school tomorrrow visit friends ● go to the beach buy some new clothes see the doctor",null,0],["h3","7. Substitution Drill","7. 替换练习",0],["p","Write a sentence pattern on the board. For example:","在黑板上写一个句型。例如：",0],["p","She went to the movies last____. The teacher shows a flashcard: \"month\"","She went to the movies last____.（她上个……去看电影。）老师展示单词卡：\"month\"",0],["d","She went to the movies last month.","S1",0],["h3","8. Role Play","8. 角色扮演",0],["p","Pair the students up and have them practice the dialogue or conversation. Have the students come to the front and act the dialogue out in pairs.","让学生两两一组练习对话，再请学生两人一组到前面演出对话。",0],["h3","9. Cloze","9. 克漏字",0],["p","Eliminate some key words from the sentences and have the students fill in the blanks.","把句子中的一些关键字去掉，请学生填空。",0],["h3","10. Question & Answer","10. 问与答",0],["p","The best time to do Question & Answer is at the beginning of each class for 5-10 minutes. The teacher asks questions from the previous lessons to enhance students' learning.","进行“问与答”最好的时机是每堂课开始的 5–10 分钟。老师问之前课程的问题，加强学生的学习成果。",0],["h3","11. Matching","11. 配对",0],["p","Matching is a good way to practice vocabulary and IPA symbols.","配对是练习单词和国际音标的好方法。",0],["h3","12. Expansion Drill","12. 扩展练习",0],["p","This is an effective way to practice English. For example:","这是练习英语的有效方法。例如：",0],["p","Have the students sit around in a circle.","让学生围成一圈坐。",0],["d","I saw a caveman.","S1",0],["d","I saw a caveman and a dinosaur.","S2",0],["d","I saw a caveman, a dinosaur, and a computer.","S3",0],["p","(Continue until all the students have had a chance.)","（持续进行，直到所有学生都有机会。）",0],["h3","13. Transformation","13. 句型转换",0],["p","Write a sentence on the board. Have the students change the structure of the sentence, using grammar points that we have studied. For example, write:","在白板上写一个句子，让学生用学过的语法重点改变句子结构。例如写：",0],["h3","This is my office.","This is my office.（这是我的办公室。）",0],["d","\"Mine\"","T",0],["d","This office is mine.","S1",0],["d","\"His\"","T",0],["d","This office is his.","S2",0],["d","\"Their \"","T",0],["d","This office is theirs.","S3",0],["d","\"Her\"","T",0],["d","This office is hers.","S4",0],["h3","14. Situational Practice","14. 情境练习",0],["p","Create different kinds of situations depending on the content of the lesson to help students understand the meaning of English exactly and also enjoy learning English.","依照课程内容设计各种情境，帮助学生确实了解英语的意思，也享受学英语的乐趣。",0],["h3","● Suggested Games and Ways of Scoring","● 建议的游戏与计分方式",0],["h3","1. Ghostbusters","1. 捉鬼敢死队",0],["p","Have the students form a circle. Choose a student to be \"it\" and give him a newspaper stick. When the teacher calls student A, \"It\" has to hit student A on his desk with the newspaper before student A calls another student.","请学生围成一圈，选一位学生当“鬼”，给他一根报纸棒。老师叫 A 同学时，A 同学要在叫出另一位同学之前，“鬼”就要用报纸棒打到 A 同学的桌子。",0],["h3","2. Blind Man's Bluff","2. 蒙眼抓人",0],["p","Have a student wear a blindfold, walk around the classroom, and try to grab another student. When he has someone, ask a question to the student who is caught by the blind man. The blind man has to guess who he/she is according to the voice of the answer.","请一位学生蒙上眼睛在教室里走动，试着抓到另一位学生。抓到后，问被抓到的学生一个问题，蒙眼的人要依照回答的声音猜出他是谁。",0],["h3","3. IPA translation relay","3. 国际音标翻译接力",0],["p","Divide the students into groups. Give each student a number. Say a word and let the students spell it with IPA phonetic symbols. The teacher can let them finish the spelling in the relay way by calling the student's number.","把学生分组，每位学生一个号码。说一个字，让学生用国际音标拼出来。老师可以叫号码，让他们用接力的方式完成拼写。",0],["h3","4. Odd one out","4. 找出不同类",0],["p","Call out a series of words that have something in common except one, like window, door, floor, boy. The studentsmust identify the word that doesn't fit, in this case, boy. The activity can be also used in phonetic words identifying.","念出一串除了一个以外都有共同点的字，例如 window、door、floor、boy。学生要找出不属于同类的字，在这个例子是 boy。这个活动也可以用来辨识音标。",0],["h3","5. Search","5. 寻宝",0],["p","The teacher chooses a topic. For example: \"What will you do tomorrow?\" Each student writes something on a piece of paper. The paper are collected and redistributed to the students. The students must use the dialogue provided by the teacher to find the owner of the paper.","老师选一个主题，例如 \"What will you do tomorrow?\"，每位学生在纸上写一些东西，收回后再重新发给学生，学生要用老师提供的对话找出纸条的主人。",0],["h3","6. Find Someone Who...","6. 找到某个……的人",0],["p","Divide the students into groups. Write a list on the board, ex.:","把学生分组，在黑板上写一张清单，例如：",0],["p","Find Someone Who...",null,0],["li","1. played ball yesterday","1. 昨天打球",0],["li","2. has a birthday party in June","2. 六月有生日派对",0],["li","3. Has two brothers...... Each group selects a runner to ask other students the questions. The first team to find someone for each item on the list wins.","3. 有两个兄弟……每组选一位跑者去问其他学生这些问题，最先为清单上每一项都找到人的队伍获胜。",0],["h3","7. Forgetful Teacher","7. 健忘的老师",0],["p","After covering the lesson in the reader, ask the students to close their books. Read one of the sentences, pretending that you have forgotten how to read one of the words. The student must tell you the word you have forgotten.","教完读本的课文后，请学生合上课本。念其中一个句子，假装忘了怎么念其中一个字，学生要告诉您忘记的字。",0],["h3","8. What's missing","8. 少了哪一个",0],["p","Write some letters, words, numbers, or draw some pictures on the whiteboard. Divide the students into teams. Have the students put their heads down. Erase one item from the board. Tell the students to look at the board. Ask, \"What's missing?\" Choose a student to tell you the answer. This way, everyone will have a chance to participate.","在白板上写一些字母、单词、数字或画一些图。把学生分队，让学生趴下，擦掉白板上的一样东西，再叫学生看白板，问 \"What's missing?\"，选一位学生回答。这样每个人都有机会参与。",0],["h3","9. Sentence Building","9. 造句",0],["p","Choose five words that are not really related. Ask the students to make a sentence or a short story using these words. Ex.: went/ movies/ friends S.: I went to the movies with my friends.","选五个没什么关联的字，让学生用这些字造一个句子或短故事。例：went / movies / friends　S.：I went to the movies with my friends.",0],["h3","10. Phonics Tic-Tac-Toe","10. 发音圈圈叉叉",0],["p","Draw a Tic-Tac-Toe grid on the board. Write different IPA symbols in each space. Divide the class into teams. The first player chooses a space by saying a word with the initial/middle/final sound of the IPA symbol in the space.","在黑板上画井字格，每格写不同的国际音标，把全班分队。第一位玩家说出一个词首／词中／词尾有该格国际音标的单词，就能选那一格。",0],["h3","11. Spelling phonics","11. 拼写发音",0],["p","Divide the students into teams. Each student has a number. The teacher says a word and calls a student's number to spell the word on the board.","把学生分队，每位学生一个号码。老师说一个字，叫一位学生的号码到白板上拼出那个字。",0],["h3","12. Phonics switch","12. 发音变变变",0],["p","Write a word they know on the board, ex.: look Have the students pronounce it chorally. Then change one of the letters in the word to another letter. For example, look→ hook. The first student to pronounce the word correctly gets a point. More examples:","在白板上写一个他们认识的字，例如 look，让学生齐声念出来。然后把字中的一个字母换成另一个，例如 look → hook。第一个正确念出新字的学生得一分。更多例子：",0],["p","look--book look--crook look---took look--cook",null,0],["h3","13. Crosswords","13. 填字游戏",0],["p","Draw a big grid on the board. The teacher begins by writing a word such as \"notebook.\" The students make as many words as they can, using any of the letters in \"notebook.\" The words can be written vertically, horizontally, and diagonally. The students get points according to the number of letters in their words.","在白板上画一个大格子。老师先写一个字，例如 \"notebook\"。学生用 \"notebook\" 里的任何字母组成越多字越好，字可以直写、横写或斜写。依字的字母数得分。",0],["h3","14. Paper airplane game","14. 纸飞机游戏",0],["p","Put the students into groups. Each groups has to make its own paper airplane. Give them a minute to test their planes. Set a score for each target. For instance, 10 for landing on the chairs, 50 for landing on the desks, etc. After answering questions correctly, they can shoot their airplanes and get points according to the target they landed on.","把学生分组，每组做一架纸飞机，给他们一分钟试飞。为每个目标设定分数，例如降落在椅子上 10 分、降落在桌上 50 分等。答对问题后就可以射出纸飞机，依降落的目标得分。",0],["h3","15. Frog","15. 青蛙",0],["p","Put the students into groups. Each groups has to make its own paper frog. Give them a minute to test their frogs. Draw two parallel lines on the floor. Put the frogs right behind the starting line. After answering questions correctly, they can propel their frogs once. The frog that goes the longest distance is the winner.","把学生分组，每组自己折一只纸青蛙，给他们一分钟试跳。在地上画两条平行线，把青蛙放在起跑线后面。学生答对问题就可以弹青蛙一次，跳得最远的青蛙获胜。",0],["h3","16. My name is John","16. 我的名字是 John",0],["p","Put the students into teams. The students take turns. Each student should come up front for about a minute, and make sentences such as \"My name is John. I am 12 years old. I live in Beijing. Each sentence is worth a point. The students have to make the next sentence within ten seconds, or the teacher should say \"Stop!\".","把学生分队，轮流进行。每位学生到前面约一分钟，说出句子，例如 \"My name is John. I am 12 years old. I live in Beijing.\"。每句得一分。学生要在十秒内说出下一句，否则老师要喊 \"Stop!\"。",0],["h3","17. Hot Rock","17. 烫手石头",0],["p","Have the students make a circle. The ones in even numbers are in one team while the ones in odd numbers are in the other. Make a paper ball or anything that can be tossed safely as the \"hot rock.\" Have the students pass the hot rock when the teacher says a question. The student who has the hot rock in his hand when the question goes to the last word must answer it correctly. If he can not, the team will get a sad face. The team gets that gets the most sad faces is the loser.","请学生围成一圈，偶数号的学生一队，奇数号的学生一队。做一颗纸球或任何可以安全丢的东西当“烫手石头”。老师问问题时，学生传递石头，问题念到最后一个字时拿着石头的学生必须答对，答不出来该队就得到一个哭脸，哭脸最多的队伍输。",0],["h3","18. Monster face","18. 怪兽脸",0],["p","Draw a big monster face (the crazier the better) on the board. For different areas of the face -the eyes, the nose, the mouth, etc., assign different point values. (The smaller the area, the bigger the point value.)The student who does what the teacher asks him to do correctly can throw a sticky ball at the monster's face. Wherever it hits determines how many points the student gets.","在黑板上画一张大怪兽脸（越夸张越好），脸的不同部位，例如眼睛、鼻子、嘴巴等，给不同的分数（范围越小分数越高）。正确完成老师要求的学生可以把黏黏球丢向怪兽脸，丢中哪里就得几分。",0],["h3","19. Spy Code","19. 密码游戏",0],["p","Assign each letter of the alphabet a number, for example a=1, b=2.....etc.. Write something in code on the board \"1,16,16,12,5\". The students must translate the code into letters: \"apple\" as fast as they can.","每个字母代表一个数字，例如 a=1、b=2……在黑板上写一段密码“1,16,16,12,5”，学生要尽快把密码转成字母：\"apple\"。",0],["h3","20. Scramble words","20. 单词重组",0],["p","Write a word in scrambled fashion: drcnihle (children). Have the students unscramble it on the board.","写一个字母打乱的字：drcnihle（children），让学生在白板上把它还原。",0],["h3","21. Simple scoring (short)","21. 简单计分（快速）",0],["p","Give the winner a point.","给获胜者一分。",0],["h3","22. Die score","22. 骰子计分",0],["p","Throw the die to get points. It can be extended to many ways like '-1,3,5/+2,4,6'.The teacher can be creative and make it different every time.","掷骰子得分。可以延伸出很多玩法，例如“1、3、5 扣分／2、4、6 加分”，老师可以发挥创意，每次都不一样。",0],["d","The teacher can draw a railroad, an apple tree, stone steps to a treasure island, etc. The students go the number of steps that the dice show. Some traps or lucky things can be added to the game above in order to make it exciting.","Extend",0],["d","#22-A parts collection If the die goes to 1 or 4 points ,they can get eyes; if 2 or 5 points, they can get a mouth; if 3 or 6 points ,they can get a face.","Extend",0],["p","The team that collects eyes, a mouth, and a face can form a smiling face and win a point. Teachers can change the parts into many other things.","集满眼睛、嘴巴和脸的队伍可以拼成一张笑脸并得一分。老师可以把这些部位换成很多其他东西。",0],["h3","23. Sticky ball score","23. 黏黏球计分",0],["p","Throw the sticky ball to get points. The teacher can draw different kinds of targets on the board.","丢黏黏球得分，老师在黑板上画各种目标。",0],["d","The teacher can put some letters, IPA symbols or words in the target, then ask the students to spell a word initial with the alphabet, pronounce the symbols or make a sentence with the word to get points..","Extend",0],["h3","24. Bingo","24. 宾果",0],["p","Draw a 3 by 3 grid on the board. Each team has its own mark. The first team that has three marks in a row is the winner.","在黑板上画 3×3 的格子，每队有自己的记号，最先连成一线的队伍获胜。",0],["d","chess board--Make the grids into 4 by 4, 5 by 5 or even larger. Have the students put 3,4 or more marks in a row.","Extend",0],["li","25. Maze:","25. 迷宫：",0],["p","There are several ways the students can choose at the beginning. After starting, the students have to change direction at every corner, then get an unknown reward at the end.","一开始学生有几条路可以选。出发后，学生每到一个转角都要改变方向，最后在终点得到一个未知的奖励。",0],["h3","26. Matching and memorization","26. 配对记忆",0],["p","Draw a concealed grid on the board. The teacher can write words, IPA symbols, or anything else in the squares. Have the students choose any two squares. If they match, the student gets a point. If they don't, the teacher erases them. The students try to memorize the location, and try again.","在白板上画一个盖起来的格子。老师可以在方格里写单词、国际音标或任何东西。让学生选任两格，配对成功就得一分；不成功的话老师把它们擦掉（盖回去）。学生要试着记住位置再试一次。",0],["h3","27. Big or Small","27. 比大小",0],["p","The students choose \"big\" or \"small\", the teacher throws the die to determine the standard number, then the students throw the die to get the final number.","学生选“大”或“小”。老师掷骰子决定标准数字，再请学生掷骰子得到最后的数字。",0],["d","Big!","S1",0],["p","T.:(throws the die)The standard number is 3!","T：（掷骰子）The standard number is 3!",0],["d","(throws the die) The final number is 6!","S1",0],["p","T. S1 can get a point!","T.：S1 得一分！",0],["h3","● Digital Teaching: www.jordan.com.tw","● 数字教学：www.jordan.com.tw",0],["p","All of S7 is on Jordan's Web Site. This includes the Classroom Readers, Classroom Activities, and EEC 4. The students will have a lot of fun learning English while watching and working with the animated pictures on the web site. And the teacher can teach well using this interesting idea. The steps of digital teaching are found in the teacher's manual for each class. Please encourage the students to practice English on the touchscreen all-in-one in class as well as at home. Preview, Assist, and Review are three important aspects of digital teaching. It is a high-technology","S7 的所有内容都在乔登网站上，包括课堂读本、课堂活动和 EEC 第 4 册。学生在网站上一边看一边操作动画，会学得很开心，老师也能用这个有趣的方式好好教学。数字教学的步骤都在教师手册每堂课中。请鼓励学生在课堂上和家里用触控一体机练习英语。预习、辅助和复习是数字教学三个重要的面向。它是高科技的",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"班级管理","t":"Classroom Management","k":"text","p":[8,9,10],"b":[["p","multimedia, but it is easy to use.","多媒体，但很容易使用。",0],["h3","● How to visit Jordan's Website","● 如何进入乔登网站",0],["p","www.jordan.com.tw ↓ 乔登美语教程网 ↓ e-Learning ↓ e-Learning白金会员 ↓ Enter the password ↓ Big Kid大儿童学习区 ↓ Lesson V儿童高阶 ↓ Book7",null,0],["h2","Classroom Language","课堂用语",0],["h3","1. Classroom Commands","1. 课堂指令",0],["p","Wait. Just a minute, please. Please____more quietly. Please try to write more neatly. _____is one word. No spaces, please. _____is two words. Please put a space here. Stop. No Chinese! No eating! Great job! Excellent! Well done! I knew you could do it! Hand in your homework, please. Please collect the______. Please pass out the______. Be careful! Notice your spelling! Notice the tense!","等一下。请稍等。请更安静地……。请试着写整齐一点。……是一个字，请不要空格。……是两个字，请在这里空一格。停。不准说中文！不准吃东西！做得好！太棒了！很好！我就知道你做得到！请交作业。请收……。请发……。小心！注意拼写！注意时态！",0],["h3","2. Classroom Interaction","2. 课堂互动用语",0],["p","How do you say.......? What's the past tense of...? Make a sentence with..... Make a question. Who can correct this? What does ..... mean? How do you spell...? How do you spell .... using IPA symbols? Is it clear? Do you understand? Excuse me. How do you pronounce this word? Don't give up! You can do it! That's OK. Don't worry. Try again! Give me five! Go! Good Luck!!","……怎么说？……的过去时是什么？用……造句。提一个问题。谁能改正这个？……是什么意思？……怎么拼？……用国际音标怎么拼？清楚吗？你们懂吗？不好意思。这个字怎么念？别放弃！你做得到！没关系，别担心。再试一次！击个掌！开始！祝你好运！",0],["h2","Classroom Management","班级管理",0],["h3","Class Preparation","课前准备",0],["li","(1) Please arrive at school thirty minutes early to do class preparation.","(1) 请提早三十分钟到学校做课前准备。",0],["li","-Fill out the Teacher's Handbook","- 填写教师手册（Teacher's Handbook）",0],["li","-Prepare your teaching materials","- 准备教材",0],["li","-Log on to Jordan's Web Site and get familiar with today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 登录乔登网站，操作触控一体机熟悉今天的课程。",0],["li","-Help those who were absent make up the missing class","- 帮缺席的学生补课",0],["li","(2) Please go into the classroom five minutes early to get everything done, and to interact with students.","(2) 请提早五分钟进教室把一切准备好，并和学生互动。",0],["li","-Make sure that the touchscreen all-in-one is ready for the coming class.","- 确定触控一体机已为下一堂课准备好。",0],["h2","Discipline","秩序管理",0],["p","The teacher should maintain proper discipline at all times. Swearing, spitting, throwing objects, standing on chairs/desks, hitting others, kicking walls, etc. ... are prohibited. Eating and drinking during class time will be left up to the individual schools/teachers, but these actions should be discouraged. A simple, common sense approach to discipline is usually best. Discipline involves keeping everyone happy. Even the students who are disciplined should end up happy. The student should understand that it is not them the teacher is unhappy with, just their behaviors. Discipline should never be a personal criticism. The student should know that the teacher likes them, but only wants their behaviors to be improved. Some basic things to remember about classroom behaviors:","- 确认触控一体机已为接下来的课程准备就绪。秩序管理：老师应随时维持良好的课堂秩序。禁止骂脏话、吐口水、丢东西、站在椅子／桌子上、打人、踢墙壁等行为。上课时间是否可以吃喝由各分校／老师决定，但应尽量避免。简单、合乎常理的管理方式通常最好。秩序管理是要让每个人都开心，即使是被管教的学生，最后也应该开心。学生应该明白，老师不高兴的不是他这个人，而是他的行为。管教绝不应是对人的批评；学生应该知道老师喜欢他，只是希望他的行为能改进。关于课堂行为，有几点基本原则要记住：",0],["p","A misbehaving class is usually a bored class. A quick pace will help to ensure the students maintain attention. Have your teaching aids and materials at hand to avoid lengthy delays, which give the students the opportunity to start misbehaving. Call on students in a random order. If a student doesn't know when it is his/her turn they will pay closer attention. Mix choral work with pair work and individual practice. If possible, switch from one type of practice to another often to help keep interest and variety. Finally, return to group work to follow-up/reinforce the lesson. Minimize individual work if time is short. If a student is creating a problem in class, give him/her a long stare or a tap on the shoulder to let them know you disapprove. If the student persists, tell him/her to stop the disruptive behavior. If the problem continues, take away reward cards or have him/her stand up. Finally, if the student won't stop, send him/her out of the classroom to see the secretary. The student's parents should be notified of the behavior. You should treat the student well after each of these steps. You must show the individual that you are still friends, but you don't approve of their actions.","秩序不好的班级通常是觉得无聊的班级。节奏快一点有助于学生保持专注。教具和教材放在手边，避免拖延太久，给学生调皮的机会。随机点学生，学生不知道什么时候轮到自己，就会更专心。把齐声练习、两人练习和个别练习混合进行。可能的话常常切换练习方式，保持兴趣和变化。最后回到团体练习来追踪／加强课程。时间不够时尽量减少个别练习。如果有学生在课堂上制造问题，盯着他／她看久一点或拍拍肩膀，让他知道你不赞同。学生若继续，就叫他／她停止干扰行为。问题若持续，就收回奖励卡或让他／她站着。最后如果学生还是不停，就请他／她离开教室去找行政人员，并通知学生家长。每一步之后都要好好对待学生，让他知道你们还是朋友，只是你不赞同他的行为。",0],["h3","Introduce Your New student","介绍新同学",0],["p","Sometimes there will be new students in your class. You should introduce the new students to your class and give everyone a chance to introduce themselves. The teacher should help the new students to join the class smoothly by giving him some extra help and explaining the class rules clearly. In some cases, giving the new student a chance to prove his English ability is a good way for the class to accept him. It's also a chance to reduce his anxiety about being in a new class.","班上有时会有新同学。您应该向全班介绍新同学，并让每个人都有机会自我介绍。老师应给新同学额外的协助，并清楚说明班规，帮助他们顺利融入班级。有时给新同学一个展现英语能力的机会，是让全班接纳他的好方法，也能消除他对新班级的焦虑。",0],["h3","● Homework And Grading","● 作业与评分",0],["p","Establish from the first day of class that the students need to turn in homework in a timely fashion. You must let the students know you want their homework EVERY time the class meets. The homework helps to reinforce key lesson concepts. Without completing it prior to the next class the student may begin to fall behind. Be very firm about making sure they turn it in on time! Correct the homework exercises carefully. This is a very important process for the beginner. Be strict! That will help them in cultivating a good habit to write clearly and neatly.","从第一天上课就要让学生知道，作业必须准时缴交。您要让学生知道，“每次”上课都要交作业。作业能帮助巩固课程的重要观念，如果下次上课前没有完成，学生可能会开始落后。务必坚持要求准时交作业！仔细批改作业，这对初学者是非常重要的过程。要严格！这能帮助他们养成书写清楚整齐的好习惯。",0],["h3","To help beginners do homework successfully, here are","以下是帮助初学者顺利完成作业的",0],["h3","some tips","一些秘诀：",0],["li","1. Make full use of the Reinforcement section for each class. Have the students open the Homework Exercises book to preview the items in today's lesson.","1. 充分利用每堂课的加强部分。让学生打开家庭作业本预习今天课程的项目。",0],["li","2. Make a clear explanation for them to understand the content of today's Homework Exercises. And ask them to practice some exercises to make sure they understand. Grading of homework and tests should be consistent between the FT and the CT. A good rule of thumb to follow when grading homework is to subtract two points for a missing or incorrect word and one point for a missing or incorrect letter. If you are using letter grades (A, B, C, etc.) convert the number total to a letter grade as follows:","2. 清楚说明今天 Homework Exercises 的内容，让学生了解，并请他们先练习几题，确认他们都懂了。外籍老师（FT）和中籍老师（CT）批改作业和测验的标准要一致。批改作业有个好用的原则：漏写或写错一个字扣两分，漏写或写错一个字母扣一分。如果您用等第（A、B、C 等），请依照以下方式把分数换算成等第：",0],["p","90-100 A 70-80 C 80-90 B 60-70 D",null,0],["h3","Quizzes And Tests","小测验与测验",0],["p","Review lessons will always precede test days. The reviews are designed to cover key grammar and communication points as well as vocabulary to be tested. Always follow the exercise with a game/activity of your own (see games/ activities section for suggestions) that addresses the material you want to emphasize. Quizzes should be given after attendance taking. It is up to the teacher to decide whether or not the students will need a quick review before a quiz. If a student scores less than 80% on a test or quiz, he/she will be required to take it again after class.","测验日之前一定会有复习课。复习课的设计涵盖重要的语法和沟通重点，以及要考的单词。练习之后，一定要接着进行您自己设计、针对想强调内容的游戏／活动。小测验应在点名后进行。是否需要在小测验前快速复习，由老师决定。学生测验或小测验分数低于 80% 时，必须在下课后重考。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching","电话教学",0],["p","As teachers, we are not only concerned with students' achievements in class, but also concerned with their study habits while they are at home. Therefore, we've designed Telephone Teaching Material (TTM) to help the students review English at home by answering some questions on the phone and let the parents know about their kids' ability in speaking English. The teacher should:","身为老师，我们不只关心学生在课堂上的表现，也关心他们在家的学习习惯。因此我们设计了电话教学教材（TTM），让学生在电话中回答问题，在家复习英语，也让家长了解孩子的英语口语能力。老师应该：",0],["p","Grade students responses with a letter grade (A,B,C or D) Write comments in the Teacher's Handbook Give them reward cards according to their performance during the following class. Have the students study the telephone teaching questions in class. When you call them at home, give the students 2 or 3 attempts to answer each question. Be sure to greet the students at the beginning of the conversation. Give them some encouragement after they answer each question. Procedure:","用等第（A、B、C 或 D）为学生的回答评分，在教师手册上写评语，下一堂课依表现发奖励卡。让学生在课堂上先准备电话教学的问题。打电话到学生家时，每题给学生 2 或 3 次回答机会。对话一开始一定要先问候学生，每题答完后给一些鼓励。程序：",0],["p","1.Greetings: Say hello to the student or his family. Let them know you want to talk to the student.","1. 问候：向学生或家人问好，让他们知道您想跟学生说话。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) Hello. May I speak to John?","(1) Hello. May I speak to John?（你好，请问 John 在吗？）",0],["li","(2) Hello John, this is June. How are you today? 90-100 A 70-80 C 80-90 B 60-70 D","(2) Hello John, this is June. How are you today?（你好 John，我是 June。你今天好吗？）90-100 A　70-80 C　80-90 B　60-70 D",0],["h3","2. Questions and Answers","2. 问与答",0],["p","Try to encourage the students to answer in complete sentences.","尽量鼓励学生用完整的句子回答。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) I know you knew that, try again!",null,0],["li","(2) Good! Very good! You did a good job! Wonderful! Very nice! Good boy! Good girl!",null,0],["li","3. Ending: Continue to encourage the students again and remind them of something if needed:","3. 结尾：再次鼓励学生，需要的话提醒他们一些事情：",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) Well done.","(1) Well done.（做得好。）",0],["li","(2) Don't forget to have your parents sign the Report Book.","(2) Don't forget to have your parents sign the Report Book.（别忘了请爸妈在报告本上签名。）",0],["li","(3) You are a good boy/girl. Did you prepare for next class?","(3) You are a good boy/girl. Did you prepare for next class?（你是个好孩子。下堂课准备好了吗？）",0],["li","(4) You always do a great job! Is your mother home? Please ask him/her to come to the phone. Thank you. Progress the quiz/test or father","(4) You always do a great job! Is your mother home? Please ask him/her to come to the phone. Thank you.（你一直都表现很好！你妈妈在家吗？请她来听电话，谢谢。）小测验／考试进度　或爸爸",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"课程大纲","t":"Syllabus","k":"img","p":[11],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"学习目标","t":"Learning Goals","k":"text","p":[12],"b":[["h2","Learning Goals","学习目标",0],["h2","A) Grammar Goals","A) 语法目标",0],["li","1. Able to make questions, and postive and negative sentences using \"was\" and \"were.\"","1. 能用 \"was\" 和 \"were\" 造问句、肯定句和否定句。",0],["li","2. Able to make questions, and postive and negative sentences using the past tense.","2. 能用过去时造问句、肯定句和否定句。",0],["li","3. Able to use regular past tense verbs.","3. 能使用规则动词的过去时。",0],["li","4. Able to use irregular past tense verbs.","4. 能使用不规则动词的过去时。",0],["li","5. Able to recognize and use the past continuous.","5. 能辨识并使用过去进行时。",0],["li","6. Able to use objective pronouns.","6. 能使用宾格代词。",0],["li","7. Able to use possessive pronouns.","7. 能使用所有格代词。",0],["h2","B) Communicative Goals","B) 沟通目标",0],["li","1. Able to talk about activities and times.","1. 能谈论活动和时间。",0],["li","2. Able to say the names of rooms in the house.","2. 能说出房屋里各个房间的名称。",0],["li","3. Able to talk about different ways of cooking.","3. 能谈论不同的烹调方式。",0],["li","4. Able to analyze essays with a complex structure.","4. 能分析结构较复杂的文章。",0],["li","5. Able to write a simple composition.","5. 能写简单的作文。",0],["h2","C) Vocabulary Goals","C) 单词目标",0],["p","Class 1: everything, waiting, for, call, maybe, should, dangerous Class 2: none Class 3: scared, believe, were, either, nothing, weird, wasn't, fight, yesterday, last yesterday, yesterday morning, yesterday afternoon, last night Class 4: noise, airplane, God, dinosaurs, yells, stupid, caveman, bears, kitchen, living room, bedroom, bathroom Class 5: whispers, sneezes, did, looked, ropes, around, played basketball, played ping-pong, played baseball, played soccer Class 9: children, dear, turn off, cooked, baked, soup, soup, spaghetti, bread Class 10: none Class 11: far away, live, neighbor, vacation, weather, fun. cookbook, tent, camp Class 12: picnic, beautiful, tired, hole, went, ate, took, sang, put, said, had Class 13: him, next, them, animals, soft, understand, no use, deep, dark, ran, cried, began, fell, heard last, next Class 17: then, together, suddenly, sky, shining, still, grab, leaf, quickly, slowly go to the supermarket, put on his jacket, walked out the door, party food Class 18: medicine, gave, shot, terrible, lucky Class 19: none Class 20: safe, lake, bowl, loud you, me, him, her Class 21: wow, airplane, just, mine, yours, just, hers, theirs, ours",null,0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"第 1 课","t":"Class 1","k":"class","p":[13,14,15,16],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","To review sentence patterns: will/won't........? Am/Is/Are .... Going to .....? To read and write a composition using the sentences learned. To learn IPA phonics: Review of short and long vowel sounds","复习句型：will/won't........? Am/Is/Are .... Going to .....?；用学过的句子读写作文；学习国际音标自然拼读：复习短元音和长元音",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Point the hurting place","- 指出痛的地方",1],["li","- Tell the doctor how you feel","- 告诉医生你的感觉",1],["li","- Say \"ouch\" when something hurts.","- 痛的时候说 \"ouch\"。",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 1","Classroom Readers 第 1 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","everything, waiting, for, call, maybe, should, dangerous",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7A Lesson 1","课堂活动 7A 第 1 课",1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Review : will/won't Will........? be going to . Am/Is/Are .... Going to .....?","复习：will/won't　Will........?　be going to　Am/Is/Are .... Going to .....?",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, the digital equipment, sentence cards with Chinese translation, hammer, die","单词卡、数字设备、附中文翻译的句子卡、锤子、骰子",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 1","EEC 4 第 1 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","chest, head, arm, leg, shoulder, elbow, knee, foot",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","It hurts here.","A",1],["d","Does it hurt when I press with my fingers here?","B",1],["d","Just a little bit.","A",1],["d","If you move?","B",1],["d","Ouch!","A",1],["d","OK. Let's take an X- Ray!","B",1],["d","Does it hurt?","A",1],["d","Not at all. Don't worry.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["h3","Review of words learned","复习学过的单词",0],["p","Game: Crosswords Ex: Draw a big grid (like a crossword puzzle but with no black squares) on the board. The teacher begins by writing a word such as \"notebook\". The student from the first team then makes a word starting with N,O,T,E,B,O,or K. The students from each team then alternate trying to make new words (no repeats) using the words on the grid. Words can be written forward, vertically, and diagonally. Three letters are three points, four letters are four points, and so on.","游戏：填字游戏　例：在白板上画一个大格子（像填字游戏但没有黑格）。老师先写一个字，例如 \"notebook\"。第一队的学生用 N、O、T、E、B、O 或 K 开头组成一个字。各队学生轮流用格子里的字组成新字（不能重复）。字可以横写、直写或斜写。三个字母得三分，四个字母得四分，依此类推。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (35 mins) Lesson 1: The Blue Button","课堂读本（35 分钟）第 1 课：The Blue Button（蓝色按钮）",0],["h3","1.New words","1. 新单词",0],["li","(1) Teach the new words using phonetic spelling. Take this opportunity to review the IPA symbols while teaching spelling.","(1) 用音标拼写教新单词，趁教拼写的机会复习国际音标。",0],["li","(2) Explain the new words using V.A.C., giving sentence examples, or short situational stories. Then have a student say the meaning in Chinese or choose the correct one from several meanings you have provided.","(2) 用 V.A.C.、例句或简短的情境故事解释新单词，再请一位学生说出中文意思，或从你提供的几个意思中选出正确的。",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["li","(3) First, read See It And Say It. Then make a sentence using the new word on the touchscreen all-in-one.","(3) 先念 See It And Say It，再在触控一体机上用新单词造句。",0],["h3","For example","例如",0],["p","Have the students look at the picture of \"everything,\" and ask them to make a sentence according to the situation.","让学生看 \"everything\" 的图，请他们依情境造句。",0],["d","Please look at the picture, and make a sentence using \"everything.\"","T",0],["d","He tells his mom everything.","S",0],["h3","Game # 5: Bingo.","游戏 #5：宾果。",0],["p","Draw a 3*3 grid on the board. Each team has its own mark. The first team with three marks in a row is the winner.","在黑板上画 3×3 的格子，每队有自己的记号，最先连成一线的队伍获胜。",0],["d","chess board--Make the grids 4*4, 5*5, or even larger. Have the students put 3,4, or more marks in a row.","Extend",0],["h3","2. Story presentation","2. 故事呈现",0],["p","Go to the Learning and Playing page. While the students watch and listen to the story, use the stop button to teach. Or, have the students repeat the words or sentence patterns. Story practice:","进到 Learning and Playing 页面。学生一边看一边听故事时，用停止键教学，或让学生跟着念单词或句型。故事练习：",0],["p","Go to the Translation page. Game: Matching hitting game-team competition. Divide the students into two or three teams and give each student a number.","进到翻译页面。游戏：配对打卡游戏——队伍竞赛。把学生分成两或三队，每位学生一个号码。",0],["li","(1) Have the students repeat the sentences after using the digital equipment.","(1) 用数字设备让学生跟着念句子。",0],["li","(2) Have the students hit the card for Chinese translation. Then ask the students questions about the sentences.","(2) 让学生打中对应的中文翻译卡，再问学生关于句子的问题。",0],["h3","Team A B","A 队 B 队",0],["p","Spread some Chinese sentence cards on the board or on the floor. Play the digital equipment. Repeat it again. Ss. (Repeat the sentence) T.: What does it mean in Chinese? Number two! S2 AB: (Hit the correct card)","在白板或地上铺一些中文句子卡。播放数字设备，再播一次。Ss.（跟着念句子）T.：What does it mean in Chinese? Number two!　S2 AB：（打正确的卡片）",0],["h3","3. Reinforcement","3. 加强",0],["p","Have the students open their books and read the story.","让学生打开书念故事。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 1 (35 mins)","课堂活动第 1 课（35 分钟）",0],["h2","My Birthday Plans","My Birthday Plans（我的生日计划）",0],["h2","1.1 Read the composition:","1.1 读作文：",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this composition using the digital equipment.","(1) 用数字设备展示这篇作文的内容。",0],["li","(2) Finish showing the composition, then click the \"Translation\" button. Have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 展示完作文后点“翻译”按钮，让学生跟着触控一体机念。",0],["li","(3) Open Your Book: Have the students take turns reading the composition, sentence by sentence.","(3) 打开课本：让学生轮流逐句念作文。",0],["h2","1.2 Answer the questions","1.2 回答问题",0],["p","Group Practice (Divide the students into teams, and give each student a number.)","分组练习（把学生分队，每位学生一个号码。）",0],["li","(1) Ask the students the questions in 1.2. Call on students randomly to answer the questions. Game: Simple score or a short game.","(1) 问学生 1.2 的问题，随机点学生回答。游戏：简单计分或短游戏。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","1.3 IPA phonetics: long vowel sounds","1.3 国际音标：长元音",0],["li","(1) Write some words containing long vowel sounds on the board, and have the students do phonetic spelling by the rules:","(1) 在白板上写一些含长元音的字，让学生依规则做音标拼写：",0],["li","(2) T write \"cake\" on the board)c-c-c [k][k][k] a-e [eɪ] [eɪ] [eɪ].k-k-k [k][k][k] So how do you pronounce c-a-k-e ?[k] [eɪ] [k]-[keɪk]","(2) T 在白板上写 \"cake\"）c-c-c [k][k][k] a-e [eɪ] [eɪ] [eɪ]. k-k-k [k][k][k] 那 c-a-k-e 怎么念？[k] [eɪ] [k]-[keɪk]",0],["li","(3) Open Your Book: Have the students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point to the words and IPA symbols.","(3) 打开课本：让学生打开书练习所学。鼓励他们大声念，并指着单词和国际音标。",0],["h2","1.3-A circle the correct IPA long vowel sound","1.3-A 圈出正确的国际音标长元音",0],["h2","1.3-B check the long/short vowel sounds","1.3-B 勾出长／短元音",0],["p","The teacher reads each word or plays the touchscreen all-in-one, and the students circle the correct words.","老师念出每个字或用触控一体机播放，学生圈出正确的字。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See And Say.","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Inroduce the lesson by reading or playing the Let's See and Say monolog.","念出或播放 Let's See and Say 独白来引入本课。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say:Monolog","Let's See And Say：独白",0],["p","Doctors can help us when we don't feel well. The boy is not feeling well and he is visiting the doctor. What's wrong with him? Let's listen to the dialogue below.","我们不舒服时，医生可以帮助我们。这个男孩不舒服，正在看医生。他怎么了？我们来听听下面的对话。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you want to emphasize. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the sstudents' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson by combining the dialog that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Put the students into groups or pairs. Have each group practice the conversation for a com prehension check.","把学生分组或两两一组，让每组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(5 mins)","（5 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have an understanding.","利用这段时间预习家庭作业。在白板上写几个例子让他们了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[30,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V"]],[30,["Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1","Learning & Playing","New Words","Translation"]],[54,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1","1. 1","Translation"]],[87,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["The Blue Button"],"bd":"","m":95},{"z":"第 2 课","t":"Class 2","k":"class","p":[17,18,19],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","To review sentence patterns: will/won't Will........? Am/Is/Are .... Going to .....? To learn IPA phonics: final sound of [s] [z] [ɪz]","复习句型：will/won't　Will........?　Am/Is/Are .... Going to .....?；学习国际音标自然拼读：词尾音 [s] [z] [ɪz]",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Point to the place where it hurts","- 指出痛的地方",1],["li","- Tell the doctor how you feel","- 告诉医生你的感觉",1],["li","- Say \"ouch\" when something hurts","- 痛的时候说 \"ouch\"",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7A Lesson 2","课堂活动 7A 第 2 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","none","无",1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","the digital equipment, sticky ball, magnets","数字设备、黏黏球、磁铁",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 1","EEC 4 第 1 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","chest, head, arm, leg, shoulder, elbow, knee, foot",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","It hurts here.","A",1],["d","Does it hurt when I press with my fingers here?","B",1],["d","Just a little bit.","A",1],["d","If you move?","B",1],["d","Ouch!","A",1],["d","OK. Let's take an X- Ray!","B",1],["d","Does it hurt?","A",1],["d","Not at all. Don't worry.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (5mins)","热身（5 分钟）",0],["p","Attendance/spelling: Review spelling of Lesson 1 words. Game # 8: What's missing here?","点名／拼写：复习第 1 课单词的拼法。游戏 #8：这里少了什么？",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 2 (30 mins)","课堂活动第 2 课（30 分钟）",0],["h2","2.5 IPA Phonics","2.5 国际音标自然拼读",0],["li","(1) Write the words from 2.5 on the board and tell the students the phonetic rule:","(1) 把 2.5 的字写在白板上，告诉学生发音规则：",0],["p","Voiced [z], voiceless [s] , [z] pronounce [ɪz] [ɪz] [ɪz]","有声 [z]，无声 [s]，[z] 念 [ɪz] [ɪz] [ɪz]",0],["li","(2) Practice the final sound of the words with the students. Have the students give some more examples.","(2) 和学生练习这些字的词尾音，让学生再举一些例子。",0],["li","(3) Have the students open their books and say and write the IPA final sounds. Correct their answers.","(3) 让学生打开书说出并写下国际音标词尾音，订正他们的答案。",0],["h3","2.1 Make sentences using the given words","2.1 用提供的字造句",0],["d","The teacher gives the students the words for 2.1.Have the students make a sentence using the given words.","Group Practice",0],["p","Game # 18: Monster face or # 23. Sticky Ball Scoring is suggested.","建议玩游戏 #18：怪物脸，或 #23：黏黏球计分。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 2 (40 mins)","课堂活动第 2 课（40 分钟）",0],["li","2.2 Figure out the sentence. Then make a question based on the sentence. Pair the students up. Have them figure out the questions and answers. When they're finished, have each pair stand up. One should read the question, the other reads the answer.","2.2 弄懂句子，再根据句子提出问题。让学生两两一组想出问题和答案。完成后每组站起来，一人念问题，另一人念答案。",0],["h3","2.3 Solve the puzzle and fill in the blanks","2.3 解谜并填空",0],["p","Have the students solve the puzzle, and without writing, take turns throwing the die, standing up, and telling the class what each child should do.","让学生解谜，不用写，轮流掷骰子、站起来，告诉全班每个小孩应该做什么。",0],["h3","2.4 Unscramble the words and fill in the word box below","2.4 把字母重组并填入下面的字框",0],["d","The teacher gives the students words to be unscrambled. Have the students unscramble them and write them on the board. Then have them read the words chorally.","Group Practice",0],["h3","2.6 Song: Did You Ever See A Lassie?","2.6 歌曲：Did You Ever See A Lassie?",0],["h2","Presentation","成果发表",0],["h2","Go to page 2.6 (In Digital Jordan)","进到 2.6 页（数字乔登）",0],["li","(1) Play the song and have the students listen and look at the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 播放歌曲，让学生一边听一边看触控一体机。",0],["li","(2) Explain the lyrics and have the students chant them.","(2) 解释歌词，让学生用念谣方式念。",0],["li","(3) Sing the song together.","(3) 一起唱这首歌。",0],["d","The teacher writes the lyrics on the board, then plays the song.","Group Practice",0],["p","The students should listen carefully and put the magnet on the last word when the teacher stops the song. Game: Simple Score","学生要仔细听，老师暂停歌曲时，把磁铁放在最后一个字上。游戏：简单计分",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","To start the class","开始上课",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles.","快速复习上一堂课的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Listening Exercise","听力练习",0],["p","Bob has a cold and doesn't feel good. He is visiting the doctor. Listen and check what hurts and use an \"X\" to show what is not hurting.","Bob 感冒了，觉得不舒服，正在看医生。听一听，勾出哪里痛，用“X”表示哪里不痛。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the Let's Check monolog. Let's Check:Monolog If we are not careful, we may get hurt. When we catch a cold, we often feel uncomfortable and many of our body parts are sore. What are our body parts? Our chest, head, arms, legs, shoulders, elbows, knees and feet. Please turn to page 6: Let's check. Bob has a cold and he doesn't feel well. He is visiting the doctor. Listen and check what hurts and use an \"X\" to show what is not hurting.","播放 Let's Check 独白。Let's Check：独白　如果不小心，我们可能会受伤。感冒时常常觉得不舒服，身体很多部位都会酸痛。我们的身体部位有哪些？胸部、头、手臂、腿、肩膀、手肘、膝盖和脚。请翻到第 6 页：Let's check。Bob 感冒了，觉得不舒服，正在看医生。听一听，勾出哪里痛，用“X”表示哪里不痛。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Review / point out the key words. Explain the exercise.Have the students do the exercise as they listening to the MP3.","复习／指出关键字，说明练习方式。让学生一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to","他们一做完就开始订正，告诉他们答案并帮他们",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if necessary.)","改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播一次对话给全班听。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["li","●",null,0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have an understanding.","利用这段时间预习家庭作业。在白板上写几个例子让他们了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 1","电话教学教材 1",0],["p","(See also Telephone Teaching in the front of this manual.)","（另见本手册前面的电话教学。）",0],["h3","Part 1: Greeting","第 1 部分：问候",0],["h3","Part 2: Q. and A.","第 2 部分：问答",0],["p","1.Are you going to have a happy birthday? 2.Will you go to bed early? 3.How do you spell \"everything\"? 4.Are you going to watch TV tonight? 5.Will you go to the beach on Sunday?","1. Are you going to have a happy birthday?（你会过一个快乐的生日吗？）2. Will you go to bed early?（你会早点睡吗？）3. How do you spell \"everything\"?（\"everything\" 怎么拼？）4. Are you going to watch TV tonight?（你今晚要看电视吗？）5. Will you go to the beach on Sunday?（你星期天会去海边吗？）",0],["h3","Part 3: Ending","第 3 部分：结尾",0]],"g":[[26,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 2","2.5","2.1"]],[38,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 2","2.2","2.3","2. 4","2.6"]],[73,["Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 3 课","t":"Class 3","k":"class","p":[20,21,22,23],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","To use the past tense of \"to be\" when forming both positive and negative statements.","用 be 动词的过去时造肯定句和否定句。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Point to the places that hurt","- 指出痛的地方",1],["li","- Tell the doctor how you feel","- 告诉医生你的感觉",1],["li","- Say \"ouch\" when something hurts you","- 痛的时候说 \"ouch\"",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 2","Classroom Readers 第 2 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","scared, believe, were, either, nothing, weird, wasn't, fight, yesterday, last",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7A Lesson 3","课堂活动 7A 第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","yesterday, yesterday morning, yesterday afternoon, last night",null,1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","was/wasn't; were/weren't",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, the digital equipment","单词卡、数字设备",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 1","EEC 4 第 1 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","chest, head, arm, leg, shoulder, elbow, knee, foot",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","It hurts here.","A",1],["d","Does it hurt when I press with my fingers here?","B",1],["d","Just a little bit.","A",1],["d","If you move?","B",1],["d","Ouch!","A",1],["d","OK. Let's take an X- Ray!","B",1],["d","Does it hurt?","A",1],["d","Not at all. Take it easy.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["h3","Review the subject and the verb \"to be:\"","复习主语和 be 动词：",0],["p","I am You/We/They are He/She/It is. T.I am. You____?","I am　You/We/They are　He/She/It is.　T.：I am. You____?",0],["d","You are.","Ss",0],["p","T.: He___?","T.：He___?",0],["d","He is.","Ss",0],["h3","Group Practice","分组练习",0],["p","Write the subjects and the be verbs above on a sheet of A4 paper. Make several photocopies. Mix the papers up and have the students match the subjects with the correct verb forms as quickly as they can. Classroom Activities Lesson 2","把上面的主语和 be 动词写在一张 A4 纸上，复印几份。把纸打乱，让学生尽快把主语和正确的动词形式配对。课堂活动第 2 课",0],["h3","3.3 Review making questions using \"Is,\" \"Are,\" and \"Am\"","3.3 复习用 \"Is\"、\"Are\" 和 \"Am\" 造问句",0],["d","The teacher gives the answers and has the students make questions.","Group Practice",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (15 mins) Lesson 3","课堂活动（15 分钟）第 3 课",0],["h3","3.4 IPA Phonetics","3.4 国际音标",0],["li","(1) Write the IPA symbols for 3.4 on the board. Have the students pronounce them and give some examples of the sounds. Review the phonetics rule.","(1) 把 3.4 的国际音标写在白板上，让学生念出来并举一些这些音的例子，复习发音规则。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["d","The teacher says the words for 3.4 A and 3.4 B. Have the students fill in the blanks with the correct consonant, and say all the words in chorus.","Group Practice",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (20 mins) Lesson 2","课堂读本（20 分钟）第 2 课",0],["h3","1.Pre-teach","1. 预先教学",0],["p","Pre-teach the patterns as indicated below:","依下面的方式预先教句型：",0],["p","T.: (Draw a one week calendar on the board. Mark the day you are having class \"Today\". Mark the day before that \"Yesterday\". Draw a picture of you in the classroom on the day marked \"Today\" and a picture of you in the library on the day marked \"Yesterday\".) I am in the classroom today. (Point to yesterday) I was in the library yesterday. I am teaching English today. I was reading books yesterday. (Continue to present is→was are→were isn't→wasn't aren't→weren't.) (Write the chart below on the board.) Today Yesterday am was is was are were","T.：（在白板上画一周的月历。把上课这天标上“Today”，前一天标上“Yesterday”。在“Today”那天画你在教室的图，在“Yesterday”那天画你在图书馆的图。）I am in the classroom today.（指着昨天）I was in the library yesterday. I am teaching English today. I was reading books yesterday.（继续呈现 is→was、are→were、isn't→wasn't、aren't→weren't。）（在白板上写下面的表。）Today　Yesterday　am was　is was　are were",0],["h3","2. Story presentation","2. 故事呈现",0],["li","1. Go to the Learning page. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one.","1. 进到 Learning 页面，让学生看触控一体机。",0],["li","2. New words: presentation","2. 新单词：呈现",0],["li","(1) Teach the new words using phonetic spelling. Take this chance to review the IPA symbols while teaching the spelling.","(1) 用音标拼写教新单词，趁教拼写的机会复习国际音标。",0],["li","(2) Teach the new words using V.A.C. Give sentence examples or short situational stories. Then have a student say the meaning in Chinese or choose the correct one from several meanings you have provided.","(2) 用 V.A.C. 教新单词，举例句或简短的情境故事，再请一位学生说出中文意思，或从你提供的几个意思中选出正确的。",0],["li","(3) See it and say it. Then make a sentence using the new word.","(3) 看图说说（See it and say it），再用新单词造句。",0],["h3","3. Go to the Translation page.","3. 进到翻译页面。",0],["li","(1) Have the students listen and repeat the sentences.","(1) 让学生听并跟着念句子。",0],["h3","4. Reinforcement","4. 加强",0],["p","Have the students open their books and read the story.","让学生打开书念故事。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 3 (30 mins)","课堂活动第 3 课（30 分钟）",0],["h3","3.1 Vocabulary","3.1 单词",0],["li","(1) Teach the new words using phonetic spelling. Take this chance to review the IPA symbols while teaching the spelling.","(1) 用音标拼写教新单词，趁教拼写的机会复习国际音标。",0],["li","(2) Teach the new words using V.A.C. Draw a clock on the board to show the students the","(2) 用 V.A.C. 教新单词。在白板上画一个时钟，让学生看每个短语",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","appropriate time to say each phrase.","适合在什么时间说。",0],["li","(3) Compare time phrases of the present and past tenses. Be aware of the correct use of prepositions. T.: Today","(3) 比较现在时和过去时的时间短语，注意介词的正确用法。T.：Today",0],["d","Yesterday T.: In the morning","Ss",0],["d","Yesterday morning T.: In the afternoon","Ss",0],["d","Yesterday afternoon T.: At night Ss.: Last night","Ss",0],["h3","3.2A Look at the pictures and practice with your classmates","3.2A 看图和同学练习",0],["d","The teacher makes copies of pictures and statements for 3.2A. Put the statement copies on the floor. Show the students one of the pictures and have them hit the statement that corresponds with the picture.. Read the words chorally at the end.","Group Practice",0],["p","Game: Simple score","游戏：简单计分",0],["h3","3. 2B Change the underlined word and make a new sentence using","3.2B 换掉画下划线的字，用过去时",0],["h3","the past tense","造一个新句子",0],["d","Write simple sentences in the present tense. Have the students change them into the past tense. Do this orally, and then in written form.","Group Practice",0],["p","Game # 7: Matching and memorization (also to review today's IPA)","游戏 #7：配对与记忆（也用来复习今天的国际音标）",0],["h3","Activity Sheet No.1","活动单 1",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the appropritheir self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生勾选并向全班报告自我评估。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog for the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front of the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10mins)","（10 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下堂课带蜡笔。",0]],"g":[[39,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV"]],[39,["Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 3"]],[44,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 2","Learning"]],[58,["儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 1","Classroom Activities"]],[58,["Lesson 3","Learning","Playing","3.1","3.2A","3.2B"]],[84,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 4 课","t":"Class 4","k":"class","p":[24,25,26,27],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","To ask about past activities. To identify rooms in a house. To ask questions using \"was\" and \"were\"","询问过去的活动；认识房屋里的房间；用 \"was\" 和 \"were\" 提问",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Cooperating with the doctor","- 配合医生",1],["li","- Following his instructions","- 听从医生的指示",1],["li","- Being quiet while the dentist works","- 牙医治疗时保持安静",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 3","Classroom Readers 第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","noise, airplane, God, dinosaurs, yells, stupid, caveman, bears,",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7A Lesson 4","课堂活动 7A 第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","kitchen, living room, bedroom, bathroom",null,1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Was ? Were ?",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","the digital equipment, a dice","数字设备、骰子",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 2","EEC 4 第 2 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","tooth, lip, tongue, mouth, nose, ear, eyes, forehead",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Open you mouth , Brian.","A",1],["d","I'll just clean you teeth. Trust me.","A",1],["d","I do.","B",1],["d","If something hurts you, just raise your left hand.","A",1],["d","All right. Can I close my eyes?","B",1],["d","For sure. Don't move your head, OK?","A",1],["d","Hmm.","B",1],["d","What's wrong?","A",1],["d","I'm sorry. I just want to spit.","B",1],["d","OK. Wash your mouth now.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to review was and were by asking the students questions in the past tense:","(1) 利用这段时间用过去时问学生问题，复习 was 和 were：",0],["d","Where were you yesterday morning?","T",0],["p","S1 I was in the park yesterday morning.","S1　I was in the park yesterday morning.（我昨天早上在公园。）",0],["d","(To the class) Where was S1 yesterday morning?","T",0],["d","She was in the park yesterday morning.","Ss",0],["d","What were you doing yesterday afternoon?","T",0],["p","S2 I was reading a book yesterday afternoon.","S2　I was reading a book yesterday afternoon.（我昨天下午在看书。）",0],["d","(To the class) What was S2 doing yesterday afternoon?","T",0],["d","She was reading a book yesterday afternoon.","Ss",0],["p","Activity: Have a student throw the die and get a number. Choose S1, S2 to answer the question by counting the number on the dice.","活动：让一位学生掷骰子得到一个数字，依骰子点数数到 S1、S2 来回答问题。",0],["li","(2) Give a pop quiz if necessary.","(2) 必要时做个随堂测验。",0],["h2","IPA Phonetic Pronunciation (10mins)","国际音标发音（10 分钟）",0],["h2","C.A. 4.4",null,0],["li","(1) Review the IPA symbols learned recently, and practice phonetic spelling.","(1) 复习最近学过的国际音标，练习音标拼写。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Write some IPA symbols on the board. Have the students pronounce them. Now have the students spell them using the standard alphabet. T.:(write [t])","在白板上写一些国际音标，让学生念出来，再让学生用一般字母拼出来。T.：（写 [t]）",0],["d","[t] T.: How do we pronounce [t]?","Ss",0],["d","t t t [t] [t] [t] t!","Ss",0],["p","Game #3: IPA translation relay","游戏 #3：国际音标翻译接力",0],["li","(2) Show the students the digital content. Give some of the students a chance to use the touchscreen all-in-one. Take this as a reinforcement of 4-4.","(2) 给学生看数字内容，让部分学生有机会操作触控一体机，作为 4-4 的加强。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins) Lesson 3","课堂读本（30 分钟）第 3 课",0],["h2","New words:","新单词：",0],["li","(1) Show the new words that will be taught today on the monitor. Then continue teaching them. Go to the New Words page.","(1) 在屏幕上展示今天要教的新单词，接着教学。进到 New Words 页面。",0],["d","noise","T",0],["d","noise","Ss",0],["d","n n n [n] [n] [n],oi oi oi [ɔɪ] [ɔɪ] [ɔɪ] se: here we pronounce [z] [n]-[ɔɪ]-[z]: [nɔɪz]","T",0],["d","[n]-[ɔɪ]-[z] : [nɔɪz]","Ss",0],["li","(2) Teach the new words using V.A.C. or explain them in English.","(2) 用 V.A.C. 教新单词或用英语解释。",0],["d","Write the vocabulary on the board and teach it, using visuals or any other method. (Avoid using Chinese to teach English!)","Group Activity",0],["h3","Game #19 Spy Code","游戏 #19：间谍密码",0],["h2","Playing:","游戏（Playing）：",0],["li","(1) Show the story on the monitor. Go to the New Words page.","(1) 在屏幕上播放故事。进到 New Words 页面。",0],["li","(2) Go to the \"Translation\" page. Have the students read each sentence chorally. Group practice: role play","(2) 进到“翻译”页面，让学生齐声念每一句。分组练习：角色扮演",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 4 (30 mins)","课堂活动第 4 课（30 分钟）",0],["h3","4.1 Vocabulary","4.1 单词",0],["li","(1) Show the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词。",0],["li","(2) Have the students make sentences using the vocabulary in both present and past tense. ex: My mother is in the kitchen now. She was in the living room yesterday. Activity: Draw a picture of some rooms of a house on the board. Write the students' names in blue and black. Blue indicates where they are today. Black indicates where they were yesterday. Then ask a question like the one below:","(2) 让学生用单词造现在时和过去时的句子，例如：My mother is in the kitchen now. She was in the living room yesterday.　活动：在白板上画几个房间，用蓝色和黑色写学生的名字，蓝色表示他们今天在哪里，黑色表示他们昨天在哪里。然后问像下面这样的问题：",0],["p","Was Alice in the living room? and choose \"Yes\" or \"No\" with a hit. Game: hitting game+ say the complete sentence.","Was Alice in the living room? 并用打击选择 \"Yes\" 或 \"No\"。游戏：打击游戏＋说出完整句子。",0],["h3","4.2 A",null,0],["p","Group practice: Have the students find 4 different partners to complete the Q and A orally. They have to switch roles with each other. Do the last one with the teacher.","分组练习：让学生找 4 位不同的伙伴口头完成问答，彼此要交换角色，最后一个和老师做。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","The students who finish can write their names in order on the board and sit down.","完成的学生可以依序在白板上写自己的名字，然后坐下。",0],["h3","4.2 B.",null,0],["p","Group practice: Write the exercises on the board. Have the students write the questions/answers on the board. Make a group race of this exercise.","分组练习：把练习写在白板上，让学生在白板上写出问题／答案，做成分组竞赛。",0],["h3","Activity Sheet No.2","活动单 2",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See And Say.","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Introduction:","引导：",0],["p","Have the students listen to the Let's See And Say monolog. You can either read it to the class, or use the MP3. Let's See And Say:Monolog How did you feel when you went to the dentist for the first time? Brian is visiting the dentist and he is a little afraid. Let's listen to the conversation.","让学生听 Let's See And Say 独白，你可以念给全班听或用 MP3。Let's See And Say：独白　你第一次去看牙医时感觉如何？Brian 正在看牙医，他有点害怕。我们来听听对话。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the monolog they have just listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you want to emphasize. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson by combining the dialog and the vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Pair the students up. Have each pair practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，每组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3. Encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends.","提醒学生在家听 MP3 复习课程，鼓励他们和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(5 mins)","（5 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 2","电话教学教材 2",0],["p","(See also Telephone Teaching in the front of this manual.) Part 1: Greeting Part 2: Q and A.","（另见本手册前面的电话教学。）第 1 部分：问候　第 2 部分：问答",0],["li","1. Was your father playing ball?","1. Was your father playing ball?（你爸爸那时在打球吗？）",0],["li","2. Were you in the kitchen?","2. Were you in the kitchen?（你刚才在厨房吗？）",0],["li","3. Was your mother watching TV?","3. Was your mother watching TV?（你妈妈那时在看电视吗？）",0],["li","4. Who was running after the kids?","4. Who was running after the kids?（谁在追那些孩子？）",0],["li","5. How do you spell \"noise\"? Part 3: Ending","5. How do you spell \"noise\"?（\"noise\" 怎么拼？）第 3 部分：结尾",0]],"g":[[31,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities"]],[44,["Lesson 4","4-4 A","4.4 B"]],[53,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 3","New words","Playing","Translation"]],[65,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 4","4.1"]],[77,["● Follow the same","steps above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":95},{"z":"第 5 课","t":"Class 5","k":"class","p":[28,29,30],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","To ask/answer questions about past events using \"did\" and respond positively adding \"ed\" to the verb. To review common sports.","用 \"did\" 问答过去的事件，并在动词后加 \"ed\" 做肯定回答；复习常见的运动。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Cooperating with the doctor","- 配合医生",1],["li","- Following his instructions","- 听从医生的指示",1],["li","- Being quiet while the dentist works","- 牙医治疗时保持安静",1],["h3","Classroom Reader Lesson 4","课堂读本第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","whispers, sneezes, did, looked, ropes, around,",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7A Lesson 5","课堂活动 7A 第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","played basketball, played ping-pong, played baseball, played soccer",null,1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Did I/you/he/she/it/we/they ?",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","the digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 2","EEC 4 第 2 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","tooth, lip, tongue, mouth, nose, ear, eyes, forehead",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Open you mouth , Brian.","A",1],["d","I'll just clean you teeth. Trust me","A",1],["d","I do.","B",1],["d","If something hurts you, just raise your left hand.","A",1],["d","All right.. Can I close my eyes?","B",1],["d","For sure. Don't move your head, OK?","A",1],["d","Hmm.","B",1],["d","What's wrong?","A",1],["d","I'm sorry. I just want to spit.","B",1],["d","OK. Wash your mouth now.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Take this time to review all the vocabulary they've previously learned. Have the students guess the word and make a sentence using the word.","(1) 利用这段时间复习之前学过的所有单词，让学生猜字并用那个字造句。",0],["h3","Activity # 56: Hangman","活动 #56：吊人游戏（Hangman）",0],["li","(2) Give a pop quiz if necessary.","(2) 必要时做个随堂测验。",0],["h2","IPA Phonetic Pronunciation (10 mins)","国际音标发音（10 分钟）",0],["h2","C.A. 5.4 A-D",null,0],["li","(1) Go through the rules with the students and drill each sound and word several times. Have the students give you some additional examples of each sound and practice speed reading them.","(1) 和学生一起看规则，每个音和字都操练几次。让学生为每个音再举一些例子，并练习快速念。",0],["h3","Activity # 4: Odd One Out","活动 #4：找出不同类",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins) Lesson 4","课堂读本（30 分钟）第 4 课",0],["h2","Pre-teach:","预先教学：",0],["li","(1) Review the sports presented in this lesson. Next, write the day it was yesterday, the day it is today and the day it will be tomorrow, on the board.","(1) 复习本课介绍的运动。接着在白板上写出昨天、今天和明天是星期几。",0],["li","(2) Write the name of one of your students in the first column. Fill in the chart with","(2) 在第一栏写一位学生的名字，在表中填入",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","sports that take the verb \"play\".","搭配动词 \"play\" 的运动。",0],["li","(3) Model the sentences in the correct tenses. ex: Mary played ping-pong yesterday. She is playing baseball now. She will play soccer tomorrow.","(3) 示范正确时态的句子，例如：Mary played ping-pong yesterday. She is playing baseball now. She will play soccer tomorrow.",0],["li","(4) Explain that \"did\" is the past tense of \"do,\" using the chart below:","(4) 用下表说明 \"did\" 是 \"do\" 的过去时：",0],["p","today yesterday am was is was are were do did does did play played",null,0],["h2","New words:","新单词：",0],["li","(1) Show the new words that will be taught today on the monitor. Then continue teaching them. Go to the New Words page.","(1) 在屏幕上展示今天要教的新单词，接着教学。进到 New Words 页面。",0],["li","(2) Teach the new words using V.A.C. or explain them in English.","(2) 用 V.A.C. 教新单词或用英语解释。",0],["h3","Playing",null,0],["li","(1) Show the story on the monitor first. Go to the Playing page.","(1) 先在屏幕上播放故事。进到 Playing 页面。",0],["li","(2) Go to the Translation page. Have the students read the sentences chorally. Group practice: Have the students read the story chorally. When they come to the past tense, they should sit down. The last one to sit down will be out of the game.","(2) 进到翻译页面，让学生齐声念句子。分组练习：让学生齐声念故事，念到过去时时要坐下，最后坐下的人出局。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 5 (30 mins)","课堂活动第 5 课（30 分钟）",0],["h2","5.1 Vocabulary:","5.1 单词：",0],["li","(1) Show the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词。",0],["li","(2) Have the students make sentences using the vocabulary.","(2) 让学生用单词造句。",0],["h2","5.2 A",null,0],["li","(1) Spread some cards with the verb phrases on them , like \"played basketball,\" \"played ping-pong,\"....(from P. 30)","(1) 铺一些写有动词短语的卡片，如 \"played basketball\"、\"played ping-pong\"……（取自第 30 页）",0],["li","(2) Ask the students some questions. ex.: What did Simon do yesterday? Then give the students clues using gestures.","(2) 问学生一些问题，例如：What did Simon do yesterday? 再用手势给学生提示。",0],["li","(3) The students should hit the card and answer the question. Group practice: hitting game + oral practice","(3) 学生要打中卡片并回答问题。分组练习：打击游戏＋口语练习",0],["h2","5.2 B",null,0],["p","Group practice","分组练习",0],["li","(1) Pair the students up. Have them do some Q & A with each other.","(1) 让学生两两一组互相问答。",0],["li","(2) Take turns throwing the die and choosing a pair of students to say the sentences. Game # 9: Big or Small","(2) 轮流掷骰子，选一组学生说出句子。游戏 #9：大或小",0],["h2","5.3.",null,0],["li","(1) Write the statement on the board.","(1) 把叙述句写在白板上。",0],["li","(2) Have the students make a question . Group practice: writing game Game: #6 Maze","(2) 让学生改成问句。分组练习：书写游戏　游戏 #6：迷宫",0],["h2","EEC (15 min)","EEC（15 分钟）",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["p","To start the class:","开始上课：",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Listen and write the letters next to the parts of the head.","听一听，把字母写在头部各部位旁边。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the Let's Check monolog. Let's Check: Monolog We use our teeth, lips, eyes, nose, tongue and ears to do different things. Please turn to page 10; Let's Check. Listen and write the letters next to the parts of the head.","播放 Let's Check 独白。Let's Check：独白　我们用牙齿、嘴唇、眼睛、鼻子、舌头和耳朵做不同的事。请翻到第 10 页：Let's Check。听一听，把字母写在头部各部位旁边。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["li","-Review the key words that are in the listening exercise.","- 复习听力练习中的关键字。",0],["li","-Explain the exercise to the students. Have them do the exercise as they listen to the MP3.","- 向学生说明练习方式，让他们一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(5mins)","（5 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons or markers for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带蜡笔或彩笔。",0]],"g":[[31,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 5","5.4 A","5.4 B","5.4 C","5.4 D"]],[40,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 4","New words","Playing","Translation"]],[55,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 5","5.1"]],[89,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":95},{"z":"第 6 课","t":"Class 6","k":"class","p":[31,32],"b":[["h3","Review Day 1","复习日 1",1],["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Cooperating with the doctor","- 配合医生",1],["li","- Following his instructions","- 听从医生的指示",1],["li","- Being quiet while the dentist works","- 牙医治疗时保持安静",1],["h3","Classroom Readers",null,1],["p","Review L.1-4","复习第 1–4 课",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7A","课堂活动 7A",1],["p","Review L.1-5","复习第 1–5 课",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 2","EEC 4 第 2 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","tooth, lip, tongue, mouth, nose, ear, eyes, forehead",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Open you mouth , Brian.","A",1],["d","I'll just clean you teeth. Trust me","A",1],["d","I do.","B",1],["d","If something hurts you, just raise your left hand.","A",1],["d","All right. Can I close my eyes?","B",1],["d","For sure. Don't move your head, OK?","A",1],["d","Hmm.","B",1],["d","What's wrong?","A",1],["d","I'm sorry. I just want to spit.","B",1],["d","OK. Wash your mouth now.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Review (20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["p","Use this time to catch up on any lessons or areas some students did not have time for in the first five classes. If the students are caught up, spend this time reviewing previous lessons or areas where students seem to be having difficulty. You can do this using drills, games, or any activity that will help the students. Choose those that the students seem to like.","利用这段时间补上前五堂课中部分学生没来得及完成的课程或内容。如果学生都跟上了，就用这段时间复习前几课，或学生似乎有困难的地方。可以用操练、游戏或任何对学生有帮助的活动，挑学生似乎喜欢的。",0],["li","1. Readers review: Go through the readers with the students. Point out all the past tense and future tense constructions that appear. Ask questions from the back of the readers or make up some of your own to check their comprehension. Activity # 7 Forgetful teacher","1. 读本复习：和学生一起看读本，指出所有出现的过去时和将来时结构。问读本后面的问题或自己出题，检查他们的理解。活动 #7：健忘的老师",0],["li","2. IPA phonics review: Go through the book with the students. Review important phonics exercises. Activity # 7 Matching and memorization #10. Phonics tic-tac-toe plus #11 Spelling phonics or # 12 Phonics switch.","2. 国际音标自然拼读复习：和学生一起看书，复习重要的发音练习。活动 #7 配对与记忆、#10 自然拼读井字游戏，再加上 #11 拼写发音或 #12 发音替换。",0],["li","3. Practice the future tense/past tense with the students. Activity # 14 paper airplane game or # 15 Frog","3. 和学生练习将来时／过去时。活动 #14 纸飞机游戏或 #15 青蛙",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["li","1. Have the students put all books and unnecessary things away. Hand out the quiz and have the students take it.","1. 请学生把所有书本和不需要的东西收起来，发下考卷让学生作答。",0],["li","2. Make sure that the students understand each item.","2. 确定学生理解每个项目。",0],["li","3. Walk around the classroom and check the quiz for the students to avoid misunderstandings","3. 在教室里走动检查考卷，避免学生误解题意。",0],["li","4. The students may not talk or cheat during the quiz. If the students don't get good grades, they have to make it up next class (Teachers can have their own grade standard.).","(4) 小测验时学生不能说话或作弊。成绩不理想的学生，下次上课要补考（老师可以自定评分标准）。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (25 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（25 mins）",0],["p","Check the tape and the recorder before the students come back from the break. Prepare for the listening quiz.","在学生下课休息回来前，先检查录音带和录音机，准备听力小测验。",0],["li","1. Turn on the tape and have the students fill in the appropriate blanks.","1. 播放录音带，请学生在适当的空格中作答。",0],["li","2. Listening is a very important aspect of learning a new language.","2. 听力是学习新语言非常重要的一环。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate space. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Pair the students up. Have each pair do a mini role-play of the dialog for the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front of the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，每组把本单元的对话做成小型角色扮演。每组都要在全班面前示范，老师要确定每个人都能轻松完成对话，也要注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the contents of the quiz and the listening test that they took. Discuss it with the students. Ask if they had any problems.","(1) 复习学生考过的小测验和听力测验内容，和学生讨论，问他们有没有问题。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 3","电话教学教材 3",0],["p","(See also Telephone Teaching in the front of this manual.) Part 1: Greeting Part 2: Q and A","（另见本手册前面的电话教学。）第 1 部分：问候　第 2 部分：问答",0],["li","1. Did you go to school yesterday?","1. Did you go to school yesterday?（你昨天有去上学吗？）",0],["li","2. Did your classmate, Eric, play basketball yesterday afternoon?","2. Did your classmate, Eric, play basketball yesterday afternoon?（你的同学 Eric 昨天下午有打篮球吗？）",0],["li","3. Do you brush your teeth at noon?","3. Do you brush your teeth at noon?（你中午会刷牙吗？）",0],["li","4. Do you go to school by bus?","4. Do you go to school by bus?（你搭公交车上学吗？）",0],["li","5. Does your mother go to bed early every night? Part 3: Ending","5. Does your mother go to bed early every night?（你妈妈每天晚上都很早睡吗？）第 3 部分：结尾",0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1- Lesson 4"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":90},{"z":"第 7 课","t":"Class 7","k":"class","p":[33,34],"b":[["h2","Test Day 1","测验日 1",0],["p","Classroom Reader 7 Review Lessons 1-4 Classroom Activities 7A Review Lessons 1-5","课堂读本 7 复习第 1–4 课　课堂活动 7A 复习第 1–5 课",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review","复习",0],["h3","(30 mins)","（30 分钟）",0],["li","(1) Give the students corrected Quiz # 1 andListening Lab # 1. Check their errors.","(1) 把批改好的第 1 次小测验和第 1 次听力测验发给学生，检查他们的错误。",0],["li","(2) Do some activities to review vocabulary, sentences, and IPA symbols. Activity: correct the errors The teacher boards up (writes) some wrong words or sentences often made by the students. Have the students correct them.","(2) 做一些活动复习单词、句子和国际音标。活动：改错　老师在白板上写出学生常犯错的字或句子，让学生改正。",0],["h2","Test (40 mins)","测验 Test（40 mins）",0],["li","1. Have the students put all books and unnecessary things away. Hand out the test and have the students do it.","1. 请学生把所有书本和不需要的东西收起来，发下考卷让学生作答。",0],["li","2. Make sure that the students understand each item.","2. 确定学生理解每个项目。",0],["li","3. Walk around the classroom and check the test for the students to avoid misunderstandings.","3. 在教室里走动检查考卷，避免学生误解题意。",0],["li","4. The students may not talk or cheat during the test. If the students don't get good grades, they have to make it up next class. (Teachers can have their own grade standard.).","(4) 小测验时学生不能说话或作弊。成绩不理想的学生，下次上课要补考（老师可以自定评分标准）。",0],["h2","Oral Test","口语测验",0],["li","(1) Conduct the following oral test outside of the classroom, individually, with the students.","(1) 在教室外与学生个别进行下面的口试。",0],["li","(2) The other students can draw, read, or watch video programs in the classroom. If there are enough touchscreen all-in-ones in your branch school, you may have the students go to Jordan's web site to do some interesting exercises.","(2) 其他学生可以在教室里画画、阅读或看视频。如果分校有足够的触控一体机，可以让学生上乔登网站做一些有趣的练习。",0],["h2","Oral Test #1 (20%)","口试 #1（20%）",0],["li","1. Did you play ping-pong yesterday?","1. Did you play ping-pong yesterday?（你昨天有打乒乓球吗？）",0],["li","2. Were you in the classroom yesterday?","2. Were you in the classroom yesterday?（你昨天在教室吗？）",0],["li","3. Was your mother in the kitchen last night?","3. Was your mother in the kitchen last night?（你妈妈昨晚在厨房吗？）",0],["li","4. Do you go to school in the morning?","4. Do you go to school in the morning?（你早上去上学吗？）",0],["li","5. Will you visit friends on Saturday? Each question is worth four points; one each for comprehension, grammar, pronunciation, and fluency. Give the students the opportunity to correct their own mistakes first.","5. Will you visit friends on Saturday?（你星期六会去拜访朋友吗？）每题 4 分，理解、语法、发音和流畅度各 1 分。先给学生自己改正错误的机会。",0],["h2","Activities (20mins)","活动（20 分钟）",0],["p","If there is more time after Test, you can play some games with the students.","考完试后如果还有时间，可以和学生玩一些游戏。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Homework Exercises","1- 家庭作业",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that","利用这段时间预习家庭作业。在白板上写几个例子，让他们",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","they have somewhat of an understanding.","有些概念。",0],["h2","2-Progress Report Book","2. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[3,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1- Lesson 4","&","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1- Lesson 5"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":60},{"z":"第 8 课","t":"Class 8","k":"class","p":[35],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 1","活动日 1",0],["p","Classroom Readers 7 Review Lessons 1-4 Classroom Activities 7A Review Lessons 1-5","课堂读本 7 复习第 1–4 课　课堂活动 7A 复习第 1–5 课",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Games &Activities (70mins)","游戏与活动（70 分钟）",0],["p","Do some games or activities that reflect the material learned. The following games are suggested:","做一些反映所学内容的游戏或活动。建议以下游戏：",0],["li","(1) Vocabulary /phonics review: Game # 34 Concentration Game #10 Phonics tic-tac-toe Game #2 Blind man's bluff Game #5 Reconstruction Game #16 Team mime","(1) 单词／自然拼读复习：游戏 #34 记忆翻牌　游戏 #10 自然拼读井字游戏　游戏 #2 蒙眼摸人　游戏 #5 重组　游戏 #16 团队比手画脚",0],["li","(2) Tense review: Game #14 True or false chairs Game #16 My name is John. Game #5 Search Game # 9 Word building Game # 4 Hot rock Game # 6 Find someone who..","(2) 时态复习：游戏 #14 对错椅子　游戏 #16 My name is John.　游戏 #5 搜索　游戏 #9 造字　游戏 #4 烫手山芋　游戏 #6 找到某个……的人",0],["li","(3) Readers review: Game # 7 Forgetful teacher","(3) 读本复习：游戏 #7 健忘的老师",0],["li","(4) EEC review: Role play","(4) EEC 复习：角色扮演",0],["h2","Activity sheet 3:(20mins)","活动单 3：（20 分钟）",0],["d","Review tenses.","Goal",0],["p","Make sentences with the pictures.","看图造句。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Homework Exercises","1- 家庭作业",0],["p","Take this time to preview the homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","2-Progress Report Book","2. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 4","电话教学教材 4",0],["p","(See also Telephone Teaching in the front of this manual.) Part 1: Greeting Part 2: Q and A 1.Will you go to bed early?","（另见本手册前面的电话教学。）第 1 部分：问候　第 2 部分：问答　1. Will you go to bed early?（你会早点睡吗？）",0],["li","2. Are you going to visit friends tonight?","2. Are you going to visit friends tonight?（你今晚要去拜访朋友吗？）",0],["li","3. Were you watching TV?","3. Were you watching TV?（你刚才在看电视吗？）",0],["li","4. Was your mother in the kitchen?","4. Was your mother in the kitchen?（你妈妈刚才在厨房吗？）",0],["li","5. Did you play basketball yesterday? Part 3: Ending","5. Did you play basketball yesterday?（你昨天有打篮球吗？）第 3 部分：结尾",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":90},{"z":"第 9 课","t":"Class 9","k":"class","p":[36,37,38],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","To ask questions about the past and answer in the negative. To be able to identify common western foods.","问关于过去的问题并做否定回答；能认识常见的西式食物。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Handling minor emergencies","- 处理小意外",1],["li","- Telling mom what happened","- 告诉妈妈发生了什么事",1],["li","- Asking for a doctor's advice","- 询问医生的建议",1],["h3","Classroom Readers 7 Lesson 5","课堂读本 7 第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","children, dear, turn off,",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7A Lesson 6","课堂活动 7A 第 6 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","cooked, baked, soup, spaghetti, bread",null,1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Did_______? No,____.",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment.","数字设备。",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 3","EEC 4 第 3 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","basin, shower, bathtub , toilet , comb , toothbrush, toothpaste, soap",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Mom! Mom! Mom!","A",1],["d","I am here. What's going on?","B",1],["d","I've got a cut.","A",1],["d","Let me see, dear.","B",1],["d","Oh , mom. It's hurting!!","A",1],["d","OK. Let's wash it with clean water and soap","B",1],["d","Are you going to put any medicine on it?","A",1],["d","Later. We'll see the doctor first","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","IPA Phonetic Pronunciation (10 mins)","国际音标发音（10 分钟）",0],["h3","C.A. 6.4 A-B",null,0],["li","(1) Go through the rules with the students and practice each sound and word several times.","(1) 和学生一起看规则，每个音和字都练习几次。",0],["h3","C.A. 6.4 C",null,0],["p","Activity: writing game The teacher writes a verb ending with \"y.\" Have the students write the past tense on the board.","活动：书写游戏　老师写一个以 \"y\" 结尾的动词，让学生在白板上写出过去时。",0],["h3","C.A. 6.4 D",null,0],["p","Activity: hitting game The teacher writes the verbs for 6.4 D on the board. Have the students hit the correct final \"ed' sound on the board. Game: #89 Chess board","活动：打击游戏　老师把 6.4 D 的动词写在白板上，让学生打中正确的 \"ed\" 词尾音。游戏：#89 棋盘",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (35 mins) Lesson 5","课堂读本（35 分钟）第 5 课",0],["h3","New words","新单词",0],["li","(1) Show the new words that will be taught today on the monitor. Then continue teaching them. Go to the New Words page.","(1) 在屏幕上展示今天要教的新单词，接着教学。进到 New Words 页面。",0],["li","(2) Teach the new words using V.A.C. or explain them in English. Tell the students that \"children\" is two or more and \"child\" is one. Add \"turn on\" when teaching \"turn off\".","(2) 用 V.A.C. 教新单词或用英语解释。告诉学生 \"children\" 是两个以上，\"child\" 是一个。教 \"turn off\" 时加上 \"turn on\"。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Playing:","游戏（Playing）：",0],["li","(1) Show the story on the monitor. Go to the Playing page.","(1) 在屏幕上播放故事。进到 Playing 页面。",0],["li","(2) Go to the Translation page. Have the students read each sentence chorally. Group practice: Have the students ask the questions and answer them. Game # 4 Hot rock","(2) 进到翻译页面，让学生齐声念每一句。分组练习：让学生提问并回答。游戏 #4 烫手山芋",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 6","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 6 课",0],["h3","6.1 Vocabulary","6.1 单词",0],["li","(1) Show the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 用触控一体机展示单词。",0],["li","(2) Have the students make sentences using the vocabulary.","(2) 让学生用单词造句。",0],["h3","6.2 A",null,0],["li","(3) Spread copies of the sentences on P.37 on the floor.","(3) 把第 37 页句子的复印件铺在地上。",0],["li","(4) The teacher asks the students some questions. ex.: What did Alice do yesterday? Then give the students clues by showing the pictures on p.37.","(4) 老师问学生一些问题，例如：What did Alice do yesterday? 再展示第 37 页的图给学生提示。",0],["li","(5)The students should hit the correct sentence and answer the question.","(5) 学生要打中正确的句子并回答问题。",0],["h3","6.2 B",null,0],["p","Group practice","分组练习",0],["li","(1) Pair the students up. Have them practice the Q & A with each other.","(1) 让学生两两一组互相练习问答。",0],["li","(2) Take turns, by throwing the die, to choose a pair to say the sentences. Game # 92 Big or Small","(2) 轮流掷骰子，选一组说出句子。游戏 #92 大或小",0],["h3","6.3",null,0],["li","(1) The teacher writes the statement on the board.","(1) 老师把叙述句写在白板上。",0],["li","(2) Have the students make a question . Group practice: writing game Game #6 maze","(2) 让学生改成问句。分组练习：书写游戏　游戏 #6 迷宫",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See & Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Introduction","引导",0],["p","Have the students listen to the Let's See and Say monolog. You can either read it to the students, or use the MP3. Let's See & Say: Monolog What do you do if you get a cut? The boy is not careful and he gets a cut in the bathroom. Let's listen to what happens to him.","让学生听 Let's See and Say 独白，你可以念给学生听或用 MP3。Let's See & Say：独白　如果你割伤了会怎么做？这个男孩不小心，在浴室割伤了。我们来听听他发生了什么事。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you want to emphasize. Then play the dialog for","让全班根据听到的独白猜测并预测本课的主题和相关单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，给他们分享想法的机会。把学生的想法写在白板上，并补充你想强调的重点。然后第一次播放对话，",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","the first time and have the students listen carefully.","让学生仔细听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson by combining the dialog and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Pair the students up. Have each team practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，每组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["li","Step 6:","步骤 6：",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3. Encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends.","提醒学生在家听 MP3 复习课程，鼓励他们和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons or markers for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带蜡笔或彩笔。",0]],"g":[[29,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 6","6.4 A/6.4 B/6.4 C/6.4 D"]],[36,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers"]],[36,["Lesson 5","New words","Playing","Translation"]],[44,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 6","6.1"]],[80,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 10 课","t":"Class 10","k":"class","p":[39,40,41,42],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","Review of Was.....? Were ..........? Did ............?","复习 Was.....? Were ..........? Did ............?",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Handling minor emergencies.","- 处理小意外。",1],["li","- Telling mom what happened","- 告诉妈妈发生了什么事",1],["li","- Asking for a doctor's advice.","- 询问医生的建议。",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7A Lesson 7","课堂活动 7A 第 7 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","none","无",1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Did ? Yes/No,",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment.","数字设备。",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 3","EEC 4 第 3 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","basin, shower, bathtub , toilet , comb , toothbrush, toothpaste, soap",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Mom! Mom! Mom!","A",1],["d","I am here. What's going on?","B",1],["d","I've got a cut.","A",1],["d","Let me see, dear.","B",1],["d","Oh , mom. It's hurting!!","A",1],["d","OK. Let's wash it with clean water and soap","B",1],["d","Are you going to put any medicine on it?","A",1],["d","Later. We'll see the doctor first","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Review C.R. Lesson 5-8 (15 mins)","复习课堂读本第 5–8 课（15 分钟）",0],["p","Show the digital animation to the students. Stop at any time and ask them some questions related to the previous sentences. Activity: Divide the students into two groups. Give each student a number. Ask a question, and call on a student to answer it. The team that answers first gets a chance to score.","给学生看数字动画，随时暂停问一些和前面句子有关的问题。活动：把学生分成两组，每位学生一个号码。问一个问题并叫一位学生回答，先答的队伍有机会得分。",0],["d","Airplane Shooting Draw some airplanes and bombs on the board.","Scoring",0],["p","The students throws the sticky ball at the board. Then add a point to their team for shooting an airplane. Or subtract a point from the opposite team for shooting a bomb. Ex:","学生把黏黏球丢向白板，打中飞机就为自己的队伍加一分，打中炸弹就扣对方队伍一分。例：",0],["d","A & B","Teams",0],["d","\"Harry helps Miss Meany into the house.\"","Touchscreen",0],["d","Who does Harry help into the house?","T",0],["p","Number two! S2 AB (Raise their hands as quickly as they can)","Number two!　S2 AB（尽快举手）",0],["d","Team A is faster.","T",0],["p","S2 A.: \"Harry helps Miss Meany into the house.\"","S2 A.：\"Harry helps Miss Meany into the house.\"",0],["d","Very good! Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","\"Harry helps Miss Meany into the house.\"","Ss",0],["p","T S2 A, throw the sticky ball!","T：S2 A，丢黏黏球！",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Activities 7 Lesson 7: Were you at home?","课堂活动 7 第 7 课：Were you at home?（你那时在家吗？）",0],["h3","(30 mins)","（30 分钟）",0],["li","7.1 Transformation exercises using present and past tenses Activity: Oral transformation drill with a ball Ex:","7.1 现在时和过去时的转换练习　活动：用球进行口语转换操练　例：",0],["d","\"I am looking at the board today.\"","T",0],["p","\"S1! Past tense!\" (Throw the ball to S1)","\"S1! Past tense!\"（S1！过去时！）（把球丢给 S1）",0],["d","(Catches the ball) \"I was looking at the board yesterday.\"","S1",0],["h3","7.2 Question Drill","7.2 问句操练",0],["p","Activity: Writing exercise","活动：书写练习",0],["d","tug of war Draw a rope with knots on the board. The winner can throw the die to get a number.. Then pull the rope toward their site by the numbers of knots.","Scoring",0],["p","Ex:","例：",0],["d","A & B T.: (Write the following statement on the board.) Yes, they were. They were unhappy.","Teams",0],["p","T.: Read it.","T.：念出来。",0],["d","\" Yes, they were. They were unhappy.\"","Ss",0],["p","T.: \"Make the question.\" \"Number 3\" S3 AB come to the board, write the question and go back to their seats quickly. T.: S3 B is faster. Please say the question. S3B: \"Were they unhappy?\" T.: \"How about S3 A?\" S3 A: \"Were they unhappy?\" T.: \"Let's check!\" (check the spelling on the board.) T.: \"Read the questions and answers. Go!\"","T.：\"Make the question.\" \"Number 3\"　S3 AB 到白板写出问句，再快速回座位。T.：S3 B 比较快，请说出问句。S3B：\"Were they unhappy?\"　T.：\"S3 A 呢？\"　S3 A：\"Were they unhappy?\"　T.：\"我们来检查！\"（检查白板上的拼写。）T.：\"念出问句和答句，开始！\"",0],["d","\"Were they unhappy?\" \" Yes, they were. They were unhappy.\"","Ss",0],["h3","7.3 Match the question with the answer","7.3 把问句和答句配对",0],["p","Activity: Oral practice Game: Find your partner Give each student either copies of the question or the answer. They should find their partner by repeating their question or answer.","活动：口语练习　游戏：找伙伴　发给每位学生问句或答句的复印件，他们要重复自己的问句或答句来找到伙伴。",0],["h2","C. A. (30 mins) Lesson 7: Were you at home?","课堂活动（30 分钟）第 7 课：Were you at home?",0],["h3","7.4 Spy code puzzle","7.4 间谍密码谜题",0],["p","Activity: Spy code Tell the students the rule. Write the code on the board. Have the students work out the solution and make a sentence with it. Ex:","活动：间谍密码　告诉学生规则，把密码写在白板上，让学生解出答案并造句。例：",0],["d","A,B, C, D (two or three students in each team)","Teams",0],["d","(Write 7.15.16 17.4.14 12,16,10,8,5,16 14,16,6,7,16,5,17,4,14 on the board.)","T",0],["p","\"Go!\"","\"Go!\"（开始！）",0],["d","\"We're done. The day before yesterday\"","Team D",0],["d","\"Good! Make a sentence with the day before yesterday.\"","T",0],["d","\"We played basketball the day before yesterday.\"","Team D",0],["d","(Give the winner a prize card.)","T",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h3","7.5 Review of Troublesome IPA Phonics Material","7.5 复习容易混淆的国际音标",0],["p","Activity: Go to the touchscreen all-in-one site, click on the IPA symbols, and review the sounds. Then show the exercises on the monitor. Have the students write the correct symbol on the board.","活动：进到触控一体机网站，点国际音标复习发音，再在屏幕上显示练习，让学生在白板上写出正确的音标。",0],["d","The winner gets a point Ex:","Scoring",0],["d","A & B","Teams",0],["d","\"Short\"","Touchscreen",0],["p","T.: \"Number 4\" S4 A B come to the board and write the symbol","T.：\"Number 4\"　S4 A B 到白板写出音标",0],["h3","7.6 Review the symbols [t] [d] [ɪd]","7.6 复习音标 [t] [d] [ɪd]",0],["p","Activity: Review the rule for the final \"ed\" sound. Voiced [d], voiceless [t],[t] and [d] the sound of [ɪd] Game: hitting game Stick the cards for [t] [d] [ɪd] on different walls of the classroom. Say or write a verb from C.A. 7.6, and have the students hit the correct sound.","活动：复习词尾 \"ed\" 的发音规则：有声念 [d]，无声念 [t]，[t] 和 [d] 结尾念 [ɪd]。游戏：打击游戏　把 [t] [d] [ɪd] 的卡片贴在教室不同的墙上。说出或写出课堂活动 7.6 的一个动词，让学生打中正确的音。",0],["d","The winner gets a point Ex:","Scoring",0],["d","A & B T.: \"play\"","Teams",0],["p","\"Number 5\" S5 AB Come to the card for [d], and hit it.","\"Number 5\"　S5 AB 跑到 [d] 的卡片并打它。",0],["h2","7.7 Song","7.7 歌曲",0],["p","See also (How to teach songs in To the teachers) Put the students into groups and have them change the lyrics below. Encourage them to be creative. \"A peanut sat on a railroad track, his heart was all a flutter.\" \"Round the bend came number ten.\" \"Toot! Toot! Peanut butter!\"","另见（“给老师”中的如何教歌曲）。把学生分组，让他们改编下面的歌词，鼓励他们发挥创意。\"A peanut sat on a railroad track, his heart was all a flutter.\" \"Round the bend came number ten.\" \"Toot! Toot! Peanut butter!\"",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["p","To start the class:","开始上课：",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles. Listening Comprehension:","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["p","When Timmy goes the bathroom, he spends a long time there. Let's listen to what he does and connect the objects in the correct sequence.","Timmy 去浴室时，会在那里待很久。我们来听听他做了什么，并把物品依正确顺序连起来。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the Let's Check monolog. Let's Check Monolog What do we do in the bathroom? We can take a shower, brush our teeth, comb our hair, and wash our hands. Please turn to page 14; Let's Check. When Timmy goes to the bathroom, he spends a long time there. Let's listen to what he does and connect the objects in the correct sequence.","播放 Let's Check 独白。Let's Check 独白　我们在浴室做什么？我们可以洗澡、刷牙、梳头和洗手。请翻到第 14 页：Let's Check。Timmy 去浴室时，会在那里待很久。我们来听听他做了什么，并把物品依正确顺序连起来。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Review the key words that are in the listening exercise. Explain the exercise to the students. Have them do the exercise as they listen to the MP3.","复习听力练习中的关键字，向学生说明练习方式，让他们一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons or markers for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带蜡笔或彩笔。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 5","电话教学教材 5",0],["p","(See also Telephone Teaching in the front of this manual.) Part 1: Greeting Part 2: Q and A. 1.Did you bake a cake? 2.Did your father make the spaghetti? No 3.How do you spell \"children\"? 4.Were you sleeping at four o'clock yesterday afternoon? 5.Was your sister cooking breakfast this morning? Part 3: Ending","（另见本手册前面的电话教学。）第 1 部分：问候　第 2 部分：问答　1. Did you bake a cake?（你有烤蛋糕吗？）2. Did your father make the spaghetti? No（你爸爸有做义大利面吗？）3. How do you spell \"children\"?（\"children\" 怎么拼？）4. Were you sleeping at four o'clock yesterday afternoon?（你昨天下午四点在睡觉吗？）5. Was your sister cooking breakfast this morning?（你姐妹今天早上在做早餐吗？）第 3 部分：结尾",0]],"g":[[26,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 5-8","playing"]],[40,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson7","7.5"]],[99,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Were you at home?"],"bd":"","m":60},{"z":"第 11 课","t":"Class 11","k":"class","p":[43,44,45,46],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","To talk about past events. To talk about camping. To respond to simple past tense questions both positively and negatively.","谈论过去的事件；谈论露营；对简单过去时问题做肯定和否定回答。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Handling minor emergencies","- 处理小意外",1],["li","- Telling mom what happened","- 告诉妈妈发生了什么事",1],["li","- Asking for a doctor's advice","- 询问医生的建议",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 6","Classroom Readers 第 6 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","far away, children, live(d), neighbor, vacation, weather, fun,",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7B Lesson 8","课堂活动 7B 第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","cookbook, tent, camp",null,1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Did ......? Yes/No, .....",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","the digital equipment, hammers, die","数字设备、锤子、骰子",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 3","EEC 4 第 3 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","basin, shower, bathtub , toilet , comb , toothbrush, toothpaste, soap",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Mom! Mom! Mom!","A",1],["d","I am here. What's going on?","B",1],["d","I've got a cut.","A",1],["d","Let me see, dear.","B",1],["d","Oh , mom. It's hurting!!","A",1],["d","OK. Let's wash it with clean water and soap","B",1],["d","Are you going to put any medicine on it?","A",1],["d","Later. We'll see the doctor first","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm up (10mins)","热身（10 分钟）",0],["li","1. Do the spelling quiz, don't forget to record the grades.","1. 做拼写小测验，别忘了记录成绩。",0],["li","2. Do the Q-A for reviewing the sentence pattern.","2. 用问答复习句型。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (35 mins) Lesson 6","课堂读本（35 分钟）第 6 课",0],["li","1. Introduce the new characters Explain to the students that \"tiny\" and \"bitsy\" mean very small Game: Ghostbusters Assign each student a character and a large name card. Choose a student to be the ghost. The ghost can call a character's name and hit him/her who should call another name before being hit. Or he/she has to be the ghost.","1. 介绍新角色。向学生解释 \"tiny\" 和 \"bitsy\" 都是“非常小”的意思。游戏：捉鬼敢死队　分配每位学生一个角色和一张大名牌，选一位学生当鬼。鬼可以喊出一个角色的名字并去打他／她，被喊到的人要在被打到之前喊出另一个名字，否则就换他／她当鬼。",0],["h3","2. Review past tense sentences","2. 复习过去时句子",0],["p","Did .........? Yes/No, ................. Remind the students that the final \"ed\" in the negative response isn't added to the verb.","Did .........? Yes/No, .................　提醒学生否定回答中动词不加词尾 \"ed\"。",0],["h3","3. New word","3. 新单词",0],["p","Activity: Spy code Write one of the new vocabulary words in code. Have the students figure out the word. Tell them the pronunciation using phonetic spelling.","活动：间谍密码　把一个新单词写成密码，让学生解出这个字，再用音标拼写告诉他们发音。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Then explain the meaning. Finally, provide some sentence examples of the new words. (See also How To Teach Vocabulary in To The Teachers)","接着解释意思，最后举一些新单词的例句。（另见“给老师”中的如何教单词）",0],["h3","4. Story","4. 故事",0],["p","Go through the story on the touchscreen all-in-one. Make sure the students understand it. (Ask related questions.) Then have the students read it chorally. Activity: Heart attack","在触控一体机上看一遍故事，确定学生理解（问相关问题），再让学生齐声念。活动：心脏病（Heart attack）",0],["d","A & B.","Groups",0],["p","Have group B stay in their seats and read the story chorally. Group A stands in front of the classroom and listens carefully to group B. When the reading comes to a verb in the past tense, group A should sit down quickly. The last one to sit down is out of the game. The ones who can stay in the game to the end are the winners. Then switch the two groups. Ex:","让 B 组留在座位上齐声念故事，A 组站在教室前面仔细听 B 组念。念到过去时动词时，A 组要迅速坐下，最后坐下的人出局，能留到最后的人获胜。然后两组交换。例：",0],["p","Group B: There was a small town very far away. Group A: (Sit down quickly when they hear \"was.\" S2 A is the last one sitting down. ) T.: \"S2 A, you are out. Go back to your seat, please.\"","B 组：There was a small town very far away.　A 组：（听到 \"was\" 时迅速坐下，S2 A 最后坐下。）T.：\"S2 A, you are out. Go back to your seat, please.\"",0],["h2","Classroom Activities 7B Lesson 8:","课堂活动 7B 第 8 课：",0],["h2","Summer Camping (30mins)","Summer Camping（夏令营露营）（30 分钟）",0],["h2","8.1 Vocabulary:","8.1 单词：",0],["p","1.Present the vocabulary, using the touchscreen all-in-one. 2.Have the students make sentences using the vocabulary.","1. 用触控一体机呈现单词。2. 让学生用单词造句。",0],["h2","8.2",null,0],["li","1. Introduce the picture to the students using the touchscreen all-in-one and ask them related questions. Ex:","1. 用触控一体机向学生介绍图片，并问相关问题。例：",0],["p","T.: \"Look at the picture. What did Little Larry do?\"","T.：\"Look at the picture. What did Little Larry do?\"",0],["d","\"Little Larry worked at the camp.\"","Ss",0],["li","8.2 A Pair practice:","8.2 A 两人练习：",0],["p","Activity: Pair the students up and have them do Q & A for a while. Game: Have each pair of students throw the die and get a number..","活动：让学生两两一组问答一阵子。游戏：每组掷骰子得到一个数字。",0],["d","Read C.A. 8.2A, Q 1","One",0],["d","Read C.A. 8.2A, Q 2","Two",0],["d","Read C.A. 8.2A, Q 3","Three",0],["d","Read C.A. 8.2A, Q 4","Four",0],["d","Read C.A. 8.2A, Q 5","Five",0],["d","Sing a song Ex: T.: Pair one, throw the die.","Six",0],["p","(Pair one throws the die and gets one point) T. Please read Q 1. Pair one A: \"Did Little Larry work at the camp?\" Pair one B: \"Yes, he did. He worked at the camp.\"","（第一组掷骰子得到一点）T.：请念第 1 题。第一组 A：\"Did Little Larry work at the camp?\"　第一组 B：\"Yes, he did. He worked at the camp.\"",0],["h3","8.2 B: Change the sentence using \"not\".","8.2 B：用 \"not\" 改写句子。",0],["p","Activity: Write the sentence on the board.","活动：把句子写在白板上。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Have the students read it chorally, then change it to the opposite meaning. Game: Writing game","让学生齐声念出来，再改成相反的意思。游戏：书写游戏",0],["d","Sentence hangman Example:","Scoring",0],["d","A & B (The teacher writes a sentence on the board:)","Teams",0],["p","T Please read the sentence!","T：请念出这个句子！",0],["d","Teeny Tina made the soup.","Ss",0],["p","T.: Now change the sentence, using \"not.\" Number one! (S1 A&B come to the board and write, then go back to their seats) \"Teeny Tina didn't make the soup.\"","T.：现在用 \"not\" 改写句子。Number one!（S1 A 和 B 到白板写，再回座位）\"Teeny Tina didn't make the soup.\"",0],["d","\"Good!\"","T",0],["p","\"S1 A is faster.\"","\"S1 A 比较快。\"",0],["h3","8.2 C Complete The Sentence","8.2 C 完成句子",0],["p","(The teacher writes a sentence on the board, leaving blanks.)","（老师在白板上写一个留有空格的句子。）",0],["d","Guess the letter.","T",0],["p","S1 A: B?",null,0],["d","You got it! (Fills in the blanks with \"b\" if correct)","T",0],["p","You get a point! Or \"Oh-uh! Sorry! No \"b\"\"","你得一分！或“哎呀！抱歉！没有 \"b\"”",0],["li","8.3 Fill in the blanks with the past tense. Review the past tense material in 8.3. Ex:","8.3 用过去时填空。复习 8.3 的过去时内容。例：",0],["p","T.: \"What's the past tense of \"is\"?\" Ss.: \"Was\"! Activity: Have the students figure out the answer to 8.3 and read the context chorally.","T.：\"is\" 的过去时是什么？　Ss.：\"Was\"！　活动：让学生想出 8.3 的答案并齐声念出内容。",0],["h3","Activity Sheet N0. 4","活动单 4",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and have the students check the appropriate space. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog for the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front of the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons or markers for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带蜡笔或彩笔。",0]],"g":[[29,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 6","Playing"]],[47,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 8"]],[92,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 12 课","t":"Class 12","k":"class","p":[47,48,49,50],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","To talk about past events. To ask/answer simple past tense questions using irregular verbs.","谈论过去的事件；用不规则动词问答简单过去时问题。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Burping quietly","- 小声打嗝",1],["li","- Saying \"Excuse me.\"","- 说 \"Excuse me.\"",1],["h3","Classroom Readers 7 Lesson 7","课堂读本 7 第 7 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","picnic, beautiful, tired, hole",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7B Lesson 9","课堂活动 7B 第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","went, ate, took, sang, put, said, had",null,1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Did ..?Yes/No, .......",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","The digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 4","EEC 4 第 4 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","refrigerator, toaster, sink, stove, oven, pot,pan,cupboard",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","What a good dinner . BUUUUURP!","A",1],["d","Don't do that again , Gerry","B",1],["d","What are you talking about?","A",1],["d","Don't burp out loud.","B",1],["d","Why not?","A",1],["d","It's very impolite.","B",1],["d","Oh, I'm sorry.","A",1],["d","From now on, do it silently.","B",1],["d","All right.","A",1],["d","And far from other people's face.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up(10mins)","热身（10 分钟）",0],["li","1. Do the spelling quiz.","1. 做拼写小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins) Lesson 7","课堂读本（30 分钟）第 7 课",0],["h3","1. Pre-teach irregular past tense verbs using the chart below.","1. 用下表预先教不规则动词的过去时。",0],["p","Today Yesterday am was do did play played go went eat ate take took sing sang put put say said have had",null,0],["h3","Then make sentences using these past tense verbs.","然后用这些过去时动词造句。",0],["h3","2. New words ","2. 新单词",0],["p","Teach the pronunciation using phonetic spelling.","用音标拼写教发音。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Next, teach the meaning. Finally, provide some sentence examples of the new words. (See also How To Teach Vocabulary in To The Teachers)","接着教意思，最后举一些新单词的例句。（另见“给老师”中的如何教单词）",0],["h3","3. Story","3. 故事",0],["p","Present the story on the touchscreen all-in-one. Teach and tell the story using the digital equipment. Make sure the students understand the story. Ask them questions about it. Then have the students read it chorally. Activity: Heart attack","在触控一体机上呈现故事，用数字设备教并讲故事。确定学生理解故事，问他们相关问题，再让学生齐声念。活动：心脏病（Heart attack）",0],["d","A & B Have the students in group B stay in their seats and read the story chorally.","Groups",0],["p","Group A goes to the front and listens. When the reading comes to a past tense verb, group A should sit down quickly. The last one to sit down is out of the game. The ones who can stay in the game to the end are the winners. Now switch the two groups. Ex:","A 组到前面听。念到过去时动词时，A 组要迅速坐下，最后坐下的人出局，能留到最后的人获胜。然后两组交换。例：",0],["p","Group B: \"One day in July, Small Sally, Tiny Tom and their friends went on a picnic.\" (Group A sits down quickly when they hear \"went.\" Jane is the last one to sit down.)","B 组：\"One day in July, Small Sally, Tiny Tom and their friends went on a picnic.\"（A 组听到 \"went\" 时迅速坐下，Jane 最后坐下。）",0],["d","\"Jane, you are out. Go back to your seat, please.\"","T",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 9: On A Picnic (35 mins)","课堂活动第 9 课：On A Picnic（去野餐）（35 分钟）",0],["h3","9.1 Vocabulary","9.1 单词",0],["li","1. Show the vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one.","1. 用触控一体机展示单词。",0],["li","2. Have the students make sentences using the vocabulary.","2. 让学生用单词造句。",0],["h3","9.2",null,0],["p","1.Present the picture using the touchscreen all-in-one. Make sentences in both present and past tense. Ex:","1. 用触控一体机呈现图片，造现在时和过去时的句子。例：",0],["p","T.: \"Look at the picture. Make sentences in the past tense.\" \"Tiny Tom flies a kite.\"","T.：\"Look at the picture. Make sentences in the past tense.\" \"Tiny Tom flies a kite.\"",0],["d","\"Tiny Tom flew a kite.\"","Ss",0],["p","T.: \"Teeny Tina claps her hands.\" Ss.: \"Teeny Tina clapped her hands.\"","T.：\"Teeny Tina claps her hands.\"　Ss.：\"Teeny Tina clapped her hands.\"",0],["h3","9.3 A",null,0],["h3","Activity","活动",0],["li","1. Divide the students into three teams: A, B, and C.","1. 把学生分成三队：A、B、C。",0],["li","2. Give each team a piece of paper for note taking.","2. 每队发一张纸做笔记。",0],["li","3. Read the passage for the first time. Have the students listen carefully. 4.Then have the students take notes while listening.","3. 第一次念短文，让学生仔细听。4. 然后让学生一边听一边做笔记。",0],["li","5. Repeat it several times. 5A.Have the students repeat after you.","5. 重复念几次。5A. 让学生跟着你念。",0],["li","6. Write the questions from 9. 3 A on the board. Have the students write the correct answer.","6. 把 9.3 A 的问题写在白板上，让学生写出正确答案。",0],["li","7. Check the answers with the students.","7. 和学生一起核对答案。",0],["h3","9.3B",null,0],["p","Activity","活动",0],["d","A & B Have the students open their books to 9. 3.","Teams",0],["p","Stick \"Yes\" and \"No\" cards on opposite walls of the classroom. Ask the students the questions in 9.3 B.","在教室相对的墙上贴 \"Yes\" 和 \"No\" 卡，问学生 9.3 B 的问题。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Call a student's number to hit \"Yes\" or \"No\" and answer the question. Game: hitting game","叫一位学生的号码，让他打 \"Yes\" 或 \"No\" 并回答问题。游戏：打击游戏",0],["d","Bingo Ex:","Scoring",0],["d","A & B T.: \"Open your book to 9.3.\"","Teams",0],["p","\"Did the children go on a picnic?\" \"Number one!\" (S1 A B hit the \"Yes\" card) \"Yes, they did. They went on a picnic.\"","\"Did the children go on a picnic?\" \"Number one!\"（S1 A B 打 \"Yes\" 卡）\"Yes, they did. They went on a picnic.\"",0],["h3","9.4",null,0],["p","Activity:","活动：",0],["d","A & B","Teams",0],["li","1. Make photocopies of the pictures from 9.4 for each team.","1. 为每队复印 9.4 的图片。",0],["li","2. Read the sentences. Have the students find the correct responses and place them on the board to make sentences.","2. 念出句子，让学生找到正确的回应并贴在白板上组成句子。",0],["h3","9.5 IPA translation relay","9.5 国际音标翻译接力",0],["p","Activity:","活动：",0],["d","A & B","Teams",0],["li","1. Write the IPA symbols from 9.5 on the board. Have the students do the alphabetic spelling on the board as a relay race.","1. 把 9.5 的国际音标写在白板上，让学生以接力赛方式在白板上写出字母拼法。",0],["li","2. Write the words from 9.5 on the board. Have the students do the IPA spelling on the board. Make a relay race of it.","2. 把 9.5 的字写在白板上，让学生在白板上写出国际音标拼法，做成接力赛。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See & Say.","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Introduction:","引导：",0],["p","Have the students listen to the Let's See And Say monolog. You can either read it to the students, or use the MP3. Let's See & Say:","让学生听 Let's See And Say 独白，你可以念给学生听或用 MP3。Let's See & Say：",0],["p","We should have good manners when we are eating. Is it good manners if we burp out loud in front of people? Let's find out by listening to the conversation below.","吃东西时要有好礼貌。在别人面前大声打嗝是有礼貌的吗？我们听听下面的对话就知道了。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students listen carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson by combining the dialog and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview the students' homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习学生的作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons or markers for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带蜡笔或彩笔。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 6","电话教学教材 6",0],["p","(See also Telephone Teaching in the front of this manual.) Part 1: Greeting Part 2: Q and A.","（另见本手册前面的电话教学。）第 1 部分：问候　第 2 部分：问答",0],["li","1. Did you clean the tent?","1. Did you clean the tent?（你有清理帐篷吗？）",0],["li","2. Did you look at the cookbook?","2. Did you look at the cookbook?（你有看食谱吗？）",0],["li","3. Did your mother make soup?","3. Did your mother make soup?（你妈妈有煮汤吗？）",0],["li","4. Did you go home at 3:30 this afternoon?","4. Did you go home at 3:30 this afternoon?（你今天下午三点半回家吗？）",0],["li","5. Did your father go to work by bus this morning? Part 3: Ending","5. Did your father go to work by bus this morning?（你爸爸今天早上搭公交车上班吗？）第 3 部分：结尾",0]],"g":[[32,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 7","Playing"]],[46,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 9","9.2"]],[103,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["On A Picnic"],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 13 课","t":"Class 13","k":"class","p":[51,52,53],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","To be able to use and compare future and past tenses. To use the past and future tenses in conjunction with time phrases.","能使用并比较将来时和过去时；把过去时和将来时与时间短语搭配使用。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Burping silently","- 不出声地打嗝",1],["li","- Excuse yourself if you burp loudly","- 大声打嗝时说声抱歉",1],["h3","Classroom Readers 7 Lesson 8","课堂读本 7 第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","him, next, them, animals, soft, understand, no use, deep, dark, ran, cried, began, fell, heard",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7B Lesson 10","课堂活动 7B 第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","last, next",null,1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","the day/week/month/year after last/next",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","the digital equipment, a ball","数字设备、一颗球",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 4","EEC 4 第 4 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","refrigerator, toaster, sink, stove, oven, pot,pan,cupboard",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","What a good dinner . BUUUUURP!","A",1],["d","Don't do that again , Gerry","B",1],["d","What are you talking about?","A",1],["d","Don't burp out loud.","B",1],["d","Why not?","A",1],["d","It's very impolite.","B",1],["d","Oh, I'm sorry.","A",1],["d","From now on, do it silently.","B",1],["d","All right.","A",1],["d","And far from other people's face.","B",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm up(5mins)","热身（5 分钟）",0],["h3","Spelling Quiz","拼写小测验",0],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 9 (30 mins)","课堂读本第 9 课（30 分钟）",0],["h3","1. Pre-Teach","1. 预先教学",0],["p","Review the months of the year, the seasons of the year, and the days of the week. Activity: Writing Relay","复习一年的月份、四季和一周七天。活动：书写接力",0],["d","A&B Ex: T.: \"Write the months of the year. Let's start with January.\"","Teams",0],["p","(S2 A & B go to the board and write \"January.\" They pass the markers to S3 A&B.) (S3 A & B go to the board and write \"February.\")","（S2 A 和 B 到白板写 \"January\"，把白板笔传给 S3 A 和 B。）（S3 A 和 B 到白板写 \"February\"。）",0],["h3","2. New words ","2. 新单词",0],["p","Teach the pronunciation using phonetic spelling. Next, teach the meaning. Finally, provide some examples of the new words.","用音标拼写教发音，接着教意思，最后举一些新单词的例子。",0],["h3","(See also How To Teach Vocabulary in To The Teachers)","（另见“给老师”中的如何教单词）",0],["h3","3. Story","3. 故事",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Show the story on the touchscreen all-in-one. Teach and tell the story using the digital equipment. Make sure the students understand the story. Ask them questions about it. Now have the students read it in chorus Activity: Find the past tense verb quickly","在触控一体机上播放故事，用数字设备教并讲故事。确定学生理解故事，问他们相关问题，再让学生齐声念。活动：快速找出过去时动词",0],["d","A & B.","Groups",0],["p","Have each team open their books to lesson 8. The students find the verbs in the past tense line by line, and write them on the board. The team that writes the most verbs is the winner. Finally, write the present form next to the past tense form. Have the students do the same in their books.","让各队把书翻到第 8 课，逐行找出过去时动词并写在白板上，写出最多动词的队伍获胜。最后在过去时旁边写上现在时，让学生也在书上这样做。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities 7B Lesson 10: Activity Chart","课堂活动 7B 第 10 课：Activity Chart（活动表）",0],["h3","(40mins)","（40 分钟）",0],["h3","10.1 Vocabulary","10.1 单词",0],["p","Review the concepts of \"last\", \"this\", \"next\" Ex:","复习 \"last\"、\"this\"、\"next\" 的概念。例：",0],["p","T.: \"Monday\"(With the gesture of present, future or past)","T.：\"Monday\"（配合表示现在、未来或过去的手势）",0],["d","\"This/next/last Monday\"","Ss",0],["h3","10.2A",null,0],["p","Use the chart to do oral practice. Activity: Catch the ball and answer the question. Ex: Teams: A & B","用表格做口语练习。活动：接球并回答问题。例：队伍：A 和 B",0],["d","\"What did Small Sally do last time?","T",0],["p","(Throw the ball up in the air) \"Number one.\" (S1 A & B stand up and catch the ball) \"She baked a cake last time.\" T.: \"S1 A gets the ball. Team A gets a point!)","（把球往上抛）\"Number one.\"（S1 A 和 B 站起来接球）\"She baked a cake last time.\"　T.：\"S1 A 接到球，A 队得一分！\"",0],["li","10.2 B Review question words (who, what, when, where) Activity: Chart Drill Write this chart on the board:","10.2 B 复习疑问词（who、what、when、where）活动：表格操练　把这张表写在白板上：",0],["p","Tiny Tom eat Chinese food last Friday",null,0],["d","A and B T.: \"When did Tiny Tom eat Chinese food?\"","Teams",0],["p","\"Number three.\" S3 A & B go to the board and put the magnet in the correct grid (last Friday) then answer the question:","\"Number three.\"　S3 A 和 B 到白板把磁铁放在正确的格子（last Friday），然后回答问题：",0],["p","\"Tiny Tom ate Chinese food last Friday.\"",null,0],["h3","10.3 The opposite term","10.3 相反词",0],["p","Activity: Ball drill","活动：丢球操练",0],["d","A and B","Groups",0],["d","\"the day after tomorrow\"","T",0],["p","(Throws the ball to S 1 A) S 1 A: (Catches the ball) \"the day before yesterday\"","（把球丢给 S1 A）S1 A：（接球）\"the day before yesterday\"（前天）",0],["d","\"the day before yesterday\"","Ss",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","S 1 A: \"the week before last\" (Throws the ball to S 1 B) S1B: (Catches the ball) \"The week after next\"","S1 A：\"the week before last\"（上上周）（把球丢给 S1 B）S1 B：（接球）\"The week after next\"（下下周）",0],["d","\"the week after next\"","Ss",0],["h3","Activity Sheet No.5","活动单 5",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["p","To start the class:","开始上课：",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles. Listening Comprehension:","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["p","Cindy and her mom are cooking. Listen and write the letter in the correct places in the kitchen.","Cindy 和妈妈正在做菜。听一听，把字母写在厨房里正确的位置。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the Let's Check monolog. Let's Check :monolog Do you like cooking? What will you need to use when you cook in the kitchen? You may need to use a refrigerator, a toaster, a sink, a stove, an oven, a pot, a pan, and a cupboard. Please turn to page 18; Let's Check. Cindy and her mom are cooking. Listen and write the letter in the correct places in the kitchen.","播放 Let's Check 独白。Let's Check：独白　你喜欢做菜吗？在厨房做菜时你会需要用到什么？你可能需要用到冰箱、烤面包机、水槽、炉子、烤箱、汤锅、平底锅和橱柜。请翻到第 18 页：Let's Check。Cindy 和妈妈正在做菜。听一听，把字母写在厨房里正确的位置。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Review the key words that are in the listening exercise. Explain the exercise. Have the students do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","复习听力练习中的关键字，说明练习方式，让学生一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons or markers for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带蜡笔或彩笔。",0]],"g":[[30,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 8","Playing"]],[87,["● Follow the steps","above"]]],"tp":["Activity Chart"],"bd":"","m":50},{"z":"第 14 课","t":"Class 14","k":"class","p":[54,55],"b":[["h2","Review Day 2","复习日 2",0],["p","Classroom Readers Review Lesson 5-8","课堂读本 复习第 5–8 课",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["li","- Burping silently","- 不出声地打嗝",0],["li","- Excusing yourself if you burp loudly Classroom Activities Review Lesson 6-10","- 大声打嗝时说声抱歉　课堂活动 复习第 6–10 课",0],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 4","EEC 4 第 4 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","refrigerator, toaster, sink, stove, oven, pot,pan,cupboard",null,0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","What a good dinner . BUUUUURP!","A",0],["d","Don't do that again , Gerry","B",0],["d","What are you talking about?","A",0],["d","Don't burp out loud.","B",0],["d","Why not?","A",0],["d","It's very impolite.","B",0],["d","Oh, I'm sorry.","A",0],["d","From now on, do it silently.","B",0],["d","All right.","A",0],["d","And far from other people's face.","B",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review","复习",0],["h3","(30 mins)","（30 分钟）",0],["p","Use this time to catch up on lessons or areas some students did not have time for in the first five classes. If the students are caught up, the teacher can spend this time reviewing previous lessons or areas where students seem to be having difficulty. You can do this using drills, games, or any activity that will help the students. Choose those that the students were interested in during the first five classes.","利用这段时间补上前五堂课中部分学生没来得及完成的课程或内容。如果学生都跟上了，老师可以用这段时间复习前几课，或学生似乎有困难的地方。可以用操练、游戏或任何对学生有帮助的活动，挑选前五堂课中学生感兴趣的。",0],["li","1. Readers review: Go through the readers with the students. Point out all the past tense and future tense constructions that appear. Ask questions from the back of the readers or make up some of your own to check their comprehension. Activity # 7 Forgetful teacher","1. 读本复习：和学生一起看读本，指出所有出现的过去时和将来时结构。问读本后面的问题或自己出题，检查他们的理解。活动 #7：健忘的老师",0],["li","2. IPA phonics review: Go through the book with the students. Review important phonics exercises. Activity # 7.matching and memorization #10. Phonics tic-tac-toe plus #11 Spelling phonics or # 12 Phonics switch.","2. 国际音标自然拼读复习：和学生一起看书，复习重要的发音练习。活动 #7 配对与记忆、#10 自然拼读井字游戏，再加上 #11 拼写发音或 #12 发音替换。",0],["li","3. Practice the future tense/past tense. Activity:#14 paper airplane game or # 15. Frog","3. 练习将来时／过去时。活动：#14 纸飞机游戏或 #15 青蛙",0],["h2","Quiz (25 mins)","小测验 Quiz（25 mins）",0],["li","1. Have the students put all books and unnecessary things away. Hand out the quiz and have the students do it.","1. 请学生把所有书本和不需要的东西收起来，发下考卷让学生作答。",0],["li","2. Make sure that the students understand each item.","2. 确定学生理解每个项目。",0],["li","3. Walk around the room and check the quiz for the students to avoid misunderstandings.","3. 在教室里走动检查考卷，避免学生误解题意。",0],["li","4. The students may not talk or cheat during the quiz. If the students don't get good","4. 考小测验时学生不准说话或作弊。学生如果考得不好，",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","grades, they have to make it up in the next class (Teachers can have their own grade standard.).","下一堂课要补考（老师可以有自己的成绩标准）。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (25mins)","听力小测验（25 分钟）",0],["p","Check the tape and the recorder before the students come back from the break. Prepare for the listening quiz.","在学生下课休息回来前，先检查录音带和录音机，准备听力小测验。",0],["li","1. Turn on the tape and have the students fill in the appropriate blanks.","1. 播放录音带，请学生在适当的空格中作答。",0],["li","2. Listening is a very important aspect of learning a new language.","2. 听力是学习新语言非常重要的一环。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate space. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Pair the students up. Have each team do a mini role-play of the dialog for this unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front of the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，每组把本单元的对话做成小型角色扮演。每组都要在全班面前示范，老师要确定每个人都能轻松完成对话，也要注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(5 mins)","（5 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the content of the quiz and listening they took. Ask the students if they had any problems with the test.","(1) 复习学生考过的小测验和听力内容，问学生考试有没有问题。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 7","电话教学教材 7",0],["p","See also Telephone Teaching in the front of this manual. Part 1: Greeting Part 2: Q and A.","另见本手册前面的电话教学。第 1 部分：问候　第 2 部分：问答",0],["li","1. When did you eat Chinese food? (use \"last\")","1. When did you eat Chinese food?（你什么时候吃中国菜？）（用 \"last\"）",0],["li","2. What will you do next summer?","2. What will you do next summer?（你明年夏天要做什么？）",0],["li","3. Did you go to the movies last Friday?","3. Did you go to the movies last Friday?（你上周五有去看电影吗？）",0],["li","4. Are you going to go to the movies next Friday?","4. Are you going to go to the movies next Friday?（你下周五要去看电影吗？）",0],["li","5. Will you visit friends next week? Part 3: Ending","5. Will you visit friends next week?（你下周会去拜访朋友吗？）第 3 部分：结尾",0]],"g":[[20,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 5- Lesson 8"]],[45,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":65},{"z":"第 15 课","t":"Class 15","k":"class","p":[56,57],"b":[["h2","Test Day 2","测验日 2",0],["p","Classroom Reader Review Lesson 5-8 Classroom Activities 7A/B Review L.6-10","课堂读本 复习第 5–8 课　课堂活动 7A/B 复习第 6–10 课",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review","复习",0],["h3","(40 mins)","（40 mins）",0],["li","(1) Give the students marked Quiz # 2 and Lab Test # 2. Check their errors, and have the students correct them.","(1) 把批改好的第 2 次小测验和第 2 次听力测验发给学生，检查错误并让学生订正。",0],["li","(2) Do some review activities covering vocabulary, sentences, and IPA symbols. Activity: correct the errors Write wrong words or sentences often made by students on the board. Have the students correct them.","(2) 做一些复习单词、句子和国际音标的活动。活动：改错　在白板上写出学生常犯错的字或句子，让学生改正。",0],["h2","Test (50 mins)","测验 Test（50 mins）",0],["li","1. Have the students put all books and unnecessary things away. Hand out the test and have the stuents take it.","1. 请学生把所有书本和不需要的东西收起来，发下考卷让学生作答。",0],["li","2. Make sure that the students understand each item.","2. 确定学生理解每个项目。",0],["li","3. Walk around the room and check the test for the students to avoid misunderstandings.","3. 在教室里走动检查考卷，避免学生误解题意。",0],["li","4. The students may not talk or cheat during the test. If the students don't get good grades, they have to make it up in the next class (Teachers can have their own grade standard.)","(4) 小测验时学生不能说话或作弊。成绩不理想的学生，下次上课要补考（老师可以自定评分标准）。",0],["h2","Oral Test","口语测验",0],["li","(1) Conduct the following oral test outside of the classroom, individually, with the students.","(1) 在教室外与学生个别进行下面的口试。",0],["li","(2) The other students can draw, read, or watch video programs in the classroom. If there are enough touchscreen all-in-ones in your school, you may have the students go to Jordan's web site to do some interesting exercises.","(2) 其他学生可以在教室里画画、阅读或看视频。如果学校有足够的触控一体机，可以让学生上乔登网站做一些有趣的练习。",0],["h2","Oral Test (20%)","口试（20%）",0],["li","1. Will you go to school next week?","1. Will you go to school next week?（你下周会去上学吗？）",0],["li","2. Did you go to school last week?","2. Did you go to school last week?（你上周有去上学吗？）",0],["li","3. Did you wash your father's car on Saturday?","3. Did you wash your father's car on Saturday?（你星期六有帮爸爸洗车吗？）",0],["li","4. Are you going to bake a cake next week?","4. Are you going to bake a cake next week?（你下周要烤蛋糕吗？）",0],["li","5. Was your father sleeping on Sunday afternoon? Each question is worth four points: one each for question comprehension, grammar, pronunciation, and fluency. Give the students the opportunity to correct their own mistakes first.","5. Was your father sleeping on Sunday afternoon?（你爸爸星期天下午在睡觉吗？）每题 4 分：理解问题、语法、发音和流畅度各 1 分。先给学生自己改正错误的机会。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Homework Exercises","1- 家庭作业",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","2-Progress Report Book","2. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their","(1) 把学习项目写在白板上，让学生写进",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","progress reports.","进度报告。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Ask the students to bring some money for the field trip to the bakery for the next class.","(3) 请学生下堂课带点钱，参加去面包店的户外教学。",0]],"g":[[3,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 5 Lesson 8"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":50},{"z":"第 16 课","t":"Class 16","k":"class","p":[58,59],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 2","活动日 2",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","None Classroom Activities & Classroom Readers Review CA lesson 6 to lesson 10, review CR lesson 5 to lesson 8","无　课堂活动与课堂读本　复习 CA 第 6 课到第 10 课，复习 CR 第 5 课到第 8 课",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Pre-teach the vocabulary for the field trip (30 mins)","预先教户外教学的单词（30 分钟）",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","Using the touchscreen all-in-one, teach some vocabulary that the students will be able to use at the bakery. Feel free to add any words you don't see in the touchscreen all-in-one. Here are some words that you may find useful:","用触控一体机教一些学生在面包店能用到的单词。触控一体机里没有的字也可以自由补充。以下是一些可能有用的字：",0],["h3","Croissants Cakes Breads Doughnuts","Croissants（可颂）Cakes（蛋糕）Breads（面包）Doughnuts（甜甜圈）",0],["p","Tuna Cup Wheat Chocolate-covered Peach Pound White Plain Pineapple Fruit-filled Raisin nut Glazed Kiwi fruit Chocolate Onion Sugared Lemon garlic Taro Pudding-filled",null,0],["h3","Pastries Cookies Drinks Misc","Pastries（酥皮点心）Cookies（饼干）Drinks（饮料）Misc（其他）",0],["p","Swiss roll Almond brittle Yogurt Dozen Napolean Chocolate Milk Half dozen Cream-filled coconut Juice Tongs Jelly-filled Soda Tray Meat-filled tea",null,0],["h3","Sentence patterns","句型",0],["li","● Do you want to buy ...?","● Do you want to buy ...?（你想买……吗？）",0],["li","● Do you have any....?","● Do you have any....?（你们有……吗？）",0],["li","● How much did (sb.) spend? (sb.) spent ......","● How much did (sb.) spend? (sb.) spent ......（某人花了多少钱？某人花了……）",0],["li","● What did (sb.) buy? (sb.) bought .....","● What did (sb.) buy? (sb.) bought .....（某人买了什么？某人买了……）",0],["li","● I would like (to buy).....","● I would like (to buy).....（我想要（买）……）",0],["li","● How much is a half dozen/ dozen ......?","● How much is a half dozen/ dozen ......?（半打／一打……多少钱？）",0],["li","● Are they fresh today?","● Are they fresh today?（这些是今天新鲜的吗？）",0],["li","● This is (not) fresh. 17-19 food and drink(1)-(3)","● This is (not) fresh.（这个（不）新鲜。）17-19 食物和饮料 (1)-(3)",0],["h2","Take the students to the bakery.(40mins)","带学生去面包店。（40 分钟）",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","1. If possible, arrange ahead of time for the students to be able to go on a tour of the","1. 可能的话，事先安排让学生参观",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","bakery (mainly in the back where they are working.) If you are allowed back there, you can teach additional vocabulary, such as rolling pin,oven,dough,flour, etc. This is something the students will really be interested in, and most bakeries are more than happy to help. If not, just take them on a walk to the bakery, pointing out and reviewing the items learned in class.","面包店（主要是后面工作的地方）。如果可以进去，可以教额外的单词，例如 rolling pin（擀面棍）、oven（烤箱）、dough（面团）、flour（面粉）等。学生会很感兴趣，大部分面包店也很乐意帮忙。如果不行，就带他们走去面包店，指出并复习课堂上学过的东西。",0],["li","2. Give the students the activity sheet and have them do the checklist.","2. 发给学生活动单，让他们完成检查表。",0],["li","3. The students should order what they want from the bakery in English using the sentences below.","3. 学生要用下面的句子以英语向面包店点想买的东西。",0],["li","● I would like (to buy).....","● I would like (to buy).....（我想要（买）……）",0],["li","● How much is a half dozen/ dozen ......? Next, take the students back to school. Back in the classroom:","● How much is a half dozen/ dozen ......?（半打／一打……多少钱？）接着带学生回学校。回到教室后：",0],["h2","Activity Sheet No.6 (30mins)","活动单 6（30 分钟）",0],["li","1. Have the students finish the survey chart on the activity sheet by practicing the following dialogue:","1. 让学生练习下面的对话，完成活动单上的调查表：",0],["d","\"How much did you spend?\"","S1",0],["d","\"I spent .....\"","S2",0],["d","\"What did you buy?\"","S1",0],["d","\"I bought ....\"","S2",0],["li","2. Now ask them some of the questions below:","2. 现在问他们下面的一些问题：",0],["d","\"S1, what did S2 buy?\"","T",0],["d","\"He bought ...\"","S1",0],["d","\"How much did he spend?\"","T",0],["d","\"He spent ...\"","S1",0],["li","3. Give the students time to eat their food. Ask some questions while they're eating.","3. 给学生时间吃他们买的食物，边吃边问一些问题。",0],["d","\"S2, what are you eating?\"","T",0],["d","\"I'm eating...\"","S2",0],["h3","Here are more suggested questions","以下是更多建议的问题",0],["li","● Are you eating....?","● Are you eating....?（你在吃……吗？）",0],["li","● What is (sb.) eating?","● What is (sb.) eating?（某人在吃什么？）",0],["li","● How much is...?","● How much is...?（……多少钱？）",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 8","电话教学教材 8",0],["p","See also Telephone Teaching in the front of this manual. Part 1: Greeting Part 2: Q and A.","另见本手册前面的电话教学。第 1 部分：问候　第 2 部分：问答",0],["li","6. Were you in English class yesterday morning?","6. Were you in English class yesterday morning?（你昨天早上在上英语课吗？）",0],["li","7. Did your father go to work by bus yesterday morning?","7. Did your father go to work by bus yesterday morning?（你爸爸昨天早上搭公交车上班吗？）",0],["li","8. What will you do next summer?","8. What will you do next summer?（你明年夏天要做什么？）",0],["li","9. Did you go to the movies last Friday?","9. Did you go to the movies last Friday?（你上周五有去看电影吗？）",0],["li","10. Are you going to wash the car next Saturday? Part 3: Ending","10. Are you going to wash the car next Saturday?（你下周六要洗车吗？）第 3 部分：结尾",0]],"g":[[4,["单词学习区","Vocabulary","Section 1","02 fast food","Section 2"]],[20,["● Follow the same steps","above"]],[29,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":100},{"z":"第 17 课","t":"Class 17","k":"class","p":[60,61,62,63],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","To talk about past events using the simple past tense. To use verbs in the simple past tense form. To ask/answer questions in the past tense.","用简单过去时谈论过去的事件；使用简单过去时的动词形式；用过去时问答问题。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","-Keep your lips closed when you are eating","- 吃东西时闭着嘴巴",1],["li","-Avoid talking when you are eating","- 吃东西时避免说话",1],["h3","Classroom Reader 7 Lesson 9","课堂读本 7 第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","then, together, suddenly, sky, shining, still, grab, leaf, quickly, slowly,",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7 B Lesson 11","课堂活动 7B 第 11 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","go to the supermarket, put on his jacket, walked out the door, party food",null,1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Simple past tense","简单过去时",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","the digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 5","EEC 4 第 5 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","pear, kiwi, peach, cheese ball, fruit salad, banana, muffin, waffle",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","May I have a cookie, Kelvin?","A",1],["d","Yes.","B",1],["d","Wow! What flavor is this?","A",1],["p","N:( The girl Keeps talking while she is eating.)","N：（女孩一边吃东西一边说个不停。）",1],["d","Coconut and cream.","B",1],["d","It tastes very good. May I have another one, please?","A",1],["p","N: ( The girl contiues to speak.)","N：（女孩继续说话。）",1],["d","As many as you want, but don't talk with your mouth full, please.","B",1],["d","Am I disturbing you?","A",1],["d","No. Just keep you mouth closed while you are eating.","B",1],["d","Oops. I'll stop talking now. Sorry.","A",1],["p","N: ( The girl is embarassed. She blushes.)","N：（女孩很尴尬，脸红了。）",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Classroom Activities (15 mins)","课堂活动（15 分钟）",0],["h2","Lesson 11: Pay attention next time","第 11 课：Pay attention next time（下次要注意）",0],["li","11.5 Review IPA phonetic spelling Activity: IPA relay race","11.5 复习国际音标拼写　活动：国际音标接力赛",0],["d","A & B T.: \"Frog.\" \"Number two.\"","Teams",0],["p","S2 A&B come to the board and write \"f\", then pass the marker to S3 AB. S3 A&B come to the board, and write \"r,\" then pass the marker to S4 AB. And so on.. The first team to finish the writing wins a point.","S2 A 和 B 到白板写 \"f\"，再把白板笔传给 S3 AB。S3 A 和 B 到白板写 \"r\"，再传给 S4 AB，依此类推。最先写完的队伍得一分。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins) Lesson 9","课堂读本（30 分钟）第 9 课",0],["h3","1.New Vocabulary","1. 新单词",0],["p","Tell them the pronunciation using phonetic spelling. Then explain the meaning. Finally, provide some sentence examples of the new words (See also How To Teach Vocabulary in To The Teachers)","用音标拼写告诉他们发音，再解释意思，最后举一些新单词的例句。（另见“给老师”中的如何教单词）",0],["h3","2.Story","2. 故事",0],["p","Show the digital animation to the students. Go through the story using the digital equipment. Make sure the students understand it. Ask related questions. Then have the students read chorally. Activity: Role play","给学生看数字动画，用数字设备看一遍故事，确定学生理解。问相关问题，再让学生齐声念。活动：角色扮演",0],["d","A, B, and C.","Groups",0],["p","Have each team be a character in the story. After they can do it well, ask some volunteers to do the role play individually.","让每队扮演故事中的一个角色。他们做得很好之后，再请一些志愿者个别演出。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities 7B (35 mins)","课堂活动 7B（35 分钟）",0],["p","Lesson 11: Pay attention next time","第 11 课：Pay attention next time（下次要注意）",0],["h3","11.1 Vocabulary","11.1 单词",0],["p","See it and say it","看图说说",0],["h3","11.2",null,0],["p","Activity: Picture telling Show the pictures to the students and ask some questions about the pictures. Encourage them to describe what they see in the pictures.","活动：看图说话　给学生看图并问一些关于图的问题，鼓励他们描述图中看到的东西。",0],["h3","11.3",null,0],["p","Activity: Read the context chorally","活动：齐声念内容",0],["h3","11.3 A B",null,0],["p","Activity: Listening comprehension & find the correct answer With their books closed, have the students listen to the teacher reading the questions at least twice. Play the cassette. Have the students listen carefully. Read the three possible answers. Call on a student to write the correct answer on the board. Game: Writing game","活动：听力理解并找出正确答案　学生合上书，听老师念问题至少两次。播放录音带让学生仔细听，念出三个可能的答案，叫一位学生到白板写出正确答案。游戏：书写游戏",0],["d","Treasure island","Scoring",0],["h3","11.4 Opposites","11.4 相反词",0],["p","Pre-teach:","预先教学：",0],["p","T.: \"Big\" the opposite is \"small\" T.: \"Tall\" the opposite is...?","T.：\"Big\" 的相反词是 \"small\"。T.：\"Tall\" 的相反词是……？",0],["d","\"Short.\"","Ss",0],["p","Activity: Say the opposite quickly Game: Heart attack","活动：快速说出相反词　游戏：心脏病",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See And Say.","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Introduction:","引导：",0],["p","Have the students listen to the Let's See and Say monolog. You can either read the monolog, or use the MP3. Let's See And Say:Monolog What do you do during break time? Do you share snacks with your friends or do you play games with them? Let's listen to the conversation about what the students do during their break time.","让学生听 Let's See and Say 独白，你可以念独白或用 MP3。Let's See And Say：独白　下课时间你做什么？你会和朋友分享点心，还是和他们玩游戏？我们来听听学生们下课时间做什么的对话。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the monolog that they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you want to emphasize. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students listen carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson by combining the dialog and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Pair the students up and have each team practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，每组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3. Encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends.","提醒学生在家听 MP3 复习课程，鼓励他们和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(5 mins)","（5 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students","(2) 逐一检查他们的进度报告，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这是依学生今天的表现",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","reward cards according to their performance today.","发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons or markers for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带蜡笔或彩笔。",0]],"g":[[38,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 9","Playing"]],[45,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson IV","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Part 4","11.4","Part 5","11.5"]],[81,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Pay attention next time"],"bd":"","m":95},{"z":"第 18 课","t":"Class 18","k":"class","p":[64,65,66],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","To to talk about illnesses. To talk about doctor visits.","谈论疾病；谈论看医生。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","-Keep your mouth closed when you are eating","- 吃东西时闭着嘴巴",1],["li","-Avoid talking when you are eating","- 吃东西时避免说话",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7B Lesson 12","课堂活动 7B 第 12 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Medicine, gave, shot, terrible, lucky",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","the digital equipment","数字设备",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 5","EEC 4 第 5 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","pear, kiwi, peach, cheese ball, fruit salad, banana, muffin, waffle",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","May I have a cookie, Kelvin?","A",1],["d","Yes.","B",1],["d","Wow! What flavor is this?","A",1],["p","N:( The girl Keeps talking while she is eating.)","N：（女孩一边吃东西一边说个不停。）",1],["d","Coconut and cream.","B",1],["d","It tastes very good. May I have another one, please?","A",1],["p","N: ( The girl contiues to speak.)","N：（女孩继续说话。）",1],["d","As many as you want, but don't talk with your mouth full, please.","B",1],["d","Am I disturbing you?","A",1],["d","No. Just keep you mouth closed while you are eating.","B",1],["d","Oops. I'll stop talking now. Sorry.","A",1],["p","N: ( The girl is ashamed and she blushes.)","N：（女孩很不好意思，脸红了。）",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up (25 mins)","热身（25 分钟）",0],["p","Review the words measles, cold, headache, toothache. Have each student write one of the words on a piece of paper. Collect the papers and redistribute them. Activity: Find the original one Ex:","复习 measles、cold、headache、toothache 这些字。让每位学生在纸上写其中一个字，收回后重新发下。活动：找回自己的纸　例：",0],["d","\"Hi! How are you?\"","S1",0],["d","\"Not very well.\"","S2",0],["d","\"What's wrong?\"","S1",0],["d","\"I have a headache.\"","S2",0],["p","And so on. (The teacher can give the fastest three people some rewards or set a time limit to make the activity more exciting.) After all the students find their own paper, the teacher can do another activity:","依此类推。（老师可以给最快的三个人一些奖励，或设定时间限制让活动更刺激。）所有学生都找到自己的纸后，老师可以进行另一个活动：",0],["p","T.: \"S1, who isn't well?\"","T.：\"S1, who isn't well?\"（S1，谁不舒服？）",0],["d","\"S2 isn't well.\"","S1",0],["p","T.: \"What's wrong?\"","T.：\"What's wrong?\"（怎么了？）",0],["d","\"He has a headache.\"","S1",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 12:","课堂活动第 12 课：",0],["h2","Stay In Bed And Rest (50mins)","Stay In Bed And Rest（躺在床上休息）（50 分钟）",0],["h3","12.1 Vocabulary","12.1 单词",0],["p","Teach the pronunciation using phonetic spelling. Then teach the meaning. Finally, give some examples. Use the new words in sentences.","用音标拼写教发音，接着教意思，最后举一些例子，把新单词用在句子里。",0],["h3","(See also \"How to teach vocabulary\" in \"to the teachers\")","（另见“给老师”中的“如何教单词”）",0],["h3","12.2",null,0],["p","Activity: (1) read chorally","活动：(1) 齐声念",0],["li","(2) role play Ex.: Pair the students up. Have one student be Small Sally. The other will be 'Tiny Tom. Have the students read the script for 12.2. When the first team finishes, the second team takes their turn. After the role plays, give each student a ticket to vote for best actor and best actress.","(2) 角色扮演　例：让学生两两一组，一人当 Small Sally，另一人当 Tiny Tom，念 12.2 的剧本。第一组完成后换第二组。角色扮演结束后，发给每位学生一张选票，票选最佳男演员和最佳女演员。",0],["h3","12.3",null,0],["p","Activity 1: Picture telling Photocopy the pictures, show them to the students, and ask some questions about the pictures. Encourage them to describe what they see in the pictures. Ex:","活动 1：看图说话　复印图片给学生看，问一些关于图片的问题，鼓励他们描述图中看到的东西。例：",0],["p","T.: \"Look at picture one. What was wrong with Bitsy Betty last week?\" Ss.: \"She had a cold last week.\" Activity 2: Picture Telling Relay","T.：\"Look at picture one. What was wrong with Bitsy Betty last week?\"　Ss.：\"She had a cold last week.\"　活动 2：看图说话接力",0],["d","A & B, or more.","Teams",0],["p","Give the students 5 min to prepare, then do the story telling relay. Make sure everyone gets at least one chance. Ex:","给学生 5 分钟准备，然后进行说故事接力，确定每个人至少有一次机会。例：",0],["p","(S1 A holds up the first picture) \"Bitsy Betty had a cold last week.\" (S2 A holds up the second picture) \"She went to the hospital.\" Finally, have the students open their books, read chorally, and fill in the blanks.","（S1 A 举起第一张图）\"Bitsy Betty had a cold last week.\"（S2 A 举起第二张图）\"She went to the hospital.\"　最后让学生打开书齐声念，并填空。",0],["h3","12.4",null,0],["p","Arrange the sentences in the correct order.. Activity: Copy the sentences and read them to the class.","把句子排成正确的顺序。活动：抄下句子并念给全班听。",0],["d","A & B.","Teams",0],["p","Give the students copies of the sentences. Have the students arrange them in the correct order, then read them chorally. Now have the students open their books and finish the exercise individually in their books.","发给学生句子的复印件，让学生排成正确的顺序再齐声念。现在让学生打开书，在书上各自完成练习。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","Let's Check To start the class:","Let's Check　开始上课：",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles. Listening Comprehension:","快速复习上一堂课的对话。老师可以当“A”，让学生当“B”进行对话，再交换角色做一次。听力理解：",0],["p","Listen and connect the students to the right boxes.","听一听，把学生和正确的盒子连起来。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the Let's Check monolog.","播放 Let's Check 独白。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Let's Check Monolog What food do you see in picture? There are pears, kiwis, peaches, cheese balls, fruit salad, bananas, muffins and waffles. Which one do you like the most? The students are taking a break. They brought their lunch boxes. Please turn to page 22. Let's check. Listen and connect the students to the right boxes.","Let's Check 独白　你在图中看到什么食物？有梨子、猕猴桃、桃子、奶酪球、水果沙拉、香蕉、玛芬蛋糕和松饼。你最喜欢哪一个？学生们正在休息，他们带了饭盒。请翻到第 22 页：Let's check。听一听，把学生和正确的盒子连起来。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Review / point out the key words to the class in the listening exercise. Explain the exercise to the students and make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","向全班复习／指出听力练习中的关键字。向学生说明练习方式，确定说明够清楚，让学生能一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["li","●",null,0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons or markers for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带蜡笔或彩笔。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 9","电话教学教材 9",0],["p","See also Telephone Teaching in the front of this manual. Part 1: Greeting Part 2: Q. and A.","另见本手册前面的电话教学。第 1 部分：问候　第 2 部分：问答",0],["li","1. Did you go to the movies last month?","1. Did you go to the movies last month?（你上个月有去看电影吗？）",0],["li","2. What did you do last Sunday?","2. What did you do last Sunday?（你上周日做了什么？）",0],["li","3. What will you do next Sunday?","3. What will you do next Sunday?（你下周日要做什么？）",0],["li","4. Where were you this morning?","4. Where were you this morning?（你今天早上在哪里？）",0],["li","5. Did you study for the big test? Part 3: Ending","5. Did you study for the big test?（你有为大考念书吗？）第 3 部分：结尾",0]],"g":[[40,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson","Part 1","12.1","Part 2","12.2","12.2 A","12.2 B","Part 3","12.3","Part 4","12.4"]],[73,["Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 19 课","t":"Class 19","k":"class","p":[67,68,69],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","Review of previous lessons","复习前几课",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","-Keep your lips closed when you are eating","- 吃东西时闭着嘴巴",1],["li","-Avoid talking when you are eating","- 吃东西时避免说话",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7 B Lesson 13","课堂活动 7B 第 13 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","None","无",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","the digital equipment, a ball","数字设备、一颗球",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 5","EEC 4 第 5 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","pear, kiwi, peach, cheese ball, fruit salad, banana, muffin, waffle",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","May I have a cookie, Kelvin?","A",1],["d","Yes.","B",1],["d","Wow! What flavor is this?","A",1],["p","N:( The girl Keeps talking while she is eating.)","N：（女孩一边吃东西一边说个不停。）",1],["d","Coconut and cream","B",1],["d","It tastes very good. May I have another one, please?","A",1],["p","N: ( The girl contiues to speak).","N：（女孩继续说话。）",1],["d","As many as you want, but don't talk with your mouth full, please.","B",1],["d","Am I disturbing you?","A",1],["d","No. Just keep you mouth closed while you are eating.","B",1],["d","Oops. I'll stop talking now. Sorry.","A",1],["p","N: ( The girl is ashamed and she blushes.)","N：（女孩很不好意思，脸红了。）",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm up (20 mins)","热身（20 分钟）",0],["h3","1.Activity: Vocabulary spelling","1. 活动：单词拼写",0],["p","Game: Crossword:","游戏：填字游戏：",0],["p","Ex: Draw a big grid (like a crossword puzzle but with no black squares) on the board. The teacher begins by writing a word such as \"notebook\". The student from the first team then makes a word beginning with N,O,T,E,B,O,O,or K. The students from each team then alternate trying to make new words (no repeats) from the words on the grid. Words can be written forward, vertically, and diagonally. Three letters are three points, four letters are four points, and so on.","例：在白板上画一个大格子（像填字游戏但没有黑格）。老师先写一个字，例如 \"notebook\"。第一队的学生用 N、O、T、E、B、O、O 或 K 开头组成一个字。各队学生轮流用格子里的字组成新字（不能重复）。字可以横写、直写或斜写。三个字母得三分，四个字母得四分，依此类推。",0],["h3","2.Review C.R., L.9","2. 复习课堂读本第 9 课",0],["p","Activity 1: Read the story chorally. Then do the role play Activity 2: Go to the web site, and have the students look at the story and animation. The teacher can stop at any time and ask the students to say the next word or sentence. Ex:","活动 1：齐声念故事，再做角色扮演。活动 2：进到网站，让学生看故事和动画。老师可以随时暂停，让学生说出下一个字或句子。例：",0],["p","Divide the students into groups, each group containing three or four students.","把学生分组，每组三或四人。",0],["d","\"Tiny Tom and Small Sally were in big...\"(Teacher clicks stop.)","Touchscreen",0],["p","The students raise their hands to say \"trouble\" as quickly as they can. The first one to do so earns a point for his/her team.","学生要尽快举手说出 \"trouble\"，第一个说出的人为自己的队伍得一分。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (55 mins) Lesson 13:","课堂活动（55 分钟）第 13 课：",0],["h2","Please Help Me!","Please Help Me!（请帮帮我！）",0],["h3","13.1 Write the past tense form of the verb and then make a sentence.","13.1 写出动词的过去时，再造一个句子。",0],["p","Go to the web site for 13.1 Make two teams: A & B The teacher goes to the touchscreen all-in-one and clicks on one of the verbs (go, sing, give, etc.) T \"Number 3\" S3 A and B come to the board and write the sentence. Then they repeat the sentence chorally.","进到网站 13.1。分成两队：A 和 B。老师到触控一体机前点其中一个动词（go、sing、give 等）。T：\"Number 3\"　S3 A 和 B 到白板写出句子，然后齐声念出句子。",0],["h3","13.2 Match the sentences and practice the dialogue with a partner","13.2 把句子配对，并和伙伴练习对话",0],["p","Write the questions and answers on the board. Have the students match the corresponding questions and answers. After finishing each Q and A, they should send a representative to come to the touchscreen all-in-one, click the Q and A they matched and have their teammates repeat chorally. The team that finishes the procedure above fastest wins a point.","把问句和答句写在白板上，让学生配对相应的问答。每完成一组问答，就派一位代表到触控一体机前点击配对好的问答，让队友齐声跟念。最快完成上述程序的队伍得一分。",0],["h3","13.3 Look at the pictures and complete Exercise A.","13.3 看图完成练习 A。",0],["p","Go to the web site for 13.3. Point to the pictures (using the mouse) and ask the students the questions. Have the students look at the pictures and answer the questions. Ex.:","进到网站 13.3，用鼠标指着图片问学生问题，让学生看图回答。例：",0],["p","C.: \"Who gave you those flowers?\" Ss.: \"Little Larry did.\".","C.：\"Who gave you those flowers?\"　Ss.：\"Little Larry did.\"",0],["h3","13.3A Read the sentences and write the correct letters in the blanks.","13.3A 读句子，在空格中写出正确的字母。",0],["p","Go to the web site for 13.3A. Present the questions and the possible answers. Have the students choose A or B and write the answer on the board. Ex.:","进到网站 13.3A，呈现问题和可能的答案，让学生选 A 或 B 并把答案写在白板上。例：",0],["d","A & B C.: \"Did you eat all the cookies? A. \"No, I didn't. He did.\" B \"Yes, I did.\"","Teams",0],["p","T \"Number 1.\" S1 A and B come to the board and write A or B.","T：\"Number 1.\"　S1 A 和 B 到白板写 A 或 B。",0],["h3","13.4: Fill in the blanks with \"next\" or \"last.\"","13.4：用 \"next\" 或 \"last\" 填空。",0],["p","Review the use of next and last. Draw a one week calendar on the board. Tell the students, \"Today is Wednesday\". Point at Monday and say, \"I ate dumplings last Monday\" Point at Friday and say, \" I am going to eat pizza next Friday.\" Emphasize that \"next\" refers to the future tense verbs; \"last\" refers to the past tense verbs. Go through the exercise chorally with the students. Then have the students write the answers in their books.","复习 next 和 last 的用法。在白板上画一周的月历，告诉学生 \"Today is Wednesday\"。指着星期一说 \"I ate dumplings last Monday\"，指着星期五说 \"I am going to eat pizza next Friday.\"。强调 \"next\" 搭配将来时动词，\"last\" 搭配过去时动词。和学生齐声做一遍练习，再让学生把答案写在书上。",0],["h3","13.5 Look at the verb chart below and practice.","13.5 看下面的动词表并练习。",0],["p","Review the verbs together and explain the present participle by giving some examples. Ex: walk→walking→walked walk: I walk to school every day. walking: I was walking to school. walked: I walked to school yesterday. Activity: Ball drill","一起复习动词，举例说明现在分词。例：walk→walking→walked　walk：I walk to school every day.　walking：I was walking to school.　walked：I walked to school yesterday.　活动：丢球操练",0],["d","A & B","Teams",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["d","\"walk\" (Throw the ball to S1 A)","T",0],["p","S1 A: \"walking, walked\" If S1 A fails, the teacher draws a sad face for team A. The team that has the fewest sad faces is the winner.","S1 A：\"walking, walked\"　如果 S1 A 答错，老师就为 A 队画一个哭脸。哭脸最少的队伍获胜。",0],["h3","13.6 Old MacDonald Had A Farm","13.6 Old MacDonald Had A Farm（王老先生有块地）",0],["p","Make animal sounds. Go to the web site and play the song. Have the students pass the ball while the song is playing. The student who has the ball when the teacher stops the song should make the sound of the animal that appears in that section.","学动物叫声。进到网站播放歌曲，让学生在歌曲播放时传球。老师暂停歌曲时，拿着球的学生要模仿那一段出现的动物叫声。",0],["h3","See also How To Teach Songs from To The Teachers","另见“给老师”中的如何教歌曲",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate space. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Pair the students up. Have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog for the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front of the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，每组把本单元的对话做成小型角色扮演。每组都要在全班面前示范，老师要确定每个人都能轻松完成对话，也要注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons or markers for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带蜡笔或彩笔。",0]],"g":[[38,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13","13.1","13.2"]],[38,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13","13.3","13.3A"]],[38,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13","13.6"]],[71,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 20 课","t":"Class 20","k":"class","p":[70,71,72,73],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","To use object pronouns and change sentences using the pronouns. To accept or refuse politely. To refer to oneself and to others using pronouns.","使用宾格代词并用代词改写句子；有礼貌地接受或拒绝；用代词指称自己和他人。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Do not scrape the spoon against the plate","- 不要用汤匙刮盘子",1],["li","- Asking for more food","- 要求再多一些食物",1],["li","- Complimenting the cook.","- 称赞做菜的人。",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 10","Classroom Readers 第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","safe, lake, bowl, loud,",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7 B Lesson 14","课堂活动 7B 第 14 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","you, me, him, her",null,1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Object pronouns in conjunction with previous patterns.","宾格代词搭配之前学过的句型。",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","the digital equipment,","数字设备",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 6","EEC 4 第 6 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","pea, steak, mashed potato, parmesan cheese, tomatoe, lettuce, onion, olive",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","What good gravy.","A",1],["d","Do you really like it?","B",1],["d","Yeah. I do.","A",1],["p","N:(The boy scrapes the spoon against the plate, trying to take the last bit of meat and gravy. He scrapes noisily.)","N：（男孩用汤匙刮盘子，想把最后一点肉和肉汁刮起来，刮得很大声。）",1],["d","Oh, son! Don't scrape the spoon against the plate.","B",1],["d","But I want to get every bit. It's so delicious!","A",1],["d","If you really like the food, ask for some more.","B",1],["d","OK. I'll do that.","A",1],["d","So, don't make that noise again","B",1],["d","You're right, mom.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Warm Up(10mins)","热身（10 分钟）",0],["h3","Don't forget to do the spelling quiz.","别忘了做拼写小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins) Lesson 10: Is It a Lake?","课堂读本（30 分钟）第 10 课：Is It a Lake?（那是湖吗？）",0],["p","1.Pre-teach Classroom Readers Lesson 10 Draw a chart like the one below on the board (Subject and object pronouns) I me you you he him she her they them we us Do the oral practice below:","1. 预先教课堂读本第 10 课　在白板上画一张像下面的表（主格和宾格代词）I me　you you　he him　she her　they them　we us　做下面的口语练习：",0],["d","\"I\"","T",0],["p","Ss.: \"me\"","Ss.：\"me\"",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["li","2. Teach Classroom Readers Lesson 10:","2. 教课堂读本第 10 课：",0],["li","(1) Vocabulary:","(1) 单词：",0],["p","Phonics: safe→a-e [eɪ] [s-eɪ-f] [seɪf] bowl→snow[snəʊ],ow[əʊ],[s-n-əʊ] [snəʊ] Now teach the meaning of the words. Use them in sentences. Ex. safe→We are safe now. It is not dangerous here.","自然拼读：safe→a-e [eɪ] [s-eɪ-f] [seɪf]　bowl→snow [snəʊ]，ow [əʊ]，[s-n-əʊ] [snəʊ]　接着教单词的意思并用在句子里。例：safe→We are safe now. It is not dangerous here.",0],["li","(2) Story presentation:","(2) 故事呈现：",0],["p","Go to the web site. Play the animation sentence by sentence. Have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one. Then ask some relevant questions. Ex.:","进到网站，逐句播放动画，让学生跟着触控一体机念，再问一些相关问题。例：",0],["d","\"Everything is OK, Small Sally.\"","C",0],["d","\"Everything is OK, Small Sally.\"","Ss",0],["d","\"Is everything OK?\"","T",0],["d","\"Yes, everything is OK.\"","Ss",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 14: Betty's","课堂活动（35 分钟）第 14 课：Betty's",0],["h2","Apple Pie","Apple Pie（Betty 的苹果派）",0],["h3","14.1 Vocabulary","14.1 单词",0],["p","Go to the web site for lesson 14.1 Quickly review the words using the touchscreen all-in-one.","进到网站第 14.1 课，用触控一体机快速复习单词。",0],["h3","14.2 A Practice the conversation with your classmate","14.2 A 和同学练习对话",0],["p","Read the dialogue chorally. Assign roles to the students. Have them practice the conversation.","齐声念对话，分配角色给学生，让他们练习对话。",0],["h3","14.2 B Look at the pictures and fill in the blanks","14.2 B 看图填空",0],["p","Show the sentence using the touchscreen all-in-one. Then have the students fill in the blanks with object pronouns. Now let's play a game:","用触控一体机展示句子，让学生用宾格代词填空。现在来玩个游戏：",0],["d","A & B The teacher shows a statement and says, \"Number 2\"","Two Teams",0],["p","S2 A and B come to the board and write the object pronoun.","S2 A 和 B 到白板写出宾格代词。",0],["d","paper airplane shooting Assign different point values for various areas of the classroom.","Scoring",0],["p","Ex.: chairs ＋3; desks ＋5; floor ＋0, ...etc. Give the students some paper to fold into airplanes. Let them test their planes. The team that writes the object pronoun correctly can throw two planes. The team that does it correctly and even faster can have an extra airplane. They tally their score by counting the points for the areas they hit.","例：椅子 +3；桌子 +5；地板 +0……等。发给学生一些纸折成纸飞机，让他们试飞。正确写出宾格代词的队伍可以丢两架飞机，写对又更快的队伍可以多丢一架。依打中区域的分数计算总分。",0],["h3","14.3 Change the underlined words to \"her\", \"him\", \"them\", or \"us\"","14.3 把画下划线的字改成 \"her\"、\"him\"、\"them\" 或 \"us\"",0],["li","1. Do the exercise chorally. T.: \"Betty is talking to Small Sally.\" \"Small Sally\" Ss.: \"Betty is talking to her.\"","1. 齐声做练习。T.：\"Betty is talking to Small Sally.\" \"Small Sally\"　Ss.：\"Betty is talking to her.\"",0],["li","2. Write the sentences. T.: (Write \"his brother\" on the board.) \"Tiny Tom is helping his brother.\" \"Number 1\" S1 A and B come to the board and write \"Tiny Tom is helping him.\"","2. 写句子。T.：（在白板上写 \"his brother\"）\"Tiny Tom is helping his brother.\" \"Number 1\"　S1 A 和 B 到白板写 \"Tiny Tom is helping him.\"",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See And Say.","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Introduction:","引导：",0],["p","Have the students listen to the Let's See and Say monolog. You can either read the monolog to the students, or use the MP3. Let's See And Say monolog What dish that your mother cooks do you like the most? How do you behave when you are eating something that you really like? Let's look at what the little boy does when he is eating his favorite dish.","让学生听 Let's See and Say 独白，你可以念给学生听或用 MP3。Let's See And Say 独白　妈妈煮的菜中你最喜欢哪一道？吃到真的很喜欢的东西时，你的举止如何？我们来看看小男孩吃他最爱的菜时做了什么。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the monolog that they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you want to emphasize. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students listen carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson by combining the dialog and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Pair the students up.Have each team practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，每组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3.Encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends.","提醒学生在家听 MP3 复习课程，鼓励他们和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons or markers for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带蜡笔或彩笔。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 1","电话教学教材 1",0],["p","See also Telephone Teaching in the front of this manual. Part 1: Greeting Part 2: Q and A.","另见本手册前面的电话教学。第 1 部分：问候　第 2 部分：问答",0],["li","1. Please make a sentence with \"me\".","1. 请用 \"me\" 造一个句子。",0],["li","2. What's your sister/brother's name? Do you like her/him?","2. What's your sister/brother's name? Do you like her/him?（你姐妹／兄弟叫什么名字？你喜欢她／他吗？）",0],["li","3. Please make a sentence with \"him\".","3. 请用 \"him\" 造一个句子。",0],["li","4. How do you spell \"lake\"?","4. How do you spell \"lake\"?（\"lake\" 怎么拼？）",0],["li","5. Did you go to bed early last night? Part 3: Ending","5. Did you go to bed early last night?（你昨晚很早睡吗？）第 3 部分：结尾",0]],"g":[[32,["儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 10"]],[49,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 14","14.1","14.2B"]],[81,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Is It a Lake?","Betty's"],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 21 课","t":"Class 21","k":"class","p":[74,75,76],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","To use possessives. To use pronouns.","使用所有格；使用代词。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Do not scrape the spoon against the plate","- 不要用汤匙刮盘子",1],["li","- Asking for some more food","- 要求再多一些食物",1],["li","- Talking about good food","- 谈论美味的食物",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 11","Classroom Readers 第 11 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","wow, airplane, just",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 7B Lesson 15","课堂活动 7B 第 15 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","mine, yours, just, hers, theirs, ours",null,1],["h3","Sentence pattern","句型",1],["p","Sentences using possessive pronouns","用所有格代词造句",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","the digital equipment.","数字设备。",1],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 6","EEC 4 第 6 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","pea, steak, mashed potato, parmesan cheese, tomatoe, lettuce, onion, olive",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","What good gravy.","A",1],["d","Do you really like it?","B",1],["d","Yeah. I do.","A",1],["p","N:(The boy scrapes the spoon against the plate, trying to take the last bit of meat and gravy. He scrapes noisily.)","N：（男孩用汤匙刮盘子，想把最后一点肉和肉汁刮起来，刮得很大声。）",1],["d","Oh, son! Don't scrape the spoon against the plate.","B",1],["d","But I want to get every bit. It's so delicious!","A",1],["d","If you really like the food, ask for some more.","B",1],["d","OK. I'll do that.","A",1],["d","So, don't make that noise again","B",1],["d","You're right, mom.","A",1],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",1],["h2","Classroom Activities (10 mins)","课堂活动（10 分钟）",0],["h2","Lesson 15: The Neighborhood","第 15 课：The Neighborhood（社区）",0],["h3","15.4 Practice the pronunciation and fill in the blanks","15.4 练习发音并填空",0],["p","Say the words for the students and let them complete the exercise individually. When they finish, choose some students to come to the board and write the correct spelling.","念出单词给学生听，让他们各自完成练习。完成后选几位学生到白板写出正确拼法。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins) Lesson 11","课堂读本（30 分钟）第 11 课",0],["h2","You Can't Swim There","You Can't Swim There（你不能在那里游泳）",0],["li","1. Pre-teach Classroom Readers L.10 Review the object pronouns with the students. First, draw a chart like the one below :","1. 预先教课堂读本　和学生复习宾格代词。先画一张像下面的表：",0],["p","I me you you he him she her they them we us my (books) mine",null,0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","your (pens) yours her (dog) hers his (classroom) his Now have the students change the sentence using the pronoun chart above. Ex.:","your (pens) yours　her (dog) hers　his (classroom) his　现在让学生用上面的代词表改写句子。例：",0],["p","T \"This is my book. Ss.: \"This book is mine\"","T：\"This is my book.\"　Ss.：\"This book is mine.\"",0],["h3","2.Teach Classroom Readers, Lesson 11","2. 教课堂读本第 11 课",0],["li","(1) Vocabulary:","(1) 单词：",0],["p","(a)Phonetic spelling: (SARAH, PLEASE FILL IN THIS PART. THANKS, SHAUN) (b)Now teach the meaning. Use the words in sentences.","(a) 音标拼写（此部分原稿未填写）(b) 接着教意思，把单词用在句子里。",0],["li","(2) Story presentation:","(2) 故事呈现：",0],["p","Go to the website. Play the animated story sentence by sentence. Have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one. Now ask them some related questions.","进到网站，逐句播放动画故事，让学生跟着触控一体机念，再问他们一些相关问题。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 15:","课堂活动（35 分钟）第 15 课：",0],["p","The Neighborhood","The Neighborhood（社区）",0],["h2","15.1 Vocabulary","15.1 单词",0],["p","Go to the web site for 15.1. Quickly review the words using the touchscreen all-in-one.","进到网站 15.1，用触控一体机快速复习单词。",0],["h2","15.2 A Look at the picture and practice.","15.2 A 看图练习。",0],["p","Go to the web site for Classroom Activities 15.2. Show the pictures using the touchscreen all-in-one. Write the sentences on the board:","进到网站课堂活动 15.2，用触控一体机展示图片，把句子写在白板上：",0],["p","(Name) lives here. This house is (possessive pronoun) . (pronoun) house is (color) . Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and practice the sentences chorally.","（名字）lives here. This house is（所有格代词）. （代词）house is（颜色）.　让学生看触控一体机齐声练习句子。",0],["h2","15.2 B Fill in the blanks and practice the dialogue","15.2 B 填空并练习对话",0],["p","Photocopy the exercise and cut out all four statements. Two teams: A & B Put the slips into a bag. Have the teams choose a slip and fill in the blanks on the slip. The team to do it correctly and fastest win a point.","复印练习并剪下四个句子。分两队：A 和 B。把纸条放进袋子，让各队抽一张并填空，最快填对的队伍得一分。",0],["h2","15.3 Change the sentences below following the example.","15.3 照例子改写下面的句子。",0],["p","Go through the statements chorally. Then do the writing exercise.","齐声念一遍句子，再做书写练习。",0],["d","A & B T Write \"your presents\" on the board.","Teams",0],["p","\"These are your presents. Number 1.\" S1 A&B come to the board and write the first word of the sentence. They pass the marker to S2 A&B S2 A&B come to the board and write the second word of the sentence. They pass the","\"These are your presents. Number 1.\"　S1 A 和 B 到白板写句子的第一个字，再把白板笔传给 S2 A 和 B。S2 A 和 B 到白板写句子的第二个字，再把",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["p","marker to S3 A&B ...and so on.","白板笔传给 S3 A 和 B……依此类推。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","Let's Check To start the class:","Let's Check　开始上课：",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles. Listening Comprehension:","快速复习上一堂课的对话。老师可以当“A”，让学生当“B”进行对话，再交换角色做一次。听力理解：",0],["p","It's luchtime. Mrs. Wang is preparing Tony's dish. Listen and check what he wants to eat.","午餐时间到了。王太太正在准备 Tony 的餐点。听一听，勾出他想吃什么。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the Let's Check monolog. Let's Check: Monolog We can see different food on the table. There are peas, steak, mashed potatoes, parmesan cheese, tomatoes, lettuce, onions and olives. Mmm...yummy. Which one would you like to try? Please turn to page 26; Let's Check. It's luchtime. Mrs. Wang is preparing Tony's food. Listen and find out what he wants to eat.","播放 Let's Check 独白。Let's Check：独白　桌上有各种食物：豌豆、牛排、土豆泥、帕尔马奶酪、番茄、生菜、洋葱和橄榄。嗯……好好吃。你想试试哪一样？请翻到第 26 页：Let's Check。午餐时间到了。王太太正在准备 Tony 的食物。听一听，找出他想吃什么。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Review the key words that are in the listening exercise. Explain the exercise. Have the students do the exercise while listening to the MP3.","复习听力练习中的关键字，说明练习方式，让学生一边听 MP3 一边做练习。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","继续为全班播放 MP3 做听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog to the class again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to take crayons or markers for the next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带蜡笔或彩笔。",0]],"g":[[32,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 15","15.4"]],[36,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Readers","Lesson 11","Reader"]],[47,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童高阶","Lesson V","Book 7","Classroom Activities","Lesson 15","15.1","15.2A"]],[78,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["The Neighborhood"],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 22 课","t":"Class 22","k":"class","p":[77,78],"b":[["h2","Review Day 3","复习日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","Review for Test 3","准备测验 3",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["li","- Do not scrape the spoon against the plate","- 不要用汤匙刮盘子",0],["li","- Asking for some more food","- 要求再多一些食物",0],["li","- Talking about good food","- 谈论美味的食物",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","flashcards, tape recorder, S4 listening lab tape, copies of the test Classroom Readers","单词卡、录音机、S4 听力练习录音带、测验卷复印件。Classroom Readers",0],["h3","Review lesson 9 to lesson 11","复习第 9 课到第 11 课",0],["p","Classroom Activities",null,0],["h3","Review lesson 11 to lesson 15","复习第 11 课到第 15 课",0],["h3","EEC 4 Lesson 6","EEC 4 第 6 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","pea, steak, mashed potato, parmesan cheese, tomatoe, lettuce, onion, olive",null,0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","What good gravy.","A",0],["d","Do you really like it?","B",0],["d","Yeah. I do.","A",0],["p","N: (The boy scrapes the spoon against the plate, trying to take the last bit of meat and gravy. He scrapes noisily.)","N：（男孩用汤匙刮盘子，想把最后一点肉和肉汁刮起来，刮得很大声。）",0],["d","Oh, son! Don't scrape the spoon against the plate.","B",0],["d","But I want to get every bit. It's so delicious!","A",0],["d","If you really like the food, ask for some more.","B",0],["d","OK. I'll do that.","A",0],["d","So, don't make that noise again.","B",0],["d","Yoou're right, mom.","A",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review (20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use this time to catch up on lessons or areas some students did not have time for in the first six classes. If the students are caught up, spend this time reviewing previous lessons or areas where the students seem to be having difficulty. You can do this using drills, games, or any activity that you think will help the students. Choose those that the students seem to like.","(1) 利用这段时间补上前六堂课中部分学生没来得及完成的课程或内容。如果学生都跟上了，就用这段时间复习前几课，或学生似乎有困难的地方。可以用操练、游戏或任何你认为对学生有帮助的活动，挑学生似乎喜欢的。",0],["li","(2) Review all the vocabulary.","(2) 复习所有单词。",0],["li","(3) Review all the sentence patterns.","(3) 复习所有句型。",0],["li","(4) Review all the phonics material.","(4) 复习所有发音内容。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Have the students put all books and unnecessary things away. Hand out the quiz and have the students take it.","1. 请学生把所有书本和不需要的东西收起来，发下考卷让学生作答。",0],["li","(2) Make sure that the students understand each item.","(2) 确定学生理解每个项目。",0],["li","(3) Walk around the classroom and give help if necessary.","(3) 在教室里走动，必要时给予协助。",0],["li","(4) The students may not talk or cheat during the quiz. If the students don't get good grades, they have to make it up in the next class (Teachers can have their own grading standard).","(4) 小测验时学生不能说话或作弊。成绩不理想的学生，下次上课要补考（老师可以自定评分标准）。",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (30 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Check the tape and the recorder before the students come back from break. Prepare for the listening quiz.","(1) 在学生下课休息回来前，先检查录音带和录音机，准备听力小测验。",0],["li","(2) Turn on the tape and have the students fill in the appropriate blanks.","(2) 播放录音带，请学生在适当的空格中作答。",0],["li","(3) Play the tape a few times. The students need to listen carefully.","(3) 录音带可以多播几次，学生要仔细听。",0],["li","(4) Listening is a very important aspect of learning a new language.","(4) 听力是学习新语言非常重要的一环。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and have the students check the appropriate space. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Pair the students up. Have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog for this unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front of the class, and the teacher needs to make sure the students can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，每组把本单元的对话做成小型角色扮演。每组都要在全班面前示范，老师要确定学生能轻松完成对话，也要注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement ( 5 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（5 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview the homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they understand.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board. Let the students write them down in their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their team's performance.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students about test # 3.","(3) 提醒学生准备测验 3。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 11","电话教学教材 11",0],["li","1. What number is between 19 and 21 ?",null,0],["li","2. Can you play the piano and guitar?",null,0],["li","3. Please spell (any vocabulary from the lessons)?","3. 请拼出（课程中的任一单词）。",0],["li","4. Where is number 45? (WHAT DOES THIS Q MEAN?)","4. Where is number 45?（45 号在哪里？）",0],["li","5. How much were your shoes? (How much did your shoes cost?)","5. How much were your shoes? (How much did your shoes cost?)（你的鞋子多少钱？）",0]],"g":[[27,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11- Lesson 15","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 9- Lesson 11"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":100},{"z":"第 23 课","t":"Class 23","k":"class","p":[79],"b":[["h2","Test Day 3","测验日 3",0],["p","Classroom Readers 7","课堂读本 7",0],["d","Lesson 9 to Lesson 11 Classroom Activities 7B","Test",0],["d","Lesson 11 to Lesson 15","Test",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Review (40 mins)","复习（40 分钟）",0],["li","1. Return the corrected quizzes and listening lab tests. Remind your students about the mistakes they have made. Help them understand the correct answers.","1. 发还批改好的小测验和听力测验，提醒学生犯过的错误，帮助他们理解正确答案。",0],["li","2. Use this time to review for the test. Review sentence patterns or other areas that may need it. Ask the students if they have any questions. Don't forget to practice for the oral test.","2. 利用这段时间考前复习，复习句型或其他需要加强的部分。问学生有没有问题，别忘了练习口试。",0],["h2","Test (50 mins)","测验 Test（50 mins）",0],["p","The students should take the entire class to complete the test. Clarify any areas that seem unclear to the students. If they finish early, tell them to study for the oral test quietly.","学生应该会用整堂课完成测验。回答学生对任何不清楚部分的问题。如果提早写完，请他们安静地准备口语测验。",0],["h2","Oral Test (3-5 mins per student)","口语测验 Oral Test（每位学生 3–5 分钟）",0],["p","Ask the students to take out their textbooks and review for the oral test. It's better to do the oral test outside of the classroom so that the other students won't hear. Make sure you don't go too far away from your classroom so you can still keep an eye on your students. Call the students one by one to come out and take the oral test with you. The oral test should account for 20% of the test's total score. However, how many points each questions should be worth is your decision. You may choose to give some questions more points based on the difficulty of the question. The following is a sample oral test for your reference. It's also a good idea to come up with your own oral test, since you know the students' strengths and weaknesses. The Oral Test","请学生拿出课本准备口语测验。最好在教室外进行口语测验，以免其他学生听到题目；但不要离教室太远，才能随时注意学生。一个一个叫学生出来和您进行口语测验。口语测验占测验总分的 20%，但每题配分由您决定，可以依题目难易给某些题目较高的分数。以下口语测验范例仅供参考；您最了解学生的强项和弱点，自己设计口语测验也是很好的做法。口语测验题目：",0],["h3","1. Turn to Lesson 11 and point to runner # 11.","1. 翻到第 11 课，指着 11 号跑者。",0],["h3","Where is number 11?",null,0],["h3","2. Turn to Lesson 12 and use the picture, \"At the Night Market\"","2. 翻到第 12 课，使用“At the Night Market”的图片。",0],["h3","How much is an apple?",null,0],["h3","3. How much are the flowers?",null,0],["h3","4. Give the student an imperative and ask them to do it.","4. 给学生一个祈使句指令，请他照做。",0],["h3","Have them give you a command.","再请学生给您下一个指令。",0],["li","5. Have the student make a sentence using \"can\" and \"can't\" and the conjunction","5. 请学生用 \"can\"、\"can't\" 和连词",0],["h3","\"but\".","\"but\" 造句。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write down the quiz and listening test grades in their report book and ask them to get signatures from their parents. Ask them to write the correct answer 5-10 times for every mistake they' ve made on the two quizzes.","(1) 把小测验和听力成绩写在学习进度手册上，请学生带回家给家长签名。也请学生把两次小测验中每个错误的正确答案写 5–10 次。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report book individually and give each student some comments or encouragement in it.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。（无）",0]],"g":[[5,["None"]],[8,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":100},{"z":"第 24 课","t":"Class 24","k":"class","p":[80],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 3","活动日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","To go on a field trip To correct Test 3 To prepare for PTA Night Activity Sheet No.7","户外教学；订正第 3 次考试；准备家长之夜　活动单 7",0],["h3","Teaching Procedure","教学流程",0],["h2","Test Review(40mins)","考试讲评（40 分钟）",0],["p","After you have handed out the test, ask the students to quietly check their mistakes and tell them to try to correct the mistakes by themselves. Go over some of the most commonly made mistakes and explain the key grammar points again.","发下测验卷后，请学生安静地检查自己的错误，并试着自己订正。讲评一些最常见的错误，再说明一次重要的语法重点。",0],["h3","Activity Sheet No.7","活动单 7",0],["h2","Outing (55 mins)","户外活动（55 分钟）",0],["p","Since this is their last class of level 7 and everything is finished, the teacher can find a park near the school and have a picnic with games. Ask the students to bring some snacks for the picnic. Also bring some toys like frisbees, kites, etc. It's a good time to review a little bit of everything in level 7 with the food they bring and anything you see in the park. Make sure to remind the kids to \"Study hard, and play hard!\" Here is an activity the teacher can use for the outing - Play a game of \"Capture the Flag\". Prepare some handkerchiefs before going to the park. Separate the students into two teams and let the teams face each other before starting the game. The rule is easy. Each student will have a handkerchief hanging out from his pocket. To win, the teams must try to grab all the handkerchiefs from the other team.","这是 Level 7 的最后一堂课，所有内容都已完成，老师可以找学校附近的公园，和学生野餐玩游戏。请学生带一些野餐点心，也带一些玩具，例如飞盘、风筝等。这是用他们带来的食物和公园里看到的东西，稍微复习 Level 7 各项内容的好时机。一定要提醒孩子们“认真读书，尽情玩乐！”以下是户外活动可用的游戏——“抢旗子”：去公园前准备一些手帕。把学生分成两队，开始前让两队面对面。规则很简单：每位学生的口袋都挂着一条手帕，要赢就得抢走对方队伍所有的手帕。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (5 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（5 mins）",0],["h2","Progress Report Book","学习进度手册",0],["li","(1) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(1) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(2) Tell them to preview for the next lesson and listen to the tapes at home.","(2) 请学生回家预习下一课并听录音带。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students that there will be a telephone teaching session tonight.","(3) 提醒学生今晚有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 12","电话教学教材 12",0],["li","1. What number is between 22 and 24?","1. What number is between 22 and 24?（22 和 24 之间是哪个数字？）",0],["li","2. Pleae make a sentence with don't.","2. 请用 don't 造一个句子。",0],["li","3. Make a sentence with please?","3. 用 \"please\" 造句。",0],["li","4. How do you spell \"seventeen\"?",null,0],["li","5. How do you spell \"trumpet\"?",null,0]],"g":[[4,["None"]],[7,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":100},{"z":"作业本解答","t":"Homework Exercises Answers","k":"img","p":[81,82,83,84,85],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"语法总整理","t":"Grammar Summaries","k":"img","p":[86,87,88,89],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"EEC“Let's Check”解答","t":"EEC \"Let's Check\" Answers","k":"img","p":[90],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"评估表解答","t":"Evaluation Sheet Answers","k":"img","p":[91],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0}];